#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To run &kile;, you need to have the following components installed on your "
"system:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste pokrenuli &kile;, potrebno je da imate instalirane slijedeće "
"komponente na Vašem sistemu:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/\">K Desktop environment (&kde;)</ulink>: "
"&kde; is a popular open-source desktop environment."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/\">K Desktop okruženje (&kde;)</ulink>: "
"&kde; je popularno open-source okruženje radne površine."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.qtsoftware.com/products/\">&Qt;</ulink>: &Qt; is a C+"
"+ &GUI; and network library needed to compile &kile;."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.qtsoftware.com/products/\">&Qt;</ulink>: &Qt; je C++ "
"&GUI; i mrežna biblioteka potrebna da se kompajlira &kile;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.ctan.org/\">&latex;</ulink>: high-quality document "
"typesetting program. Most likely you want the &texlive; (or on older systems "
"the &tetex;) package, if you are on a Unix-like system."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.ctan.org/\">&latex;</ulink>:visokokvalitetan program "
"za typesetting dokumenta. Najvjerovatnije želite &texlive; (ili na starijim "
"sistemima &tetex;) paket, ako ste na  &UNIX;i sličnim sistemima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most of these items might be included in your &Linux; distribution; please "
"refer to your distribution documentation, or refer to your installation &CD; "
"or DVD, for adding these packages to your computer."
msgstr ""
"Većina ovih stavki može biti uključena u Vašu &Linux; distribuciju; molimo "
"pogledajte Vašu distribucijsku dokumentaciju, ili &CD; i DVD instalaciju, da "
"dodate ove pakete na Vaš računar."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; might also be available as a pre-compiled package for your &Linux; "
"distribution already. Please check with the package manager of your "
"distribution."
msgstr ""
"&kile; također može biti dostupan i kao unaprijed kompajliran paket za Vašu "
"&Linux; distribuciju. Molimo provjerite sa paket menadžerom Vaše "
"distribucije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Intended Audience"
msgstr "Ciljani auditorij"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This manual is intended for any individual, regardless of her or his "
"experience with &latex;, &kde;, &kile; or &Linux;."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj priručnik je namijenjen svakom pojedincu, nezavisno od njegovog/njenog "
"iskustva sa &latex;, &kde;, &kile; or &Linux;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Advanced users are not likely to read this manual, but all suggestions on "
"documentation will be considered. If you would like to contribute to this "
"project or the documentation, please consult the <ulink url=\"http://kile."
"sourceforge.net/\">&kile; web page</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Napredni korisnici vjerovatno neće čitati ovaj priručnik, ali sve sugestije "
"vezane za dokumentaciju će biti razmotrene. Ako želite da doprinesete ovom "
"projektu ili dokumentaciji, molimo Vas da se obratite na <ulink url=\"http://"
"kile.sourceforge.net/\">&kile; web page</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do you need answers about &kile;? Are you stuck with the compilation "
"process? Do you want to see a new feature implemented? The preferred way to "
"ask technical questions or to start a discussion is to use our mailing list: "
"<email>kile-devel@lists.sourceforge.net</email>."
msgstr ""
"Trebate li odgovore o &kile;? Da li imate poteškoća sa procesom kompilacije? "
"Da li želite da vidite implementirana nova svojstva? Najbolji način za "
"postavljanja tehničkih pitanja i pokretanje diskusije je korištenje naše "
"mailing liste: <email>kile-devel@lists.sourceforge.net</email>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic facts"
msgstr "Osnovne činjenice"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "About &kile;"
msgstr "O &kile;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; is an integrated &latex; environment for the &kde; desktop. &kile; "
"gives you the ability to use all the functionalities of &latex; in a "
"graphical interface, giving you easy, immediate, and customized access to "
"all programs for &latex; code-completion, compiling, postprocessing, "
"debugging, conversion and viewing tools; you also get very handy wizards, a "
"&latex; reference and a powerful project management."
msgstr ""
"&kile; je integrisano &latex; okruženje za &kde; radnu površinu. &kile; Vam "
"daje mogućnost korištenja svih funkcionalnosti &latex; -a u grafičkom "
"interfejsu (sučelju), dajući Vam jednostavan,neposredan i prilagođen pristup "
"svim programima za &latex; komplilacija koda, kompajliranje, obrada, "
"debagiranje, konverzija i alati za pregled;također dobijate veoma korisne "
"wizarde, &latex; reference i snažne projektne menadžere."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kile; and the &kate; Editor Component"
msgstr "&kile; i &kate; komponenta editora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; is based on the &kate; editor component, i.e. a lot of its editing "
"capabilities stem from the &kate; editor component itself. &kile; extends "
"these capabilities with features to edit &latex; documents. To learn more "
"about the &kate; editor component and its capabilities, see the <ulink url="
"\"http://kate-editor.org\">&kate; webpage</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&kile; je zasnovan na &kate; komponenti editora, &ie; mnogo njenih "
"mogućnosti uređivanja naslijeđeno je upravo iz &kate; komponente editora. "
"&kile; proširuje ove mogućnosti sa komponentama za uređivanje  &latex;  "
"dokumenata. Ukoliko želite znati više o &kate; komponenti editora i njenim "
"mogućnostima, pogledajte na  <ulink url=\"http://kate-editor.org\">&kate; "
"webpage</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is &latex;?"
msgstr "Šta je &latex;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&latex; is a text-processing system derived from &tex;, a program developed "
"originally in 1977 by Donald Knuth to help layout text in a professional way "
"and obtain a layout quality that is on par with the work of a professional "
"typesetter. &latex; was created by Leslie Lamport to give authors an "
"automatic typesetter, especially to ease the expensive and painstaking "
"process of typesetting of mathematical formulas and expressions, which are "
"enclosed within dollar signs in &latex; <emphasis>for a reason</emphasis>. "
"Today, word-processing programs let any user act as typesetter, but what is "
"often needed is a document that simply looks good without having to spend "
"hours to bring it into shape. &latex; takes that burden on its shoulders, "
"and lets you concentrate on the document instead of on the layout. And yes, "
"it <emphasis>will</emphasis> look good!"
msgstr ""
"&latex; je sistem za procesiranje teksta izveden it  &tex;-a, programa "
"razvijenog izvorno 1977. od strane Donalda Knutha da pomogne pri "
"rapoređivanju teksta na profesionalan način, te da kvalitet rasporeda parira "
"radu profesionalnih typesettera. &latex; je kreiran od strane Leslie Lamport "
"da pruži autorima automatski typesetter, naročito zbog pojednostavljenja "
"skupog i mukotrpnog procesa typesettinga matematskih formula i izraza, koji "
"su priloženi uz znak dolara u &latex;-u <emphasis>s razlogom</emphasis>. "
"Danas, programi za procesiranje teksta dopuštaju svakom korisniku da bude "
"typesetter,ali ono što se najčešće traži je dokument koji jednostavno "
"izgleda dobro, a ne zahtijeva višesatno uređivanje. &latex; preuzima taj "
"teret na svoja ramena, i dozvoljava Vam da se fokusirate na dokument, "
"umjesto na njegov izgled. I da ,<emphasis>izgledat će</emphasis> dobro!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do you pronounce it? Why that strange typesetting?"
msgstr "Kako se izgovara? Zašto tako čudan typesetting?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is a funny tradition of &tex;-related packages to have the strangest "
"pronunciation and typesetting possible. &tex; was supposed to be brought in "
"from the Greek <emphasis>τεχ</emphasis>, in Latin letters <emphasis>tech</"
"emphasis>. There are a lot of explanations why, but most likely it is "
"because &tex; was originally conceived for technical reports, and indeed its "
"foremost ability was the correct and easy typesetting of mathematical "
"formulae, then an extremely expensive, time-consuming and frustrating "
"business."
msgstr ""
"Postoji smiješna tradicija &tex;-povezanih paketa da imaju najčudniji mogući "
"izgovor i typesetting.. &tex; je trebao biti izveden iz Grčkog "
"<emphasis>τεχ</emphasis>, na Latinici <emphasis>tech</emphasis>. Postoji "
"mnogo objašnjenja zašto je to tako, ali najvjerovatnije jer je &tex; izvorno "
"smišljen za tehničke izvještaje, i njegova naistaknutija sposobnost je bila "
"korekcija i jednostavan typesetting matematskih formula, a zatim iznimno "
"skupi, vremenski zahtjevni i frustrirajući poslovi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The pronunciation is supposed to be as follows: <emphasis>T</emphasis> as "
"you would expect, <emphasis>E</emphasis> as in <emphasis>get</emphasis>, and "
"<emphasis>X</emphasis> as in the German i<emphasis>ch</emphasis>. If you do "
"not know what <emphasis>ch</emphasis> sounds like, it is more or less like "
"the sound a hissing cat produces; the IPA symbol is /ç/. Many people report "
"a different pronunciation of <emphasis>ach</emphasis> (IPA symbol /x/), but "
"according to some Greeks, the first version is indeed correct. You should be "
"aware that a lot of people mispronounce &tex; as /teks/ or /tek/."
msgstr ""
"Izgovor je trebao biti slijedeći: <emphasis>T</emphasis> kao što i "
"očekujete, <emphasis>E</emphasis> kao u <emphasis>get</emphasis>,i "
"<emphasis>X</emphasis> kao u njemačkom <emphasis>ch</emphasis>Ako ne znate "
"kako zvuči <emphasis>ch</emphasis>,to je više-manje zvuk siktanja mačke; IPA "
"simbol je /ç/. Mnogo ljudi je prijavilo različit izgovor sloga "
"<emphasis>ach</emphasis> (IPA symbol /x/), ali po nekim Grcima, prva verzija "
"je tačna. Trebate biti svjesni da mnogo ljudi pogrešno izgovara &tex; kao /"
"teks/ ili /tek/."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Last, in &latex; the first L<superscript>A</superscript> is pronounced as "
"<emphasis>lay</emphasis>: the idea being, while raw &tex; is difficult, even "
"a <emphasis>lay</emphasis>man can use &latex; macros. A less inspiring, but "
"more realistic explanation is that it stems from the surname of Leslie "
"Lamport, the creator of &latex;. Now you know!"
msgstr ""
"Naposljetku, u &latex; prvo L<superscript>A</superscript> se izgovara kao "
"<emphasis>lay</emphasis>: dok je sirovo &tex; komplikovano, čak i  "
"<emphasis>lay</emphasis>može koristiti &latex; makroe. Najmanje inspirativno,"
"ali mnogo realističnije objašnjenje je da je izvedeno iz prezimena Leslie "
"Lamport, kreatorice &latex;-a. Sada znate!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "&latex; 101"
msgstr "&latex; 101"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &latex; typesetting system is similar to other markup languages such as "
"&XML;, which is used in many types of documents (including the one you are "
"reading), or &HTML;, which is used for web pages. The general idea behind "
"markup languages is to have special keywords, called <emphasis> tags</"
"emphasis>, that tell a program (a word processor, a web browser, or the "
"&latex; compiler) how to the text enclosed within the tags is to be "
"interpreted. &kile; offers a number of such tags in the <guimenu>LaTeX</"
"guimenu> menu in the menu bar."
msgstr ""
"&latex; sistem typesettinga je sličan ostalim markup jezicima kao što je "
"&XML;, koji se koristi u raznim tipovima dokumenata (uključujući i ovaj koji "
"upravo čitate), ili  &HTML;, koji se koristi za web stranice. Generalna "
"ideja markup jezika je da ima specijalne ključne riječi. nazvane <emphasis> "
"tagovi</emphasis>, koji govore programu (procesoru riječi, pretraživaču ili "
"&latex; kompajleru) kako da interpretira tekst priložen unutar tagova. "
"&kile; nudi veliki broj takvih tagova u  <guimenu>LaTeX</guimenu> meniju u "
"meni baru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While we will try to give you a good idea of what &latex; is, this document "
"is, of course, not The Definitive Book on &latex;. If you want to learn "
"&latex; in depth, you may want to borrow a specialized book from your local "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Dok pokušavamo da Vam damo osnovnu ideju o &latex;-u , ovaj dokument , "
"naravno  ,nije Konačna Knjiga o &latex;-u. Ako želite da učite o &latex;-u "
"detaljno, možete posuditi specijalizovanu literaturu iz lokalne biblioteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As any other markup language, &latex; documents contain a "
"<emphasis>preamble</emphasis>, which defines global properties, such as "
"paper size, page numbering, dimensions of the text on the page, and a "
"document <emphasis>body</emphasis>, which contains the text of the document. "
"The preamble is composed at least of the <userinput>\\documentclass</"
"userinput> command. It precedes the document body, which starts with the "
"command <userinput>\\begin{document}</userinput> is concluded with the "
"command <userinput>\\end{document}</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Kao i bilo koji drugi markup jezik, &latex; dokument sadrži  <emphasis>uvod</"
"emphasis>, koji definira globalna svojstva, kao što su veličina papira, "
"numeracija stranica, dimenzije teksta na stranici i dokument "
"<emphasis>tijelo</emphasis>, koji sadrži teskt dokumenta. Uvod je sastavljen "
"bar od  <userinput>\\documentclass</userinput> komande. On prethodi tijelu "
"dokumenta, koje počinje sa komandom  <userinput>\\begin{document}</"
"userinput> ,a završava sa komandom <userinput>\\end{document}</userinput>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kile;'s Main Features"
msgstr "Osnovna svojstva &kile;-a"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:248 index.docbook:1706
#, no-c-format
msgid "QuickStart Wizard"
msgstr "Čarobnjak za brzi start"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The QuickStart wizard built into &kile; is a useful feature to quickly start "
"creating documents in &kile;. Choosing the wizard from the menubar gives you "
"several choices for the creation of your document. You can also specify some "
"options related to the document right away."
msgstr ""
"The QuickStart wizard ugrađen &kile; je korisno svojstvo za brz početak  "
"kreiranja dokumenata u &kile;-u. Izabiranje wizarda u meni baru daje vam "
"nekoliko izbora za kreiranje dokumenta. Također, možete odmah specificirati "
"neke opcije vezane za dokument."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "Class options:"
msgstr "Opcije klasa:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Document Class</guilabel>: choose the type of document you want to "
"create: article, book, letter, report, scrartcl, scrreprt, scrbook, prosper, "
"beamer or other custom-defined."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Klasa dokumenta</guilabel>:izaberite tip dokumenta koji želite da "
"kreirate: članak, pismo, izvještaj, skriptni članak, skriptni izvještaj, "
"skriptna knjiga, slajdovi (prosper, beamer) ili ostalo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Typeface Size</guilabel>: tell &kile; what point size (pt) you "
"want to use."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Veličina tipografije</guilabel>: recite &kile;-u koju (pt) "
"veličinu  želite da koristite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Paper Size</guilabel>: choose the size or style of sheets."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Veličina papira</guilabel>: izaberite veličinu ili stil stranica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Encoding</guilabel>: In general it is a good idea to use your "
"system's standard encoding. Modern systems now move more and more to UTF-8 "
"as the standard encoding. If you can, use utf8 or utf8x (which is indeed the "
"correct spelling for &latex; documents)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kodiranje</guilabel>:Generalno,korištenje standarnog kodiranja "
"Vašeg sistema je dobra ideja. Moderni sistemi sve više i više idu ka UTF-8 "
"kao standardnom kodiranju. Ako možete, koristite utf8 ili utf8x (koji ima "
"ispravan speling za  &latex; dokumente)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Other options</guilabel>: this allows you to set further options "
"such as printing, draft, and others."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ostale opcije</guilabel>: ovo Vam omogućava da postavite opcije "
"kao što su printanje, skiciranje i slično."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "Paketi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This lists some of the most common additional packages used in &latex;. "
"Select the check box to include it."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje su izlistani najčešći dodatni paketi koji se koriste u &latex;-u. "
"Označite okvir da uključite paket."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document Properties"
msgstr "Podešavanje dokumenta:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Author</guilabel>: put your name here."
msgstr "<guilabel>Autor</guilabel>: unesite Vaše ime."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Title</guilabel>: add the document title here."
msgstr "<guilabel>Naslov</guilabel>: dodajte naslov dokumenta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Date</guilabel>: specify the date."
msgstr "<guilabel>Datum</guilabel>: specificirajte datum."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Predefined Templates"
msgstr "Unaprijed definirani predlošci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "The predefined templates in &kile; are:"
msgstr "Unaprijed definirani predlošci u  &kile;-u su:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Empty document: real freaks start from scratch!"
msgstr "Prazan dokument: pravi frikovi počinju od škrabotine!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Article: sets the article format, for a document short enough not to be "
"broken down to chapters."
msgstr ""
"Članak: postavlja format članka, za dokument, dovoljno kratak da se ne može "
"razbiti na poglavlja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Report: sets the report format, for a middle-sized document, with, for "
"example, page numbering on the page's outer edge."
msgstr ""
"Izvještaj: postavlja format izvještaja, za srednje-velik dokument, sa, "
"naprimjer, numeracijom stranice na vanjskoj ivici iste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Book: sets the book format, a full-fledged flavor, so powerful that it is "
"used to write many university textbooks."
msgstr ""
"Knjiga: postavlja format knjige, samostalnog izgleda, toliko moćan da se "
"koristi za pisanje većine univerzitetskih udžbenika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid "Letter: sets the letter format."
msgstr "Pismo: postavlja format pisma."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Beamer, HA-Prosper: create nice presentations in PDF with a superior look "
"and all &latex; power."
msgstr ""
"Beamer, HA-Prosper: kreira prezentacije u PDF formatu, sa superiornim "
"izgledom  i &latex; snagom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Powerdot: Powerdot is the follower of the packages <userinput>seminar</"
"userinput> and <userinput>HA-Prosper</userinput>. It does not have as many "
"options as Beamer, but it is easy to use and it can create really nice "
"presentations in PDF."
msgstr ""
"Powerdot: Powerdot je sljedbenik paketa <userinput>seminar</userinput> and "
"<userinput>HA-Prosper</userinput>.  Nema mnogo opcija kao Beamer, al je "
"jednostavan za korištenje,te može kreirati veoma lijepe prezentacije u PDF "
"formatu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scrartcl, Scrbook, Scrreprt, Scrlttr2: the KOMA-Script document classes, "
"especially adapted to German typography. Use them whenever you write German "
"texts."
msgstr ""
"Scrartcl, Scrbook, Scrreprt, Scrlttr2: KOMA-Script klase dokumenta, "
"specijalno adaptirane za njemačku tipografiju. Koristite ih kadgod pišete "
"njemačke tekstove."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Xelatex: an modified <userinput>Article</userinput> template to use with "
"<userinput>XeLaTeX</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Xelatex: modifikovani <userinput>Članak</userinput> predložak za korištenje "
"sa  <userinput>XeLaTeX</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that all of these templates can be adjusted to the user's requirements."
msgstr ""
"Primjetite da svi predlošci mogu biti prilagođeni zahtjevima korisnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"New users need not worry: this list is just a brief description of the "
"available features, and a more detailed description can be found in <xref "
"linkend=\"quickstart\" role=\"select: title pageabbrv\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Novi korisnici ne treba da se brinu: ova lista je samo kratak opis dostupnih "
"komponenti, a mnogo detaljniji opisi mogu biti nađeni na <xref linkend="
"\"quickstart\" role=\"select: title pageabbrv\"/>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Syntax Highlighting"
msgstr "Naglašavanje rečenice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; is similar to other programs that deal with source code and editing, "
"and will automatically highlight commands, options and items that are used "
"(and abused). &kile; makes it possible to easily spot problematic areas: for "
"example, if you see major areas of text turn green, it is likely that you "
"forgot closing a math environment somewhere."
msgstr ""
"&kile; je sličan ostalim programima koji se bave izvornim kodom i "
"uređivanjem, i on će automatski istaći komande, opcije i stavke koje se "
"koriste (i zloupotrebljavaju). &kile; ima mogućnost da vrlo jednostavno "
"primjeti problematična područja: naprimjer, ukoliko primjetite da ogromne "
"količine teksta odjednom postanu zelene, vjerovatno ste negdje zaboravili "
"zatvoriti matematsko okruženje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-Completion of Environments"
msgstr "Automatko završavanje okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The auto-completion of environments means that, when you begin a new "
"environment by typing <userinput>\\begin{environment}</userinput>, &kile; "
"will automatically insert a matching <userinput>\\end{environment}</"
"userinput> command, with a line in between them for your text. You can of "
"course deactivate it if you want in <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>LaTeX</"
"guimenuitem><guilabel>Environments</guilabel></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Automatsko zatvršavanje okruženja znači da,kada započnete novo okruženje "
"upisivanjem <userinput>\\begin{environment}</userinput>, &kile; će "
"automatski ubaciti  odgovarajuću <userinput>\\end{environment}</userinput>  "
"komandu , sa linijom između za Vaš tekst. Naravno, ako želite, možete ga "
"deaktivirati u <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriranje Kile-a...</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>LaTeX</guimenuitem><guilabel>Okruženja</guilabel></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid "Jump to Structure Element"
msgstr "Skok na strukturne elemente"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All documents are normally structured in a hierarchy of some type. &latex; "
"allows you to break up documents into the following hierarchy (part being "
"highest in the hierarchy, and subparagraph being lowest):"
msgstr ""
"Svi dokumenti su obično struktuirani u hijerarhiju nekog tipa.&latex;  "
"dozvoljava da rastavite dokumente u slijedeću hijerarhiju (diom koji je "
"naviši u hijerarhiji i subparagraf koji je najniži):"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\part"
msgstr "\\part"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\chapter"
msgstr "\\chapter"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\section"
msgstr "\\section"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\subsection"
msgstr "\\subsection"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\subsubsection"
msgstr "\\subsubsekcija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\paragraph"
msgstr "\\paragraph"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\subparagraph"
msgstr "\\subparagraph"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When viewing a document in the <guilabel>Structure</guilabel> view, you can "
"jump between elements by clicking on the element you would like to view."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom pregledanja dokumenta u <guilabel>Struktura</guilabel> pregled, "
"možete skakati između elemenata pritiskom na element koji želite vdjeti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inverse Search"
msgstr "Inverzna pretraga"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When creating your own &latex; files, inverse search can be very helpful. "
"Once you have created a &DVI; file (DeVice Independent File) or PDF file, "
"you can click the left mouse button while pressing &Shift; in the viewer and "
"&kile; will jump to the corresponding line in the &latex; source code."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom kreiranja vlastitih &latex; dokumenata, inverzna pretraga može biti "
"veoma korisna. Kada ste kreirali  &DVI; datoteku  (DeVice Independent File) "
"ili PDF datoteku, možete pritisnuti lijevo dugme na mišu dok  držite  "
"&Shift; u pregledniku i &kile; će skočiti na odgovarajuću liniju u &latex; "
"izvorom kodu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A &DVI; is a type of file containing a description of a formatted document, "
"along with other information including character font, and is besides PDF "
"the usual output of &tex; or &latex;. A number of utilities exist to view, "
"convert and print &DVI; files on various systems and devices."
msgstr ""
"&DVI; je tip datoteke koji sadrži opis formatiranih dokumenata, skupa sa "
"ostalim informacijama uključujući font karaktera, i pored PDF formata je "
"uobičajeni izlaz iz &tex;-a ili &latex;-a. Broj pogodnosti postoji do "
"pregleda, pretvaranja i printanja &DVI;  datoteka na različitim sistemima i "
"uređajima."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forward Search"
msgstr "Napredna pretraga"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When using inverse search, the selection of items in the &DVI; or PDF file "
"is associated with the editor, so when you click on the &DVI; or PDF file, "
"the main window jumps to the corresponding section of &latex; code in the "
"editor. Forward search is the exact opposite of this. Forward search will "
"allow you to click on a specific section of text in the &latex; code, and "
"jump to the associated position in the viewer window."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom korištenja inverzne pretrage, selekcija stavki u &DVI; ili PDF "
"fatoteci je povezana sa editorom, pa kada pritisnete na  &DVI; ili PDF "
"datoteku, glavni prozor skoči na odgovarajući dio  &latex; koda u editoru. "
"Napredna pretraga je upravo suprotna od ovoga. Napredna pretraga će Vam "
"dozvoliti da pritisnete na specificirani dio teksta u  &latex;  kodu i da "
"skočite na povezanu poziciju u preglednom prozoru-."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Toolbar"
msgstr "Alatna traka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>New</guibutton>: begin a new document."
msgstr "<guibutton>Novi</guibutton>: započnite novi dokument."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Open</guibutton>: open a new document."
msgstr "<guibutton>Otvori</guibutton>: otvorite novi dokument."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Close</guibutton>: close your document."
msgstr "<guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton>: zatvorite Vaš dokument."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Define document as master</guibutton>: this is used when working "
"with multiple files. Having a master document will let you work more easily "
"with other <literal role=\"extension\">.tex</literal> files included in your "
"document. If you are using projects, you can also set in "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Project-></guimenu><guisubmenu>Project Options</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> a project-wide master document."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Definiši dokument kao glavni</guibutton>:ovo se koristi pri radu "
"sa više datoteka. Glavni dokument će Vam pomoći da radite mnogo "
"jednostavnije s ostalim <literal role=\"extension\">.tex</literal> "
"datotekama uključenim u Vaš dokument. Ukoliko koristite projekte,, možete u "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Projekt</guimenu><guisubmenu>Opcije projekta</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> postaviti projekat kao široko savladan dokument."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton>: compiles your &latex; source code and "
"displays the results automatically unless there are errors contained in the "
"document."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Brzo građenje</guibutton>: kompajlira Vaš &latex; izvorni kod i "
"prikazuje rezultate automatki,osim ako postoje greške unutar dokumenta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Watch file mode</guibutton>: this mode will \"watch\" the &DVI; "
"file for changes, and will not launch a new session of &okular; after "
"<guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Režim motrenja datoteke </guibutton>:ovaj način rada će \"motriti"
"\" &DVI; datoteke pri promjenama i neće pokretati nove sesije   &okular; -a "
"nakon <guibutton>Brzo građenje</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>View logfile</guibutton>: views the <literal role=\"extension\">."
"log</literal> file, so you can spot errors."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Pregled logfile-a</guibutton>: pregleda <literal role=\"extension"
"\">.log</literal> datoteku,pa možete uočiti greške."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Previous error</guibutton>: jumps backward through the <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.log</literal> file and highlights errors in the source."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Prethodne greške</guibutton>: skače unazad kroz <literal role="
"\"extension\">.log</literal> datoteku i ističe greške u kodu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Next error</guibutton>: jumps forward through <literal role="
"\"extension\">.log</literal> file and highlights errors in the source."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Slijedeća greška</guibutton>: skače unaprijed kroz <literal role="
"\"extension\">.log</literal> datoteku i ističe greške u kodu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Stop</guibutton>: halts current tool."
msgstr "<guibutton>Zaustavi</guibutton>: zaustavlja trenutni alat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>LaTeX</guibutton>: runs &latex; on the active document."
msgstr "<guibutton>LaTeX</guibutton>: pokreće &latex; na aktivnom dokumentu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>ViewDVI</guibutton>: launches &DVI; viewer."
msgstr "<guibutton>Pregled DVI</guibutton>: pokreće &DVI; preglednik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>DVItoPS</guibutton>: converts a &DVI; to a &PostScript; (PS)."
msgstr "<guibutton>DVI u PS</guibutton>: pretvara &DVI; u &PostScript; (PS)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>ViewPS</guibutton>: launches &PostScript; (PS) viewer."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Pregled PS</guibutton>: pokreće &PostScript; (PS) preglednik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>PDFLaTeX</guibutton>: runs &pdflatex; on the active document."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>PDFLaTeX</guibutton>: pokreće &pdflatex; na aktivnom dokumentu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>ViewPDF</guibutton>: launches the PDF viewer."
msgstr "<guibutton>Pregled PDF</guibutton>: pokreće PDF preglednik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>DVItoPDF</guibutton>: converts a &DVI; to a PDF."
msgstr "<guibutton>DVI u PDF</guibutton>: pretvara&DVI; u PDF."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>PStoPDF</guibutton>: converts a PS to a PDF."
msgstr "<guibutton>PS u PDF</guibutton>: pretvara PS u PDF."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>ViewHTML</guibutton>: views &HTML; created."
msgstr "<guibutton>Pregled HTML</guibutton>:  pregleda kreiran &HTML;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>ForwardDVI</guibutton>: jump to page of the &DVI; file that "
"corresponds to the current line in the editor."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Naprijed DVI</guibutton>: jump to the page of theskače na "
"stranicu &DVI; datoteke koja odgovara trenutnoj liniji u editoru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>ForwardPDF</guibutton>: jump to page of the PDF file that "
"corresponds to the current line in the editor."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Naprijed PDF</guibutton>: skače na sranicu PDF datoteke koja "
"odgovara trenutnoj liniji u editoru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you look at the <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> toolbar, you will notice three "
"large drop-down menus. The drop-down menus were designed for you to be able "
"to quickly add certain common features into your document. The first drop "
"down box is used for quickly dividing your document by parts, chapter, "
"sections and so on; the available commands to add segments to your &latex; "
"source code are:"
msgstr ""
"Ako pogledate u  <guilabel>Izmjeni</guilabel> alatnu traku,primjetit ćete "
"tri ogromna padajuća menija. Padajući meniji su dizajnirani da brže dodate "
"određene zajedničke komponente u Vaš dokument. Prvi padajući meni se koristi "
"za brzo razdvajanje dokumenta po dijelovima, poglavljima,sekcijama itd; "
"dostupne komande da dodate segmente u &latex; izvorni kod su :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>part</guilabel>: highest level of sectioning for a document."
msgstr "<guilabel>dio</guilabel>: najviši nivo sekcioniranja dokumenta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>chapter</guilabel>: starts a new chapter."
msgstr "<guilabel>poglavlje</guilabel>: započinje novo poglavlje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>section</guilabel>: create a new section."
msgstr "<guilabel>sekcija</guilabel>: kreiraj novu sekciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>subsection</guilabel>: create a new subsection."
msgstr "<guilabel>subsekcija</guilabel>: kreiraj novu subsekciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>subsubsection</guilabel>: a secondary section between subsection "
"and paragraph."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>subsubsekcija</guilabel>: sekundarna sekcija između subsekcije i "
"paragrafa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>paragraph</guilabel>: create a new paragraph."
msgstr "<guilabel>paragraf</guilabel>: kreiraj novi paragraf."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>subparagraph</guilabel>: create a new subparagraph."
msgstr "<guilabel>subparagraf</guilabel>: kreira novi subparagraf."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The drop down box named <guilabel>Other</guilabel> is used to insert items "
"to your document such as indexes, footnotes, and references; the available "
"commands are:"
msgstr ""
"Padajući meni nazvan <guilabel>Ostalo</guilabel> se koristi za umetanje "
"stavku u dokument, kao što su indeski, fusnote i reference; dostupne komande "
"su:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>label</guilabel>: a command that produces a label for a chapter, a "
"figure or another element."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>label</guilabel>:komanda koja proizvodi oznake za poglavlja, "
"procjene ili neki drugi element."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>index</guilabel>: creates an entry for the index."
msgstr "<guilabel>indeks</guilabel>: kreira unos za indeks."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>footnote</guilabel>: creates a footnote in your document."
msgstr "<guilabel>fusnota</guilabel>: kreira fusnotu u dokumentu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>ref</guilabel>: used to refer to a predefined label, which you can "
"choose from a drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>ref</guilabel>: koristi se kao referenca na več definiranu labelu,"
"koju možete izabrati iz padajuće liste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>pageref</guilabel>: just like <guilabel>ref</guilabel>, but refers "
"to a page instead of a structure element."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>pageref</guilabel>:isto kao <guilabel>ref</guilabel>, ali se "
"odnosi na stranicu umjesto strukturnog elementa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:464
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>cite</guilabel>: create a reference with data from a bibliography."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>citat</guilabel>: kreira referencu na podatke iz bibliografije."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Other</guilabel> drop-down menu</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Na <guilabel>drugi</guilabel> padajući meni</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Other</guilabel> drop-down menu</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Na <guilabel>drugi</guilabel> padajući meni</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Other</guilabel> drop-down menu</para>"
msgstr "<para>Na <guilabel>drugi</guilabel> padajući meni</para>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:484
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Selecting the label for a reference</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Selektovanje labele za referencu</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Selecting the label for a reference</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Selektovanje labele za referencu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Selecting the label for a reference</para>"
msgstr "<para>Selektovanje labele za referencu</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When using <guilabel>cite</guilabel>, you are presented with a drop-down "
"list of bibitems, but if you are using &bibtex; this will only work if the "
"file belongs to a Project. For editing &bibtex; files the usage of "
"specialised editors is recommended. The author has made good experience with "
"&kbibtex; and &kbib;. Of course you can also write the &bibtex; files by "
"hand inside &kile;."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom korištenja <guilabel>citat</guilabel>,prezentovana Vam je padajuća "
"lista bibstavki,ali ako koristite &bibtex; ovo će raditi samo ako datoteka "
"pripada projektu. Za izmjenu &bibtex; datoteka, preporučuje se korištenje "
"specijaizovanih editora. Autor je imao dobre rezultate sa &kbibtex;. "
"Naravno, možete pisati &kbibtex; i ručno unutar &kile;-a."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The last drop-down box labeled <guilabel>tiny</guilabel> is used to set the "
"size of the text. You can set the size of the main text, of footnotes, and "
"so on. The available commands are:"
msgstr ""
"Posljednji padajući meni  <guilabel>sićušan</guilabel> se koristi za "
"podešavanje veličine teksta. Možete podesiti glavni tekst, fusnote itd. "
"Dostupne komande su:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>tiny</guilabel>: smallest."
msgstr "<guilabel>sićušno</guilabel>: najmanje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>scriptsize</guilabel>: very small."
msgstr "<guilabel>veličina indeksa</guilabel>: veoma malo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>footnotesize</guilabel>: smaller."
msgstr "<guilabel>veličina fusnote</guilabel>: veoma malo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>small</guilabel>: small."
msgstr "<guilabel>malo</guilabel>: malo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>normalsize</guilabel>: normal."
msgstr "<guilabel>normalna veličina</guilabel>: normalna veličina."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:510
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>large</guilabel>: large."
msgstr "<guilabel>veliko</guilabel>: veliko."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Large</guilabel>: larger."
msgstr "<guilabel>Veliko</guilabel>: veće."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>LARGE</guilabel>: even larger."
msgstr "<guilabel>VELIKO</guilabel>: još veće."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>huge</guilabel>: still larger."
msgstr "<guilabel>ogromno</guilabel>: i dalje veće."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Huge</guilabel>: largest."
msgstr "<guilabel>Ogromno</guilabel>: najveće."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "Brzi početak"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:526
#, no-c-format
msgid "Writing a &latex; Document with &kile; for Beginners"
msgstr "Pisanje &latex; dokumenta sa &kile;-om za početnike"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:528
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Users of &kile; have two choices when starting a new document: they can use "
"the <guimenu>Wizard</guimenu> to begin a new document, select the type of "
"document they would like to create and options such as font size, paper "
"size, and so on; otherwise, they can write the code by hand."
msgstr ""
"Korisnici &kile;-a imaju dva izbora pri izboru kreiranju novog dokumenta: "
"mogu koristiti  <guimenu>Wizard</guimenu> da otvore novi dokument, selektuju "
"tip dokumenta koji žele da kreiraju i opcije kao što su veličina fonta, "
"veličina papira, itd;inače,mogu pisati kod ručno."

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:533
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\documentclass[12pt]{article}\n"
"\\begin{document}\n"
"        Here is a bunch of text coded in \\LaTeX.\n"
"\\end{document}"
msgstr ""
"\\documentclass[12pt]{article}\n"
"\\begin{document}\n"
"        Ovdje je komad teksta kodiran u \\LaTeX.\n"
"\\end{document}"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:535
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every document in &latex; begins with the command <userinput> "
"\\documentclass[optional argument]{class}</userinput>, where class specifies "
"the document type."
msgstr ""
"Svaki dokument u &latex; -u počinje sa komandom <userinput> \\klasa "
"dokumenta[opcionalni argument]{klasa}</userinput>, gdje klasa sepcificira "
"tip dokumenta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Typing in the code example above from the text box gives you the following "
"output:"
msgstr "Pisanje u primjeru koda iznad daje slijedeći izlaz:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Compiled text in &DVI; output</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kompajliran tekst u &DVI; izlazu</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:547
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Compiled text in &DVI; output</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kompajliran tekst u  &DVI; izlazu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Compiled text in &DVI; output</para>"
msgstr "<para>Kompajliran tekst u &DVI; izlazu</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The brackets that come after the command <userinput>\\documentclass</"
"userinput> contain the options for the command. The option "
"<userinput>[12pt]</userinput> sets the size of the font for your article; if "
"you do not set the font size in the beginning, you can set it later in the "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Zagrade iza komande <userinput>\\klasa dokumenta</userinput> sadrže opcije "
"za komande. Opcija <userinput>[12pt]</userinput>  postavlja veličinu fonta "
"za članak; ako ne postavite veličinu fonta na početku, možete je postaviti "
"kasnije unutar teksta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have typed in the code example from the box above, you will need to "
"compile your &latex; source code. The easiest way for you to compile &latex; "
"is to use the <guimenu>Build</guimenu> menu, or using the "
"<guilabel>Quickbuild</guilabel> button."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste otkucali primjer koda u okviru iznad, trebate kompajlirati &latex;  "
"izvorni kod. Najlakši način da kompajlirate &latex; je da koristite "
"<guimenu>Izgradi</guimenu> meni, ili da koristite <guilabel>Quickbuild</"
"guilabel> dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:562
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo> is the keyboard shortcut to "
"compile your source code."
msgstr ""
"<keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo>  je kratica sa tastature za "
"kompajliranje izvornog koda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:565
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have to save your source code before you can compile; &kile; will do "
"this automatically for you."
msgstr ""
"Prije nego kompajlirate izvorni kod,morate ga najprije snimiti.  &kile; će "
"ovo odraditi automatski za Vas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:567
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your document did not compile, check the log for errors. When using the "
"<guilabel>Quickbuild</guilabel> key, the &okular; viewer should be launched "
"automatically; if it does not, look at the log."
msgstr ""
"Ako se dokument nije kompajlirao,provjerite spremnik za greške. Prilikom "
"korištenja <guilabel>Brzo građenje</guilabel> tipke, &okular; preglednik će "
"se pokrenuti automatski: ako se ne pokrene, pogledajte u dnevniku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:573 index.docbook:1538
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environments"
msgstr "Okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:575
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An environment is a segment of text that is managed differently than the "
"rest of the document. For example, you create a report with font size 12, "
"but you need to change your font size for a few sentences. The commands "
"<userinput>\\begin{environment}</userinput>, <userinput>\\huge</userinput> "
"and <userinput>\\end{environment}</userinput> will let you temporarily alter "
"the text inside the environment commands to be size huge."
msgstr ""
"Okruženje je segment teksta koji je upravljan drugačije od ostatka "
"dokumenta. Naprimjer, kreirate izvještaj sa veličinom fonta 12,ali treba da "
"promijenite veličinu fonta za nekoliko rečenica. Komande \\begin{environment}"
"</userinput>, <userinput>\\huge</userinput> and <userinput>\\end{environment}"
"</userinput> će vam dopustiti privremenu promjenu teksta unutar okruženja na "
"veličinu veliko."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:582
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changes are only effective from <userinput>\\begin{environment}</userinput> "
"to <userinput>\\end{environment}</userinput>. There are no limits as how "
"many changes you can make inside an environment."
msgstr ""
"Promjene su efektivne jedino iz <userinput>\\počni{okruženje}</userinput> u "
"<userinput>\\završi{okruženje}</userinput>. Ne postoje granice vezane za "
"količinu promjena koju možete napraviti unutar okruženja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are many features you can add to your document that will make it more "
"readable and user-friendly. You can add features such as specific fonts, "
"bold, italics, underline &etc; to your document, and these commands will end "
"with either an <userinput>\\end</userinput> command, or at the end of your "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Postoji mnogo komponenti koje možete dodati u dokument, da bude čitljiviji i "
"lakši za korištenje. Možete dodati komponente kao što su specifični fontovi, "
"podebljaj, ukosi, podvuci &etc; u dokument, i ove komande će završiti sa  "
"<userinput>\\završi</userinput> komandom ili završetkom okruženja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:592
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\begin{emph}</userinput>: this command makes text italicized, "
"and is valid until the code comes across a <userinput>\\end{emph}</"
"userinput>, or another environment. To italicize one word in a sentence, you "
"can use the syntax: this is <userinput>\\emph{my}</userinput> sentence."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\begin{emph}</userinput>:ova komanda postavlja tekst nakoso, i "
"validna je dok kod ne dođe do <userinput>\\end{emph}</userinput> komande ili "
"nekog drugog okruženja. Da biste nakosili jednu riječ u rečenici, možete "
"koristiti sintaksu: ovo je <userinput>\\emph{my}</userinput> rečenica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:596
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\textbf{I am making this text inside the brackets bold}</"
"userinput>: this command makes your text bold."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\textbf{Tekst unutar ovih zagrada je podebljan}</userinput>: ova "
"komanda podebljava tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:598
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\quote</userinput>: to create a quote inside your document; "
"begin your quote with <userinput>\\begin{quote}</userinput> and end it with "
"<userinput>\\end{quote}</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\quote</userinput>: da biste kreirali citat unutar dokumenta; "
"započnite citat sa <userinput>\\begin{quote}</userinput> i završite sa  "
"<userinput>\\end{quote}</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>\\center</userinput>: centers the text."
msgstr "<userinput>\\center</userinput>: centrira tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>\\verse</userinput>: creates offset text for poems."
msgstr "<userinput>\\verse</userinput>: kreira nagib teksta za poeziju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>\\itemize</userinput>: makes an itemized list."
msgstr "<userinput>\\itemize</userinput>: pravi listu sa specifikacijama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kile;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kile;-a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:611
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now that we have given you some background about how to write code using the "
"&latex; markup language, we will show you how to create a document using "
"&kile; step-by-step."
msgstr ""
"Sad kad smo Vam dali neku pozadinu o tome kako pisati kod koristeći &latex; "
"markup jezik, pokazat ćemo Vam kako da kreirate dokument koristeći &kile; "
"korak po korak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:616
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start &kile;."
msgstr "Pokrenite &kile;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quick Start</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, then choose a format, and set your preferences in "
"the wizard."
msgstr ""
"Označite <menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quick Start</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, zatim odaberite format i postavite preferencije u "
"wizardu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:619
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the wizard has entered text, do some customization to make the document "
"more readable, add a minimum of one quote, some bold text, italics, and a "
"verse to see the difference between the commands."
msgstr ""
"Kada wizard uđe u tekst, prilagodite dokument tako da bude malo čitljiviji, "
"dodajte minimalno jedan citat, podebljajte ili ukosite tekst, i stih da "
"vidite razliku između komandi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:622
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save your file, and give it the name <filename>intro.tex</filename>."
msgstr "Snimite datoteku, i nazovite je  <filename>intro.tex</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:623
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Build your document using <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo>, or "
"the button labeled <guilabel>LaTeX</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Izgradite dokument koristeći <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo>, "
"ili dugme označeno kao <guilabel>LaTeX</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:625
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select <guibutton>ViewDVI</guibutton>."
msgstr "Označite <guibutton>ViewDVI</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check out all your new text."
msgstr "Pogledajte sav novi tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are done viewing your document, click the <guibutton>Editor View</"
"guibutton> button or press <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> to "
"return to the editor if you are using the embedded viewer, or close the "
"viewer window if you are using a separate viewer."
msgstr ""
"Kad ste završili sa pregledom dokumenta, pritisnite <guibutton>Editor View</"
"guibutton>  dugme ili pritisnite <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> da se vratite u editor ako koristite ugrađeni preglednik, ili "
"zatvorite pregledni prozor ako koristite odvojeni preglednik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:633
#, no-c-format
msgid "That's it! You have just created your first &latex; document!"
msgstr "To je to! Upravo ste kreirali Vaš prvi  &latex;dokument!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:635
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have created your &DVI;, you will be able to print your document, "
"or change it into a &PostScript; or PDF file if you want. Experiment and "
"have fun!"
msgstr ""
"Kada ste kreirali &DVI;.moći ćete da isprintate Vaš dokument, ili da ga "
"promijenite u &PostScript; ili PDF datoteku ako želite. Eksperimentišite i "
"zabavite se!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DVI; Files"
msgstr "&DVI; datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:644
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&DVI; stands for <emphasis>DeVice Independent</emphasis> file. These files "
"are produced by &tex; or &latex; to be read by a driver of some sort on your "
"computer. There are many different types of output that a <literal role="
"\"extension\">.dvi</literal> can be sent to, such as a printer, &PostScript; "
"or PDF file converter, or your computer screen."
msgstr ""
"&DVI; predstavlja <emphasis>DeVice Independent</emphasis>  datoteku. Ove "
"datoteke su proizvedene od strane &tex; -a ili  &latex; a, da budu pročitane "
"od neke vrste drajvera na Vašem računaru. Postoji mnogo različitih tipova "
"izlaza kojima se <literal role=\"extension\">.dvi</literal> može slati,lkao "
"što su printer,  &PostScript; ili PDF pretvarač datoteka, ili Vaš ekran na "
"računaru."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:650
#, no-c-format
msgid "Viewing a &DVI;"
msgstr "Pregled &DVI;-ja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:652
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have already seen how to view a &DVI; file on the screen by using the "
"<guibutton>ViewDVI</guibutton> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Već ste vidjeli na koji način možete pregledati &DVI; datoteku na ekranu "
"koristeći <guibutton>ViewDVI</guibutton> dugme u alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:658
#, no-c-format
msgid "Printing a &DVI;"
msgstr "Printanje &DVI;-ja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:660
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To print a &DVI;, you can use the same process that you used to create your "
"document earlier (see <xref linkend=\"quick_using\" role=\"select: title "
"pageabbrv\"/>). At step 7, after clicking <guibutton>ViewDVI</guibutton>, "
"select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> in the viewer, and if you have your printer properly configured, "
"you will be able to print the &DVI;."
msgstr ""
"Da biste isprintali &DVI; možete koristiti isti proces koji ste koristili "
"pri kreiranju dokumenta ranije (pogledajte <xref linkend=\"quick_using\" "
"role=\"select: title pageabbrv\"/>). Na koraku 7, nakon pritiska na "
"<guibutton>ViewDVI</guibutton>, selektujte <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem></menuchoice> u pregledniku, i ako "
"imate propisno konfigurisan printer, moći ćete isprintati  &DVI;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid "Converting &DVI; files"
msgstr "Pretvaranja &DVI;. datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:673
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The toolbar gives the options of Converting a &DVI; to other formats. Once "
"you have created a &DVI; from your &latex; source code, you will be able to "
"export it to a format of your choice using the toolbar buttons."
msgstr ""
"Alatna traka nudi opciju pretvaranja &DVI;. datoteka u druge formate. Jednom "
"kada ste kreirali &DVI; iz  &latex; izvornog koda, moći ćete da ga prebacite "
"u format po Vašem izboru koristeći dugmad alatne trake."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forward Search between &kile; and &okular;"
msgstr "Napredna pretraga između &kile;-a i &okular;-a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:685
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The forward search functions allow you to jump from your editor directly "
"into the associated position of the &DVI; or PDF file."
msgstr ""
"Funkcije napredne pretrage Vam dozvoljavaju da skačete iz editora direktno "
"na povezanu poziciju &DVI;-ja ili PDF datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; offers a configuration with this option for all &latex; binaries. Go "
"to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Tools</guimenuitem><guilabel>Build</guilabel></"
"menuchoice> and always choose the <guilabel>Modern</guilabel> configuration."
msgstr ""
"&kile; nudi konfiguraciju s ovom opcijom za sve  &latex; binaries. Idite na  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Alati</guimenuitem><guilabel>Građenje</guilabel></"
"menuchoice> i izaberite <guilabel>Moderno</guilabel> konfiguraciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:693
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To execute a forward search, position the cursor on a line of source code, "
"and click <guilabel>Forward Search</guilabel> to jump to the associated "
"position in the &DVI; or PDF viewer window."
msgstr ""
"Za izvršavanje napredne pretrage, pozicionirajte kursor na liniju izvornog "
"koda i pritisnite  <guilabel>Napredna pretraga</guilabel> da skočite na "
"povezanu poziciju u &DVI; or PDF preglednom prozoru."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:700
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inverse Search between &kile; and &okular;"
msgstr "Inverzna pretraga između &kile; -a i &okular;-a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:702
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Inverse search is a very useful feature when you are writing a &latex; "
"document yourself. If everything is set up properly, you can click into "
"&okular;'s window with the <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse button "
"while pressing &Shift;. After that &kile; loads the &latex; source file and "
"jumps to the proper paragraph. To use inverse search, you have to compile "
"your &latex; file with the <guilabel>Modern</guilabel> configuration."
msgstr ""
"Inverzna pretraga je veoma korisno svojstvo kada sami pišete &latex; "
"dokument. Ako je sve postavljeno propisno, možete pritisnuti unutar prozora "
"&okular;'-a sa <mousebutton>lijevo</mousebutton> klikom miša dok držite "
"&Shift;. Nakon toga &kile; učitava &latex; izvorni dokument i skače u "
"odgovarajući paragraf. Za korištenje inverzne pretrage, trebate kompajlirati "
"&latex; datoteku sa <guilabel>Moderno</guilabel> konfiguracijom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:707
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inverse search cannot work unless:"
msgstr "Inverzna pretraga neće raditi ukoliko:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid "The source file has been compiled successfully."
msgstr "Izvorna datoteka nije uspješno kompajlirana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:711
#, no-c-format
msgid "&okular; knows which editor you would like to use."
msgstr "&okular; ne zna koji editor želite koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:714
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this feature of &okular;, a left mouse click while pressing &Shift; in "
"the &DVI; or PDF document will result in &kile; opening the corresponding "
"&latex; document and attempt to go to the corresponding line. Remember to "
"tell &okular; to use &kile; as a text editor, in &okular;'s menu item "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Okular...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> (on the page <guimenuitem>Editor</guimenuitem>)."
msgstr ""
"S ovim svojstvom &okular;-a,lijevi klik miša prilikom pritiskanja &Shift; "
"dugmeta u &DVI; ili PDF dokumentu će rezultovati otvaranjem odgovarajućeg "
"&latex; dokumenta u &kile; -u i pokušajem da se ode do odgovarajuće linije. "
"Zapamtite da kažete &okular; -u da koristi &kile; kao tekstualni editor, "
"stavki menija u &okular;-a <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši Okular...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> (na "
"strani <guimenuitem>Editor</guimenuitem>)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:721
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Configuring &okular;</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Konfiguracija &okular;-a</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:727
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Configuring &okular;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Konfiguracija &okular;-a</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:729
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Configuring &okular;</para>"
msgstr "<para>Konfiguracija &okular;-a</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:736
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resolving Errors"
msgstr "Rješavanje grešaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:738
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are trying to use quickbuild, and the &DVI; viewer does not open, "
"chances are you have an error. If you have an error, it will be visible in "
"the log file / message area, and the summary of the error will be given."
msgstr ""
"Ako pokušate da koristite quickbulid i &DVI; preglednik se ne otvori, "
"velikse su šanse da imate grešku. Ako imate grešku,bit će vidljiva u log "
"datoteci /području za poruke, i bit će Vam dat sažetak greške."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:742
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The log file will explain the source of the error in your code. In the "
"editor, you can use the buttons in the toolbar labeled <guibutton>Previous "
"LaTeX Error</guibutton> and <guibutton>Next LaTeX Error</guibutton> to jump "
"to and from errors. The log file always states in which line the error "
"occurred. To view the line where an error occurred, click on the error in "
"the log window, and &kile; will take you to error's line."
msgstr ""
"Log datoteka će objasniti porijeklo greške u Vašem kodu. U editoru možete "
"koristiti dugmad u alatnoj traci označena kao <guibutton>Previous LaTeX "
"Error</guibutton> i <guibutton>Next LaTeX Error</guibutton>  da skačete ka "
"grešci i od greške. Log datoteka uvijek pokazuje u kojoj liniji se pojavila "
"greška. Da biste vidjeli liniju u kojoj se greška pojavila, pritisnite na "
"greškuu log prozoru i &kile; će vas odvesti do linije s greškom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting a New Document"
msgstr "Pokretanje novog dokumenta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:755
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you click the button in the toolbar to begin a new document a dialog "
"appears, asking which type of template you would like to use to write your "
"document. The default choices are:"
msgstr ""
"Kada pritisnete na dugme u alatnoj traci za pokretanje novog dokumenta, "
"otvori se novi prozor koji Vas pita koji tip šablona želite da koristite pri "
"pisanju dokumenta. Zadani izbori su:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:760
#, no-c-format
msgid "Empty document"
msgstr "Prazan dokument"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid "Article"
msgstr "Članak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:762
#, no-c-format
msgid "Beamer"
msgstr "Beamer"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:763
#, no-c-format
msgid "Book"
msgstr "Knjiga"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:764
#, no-c-format
msgid "HA-Prosper"
msgstr "HA-Prosper"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:765
#, no-c-format
msgid "Powerdot"
msgstr "Powerdot"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:766
#, no-c-format
msgid "Letter"
msgstr "Pismo"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid "Report"
msgstr "Izvještaj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:768
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrartcl (from the KOMA-Script package)"
msgstr "Scrartcl (iz KOMA-Script paketa)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:769
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrbook (from the KOMA-Script package)"
msgstr "Scrbook (iz KOMA-Script paketa)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:770
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrlttr2 (from the KOMA-Script package)"
msgstr "Scrlttr2 (iz KOMA-Script paketa)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:771
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrreprt (from the KOMA-Script package)"
msgstr "Scrreprt (iz KOMA-Script paketa)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:772
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>PDF</para>"
msgstr "<para>PDF</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:773
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>XeLaTeX</para>"
msgstr "<para>XeLaTeX</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:776
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you selected an <guilabel>Empty document</guilabel>, you can either start "
"writing a document from scratch, or you can use the wizard to quickly start "
"a new document (see <xref linkend=\"intro_docwizard\" role=\"select: title "
"pageabbrv\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste označili <guilabel>Prazan dokument</guilabel>, možete ili početi "
"pisati dokument ispočetka ili koristiti čarobnjak da brzo pokrene novi "
"dokument.  (pogledajte <xref linkend=\"intro_docwizard\" role=\"select: "
"title pageabbrv\"/>)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:783
#, no-c-format
msgid "Templates"
msgstr "Šabloni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:785
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Frequent users of &latex; typically use the same preamble for almost every "
"document they use. Templates can be created, saved and loaded within &kile; "
"to make it easier to start a new document."
msgstr ""
"Česti korisnici &latex; -a obično korisze iste predgovore za skoro svaki "
"dokument. Šabloni mogu biti kreirani, spašeni i očitani unutar &kile; -a, da "
"bi se lakše pokrenuo novi dokument."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:790
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create a New Template"
msgstr "Napravi novi šablon"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:792
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new template, you must first either open a &tex; / &latex; file, "
"or create a file of your own. &kile; can generate a template from an "
"existing document by opening the desired document and selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create Template from "
"Document</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Za kreiranje novog šablona, prvo morate otvoriti &tex; / &latex; datoteku, "
"ili kreirati svoju vlastitu datoteku. &kile; može generisati šablon iz "
"postojećeg dokumenta otvaranjem željenog dokumenta i označavanjem "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu><guimenuitem>Kreiraj šablon iz "
"dokumenta</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:800
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring Automatic Substitutions"
msgstr "Konfigurisanje automatskih izmjena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:802
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When creating a new document by selecting a template from "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, certain character combinations will be replaced by data such as "
"your name, or the character encoding your are using. These variables can be "
"configured in <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure "
"Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Settings</guimenuitem><guilabel>General</"
"guilabel></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom kreiranja novog dokumenta,označavanjem šablona iz "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, određene kombinacije karaktera če biti zamjenjene sa podacima "
"kao što je Vaše ime, ili karakterima kodiranja koje koristite. Ove varijable "
"mogu biti konfigurisane u <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Podešavanja</guimenuitem><guilabel>Generalo</guilabel></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:809
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When designing your own template, it is useful to known which character "
"combinations are replaced by which template variables:"
msgstr ""
"Prilikom dizajniranja vlastitog šablona, korisno je znati koja kombinacija "
"karaktera biva zamijenjena sa kojim varijablama šablona."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>$$AUTHOR$$</userinput>: This string will be replaced by the "
"author variable."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$$AUTHOR$$</userinput>: Ovaj string će biti zamijenjen sa "
"varijablom autora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:815
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>$$DOCUMENTCLASSOPTIONS$$</userinput>: This string will be "
"replaced by the documentclass options variable. Typically this is used as "
"follows: <userinput>\\documentclass[$$DOCUMENTCLASSOPTIONS$$]{article}</"
"userinput>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$$DOCUMENTCLASSOPTIONS$$</userinput>: Ovaj string će biti "
"zamijenjen sa varijablom opcija klase dokumenta. Obično se ovo koristi na "
"slijedeći način: <userinput>\\documentclass[$$DOCUMENTCLASSOPTIONS$$]"
"{article}</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:818
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>$$INPUTENCODING$$</userinput>: If the inputencoding variable is "
"set to, say, <userinput>latin1</userinput> this string is replaced by "
"<userinput>\\input[latin1]{inputenc}</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$$INPUTENCODING$$</userinput>: Ako je varijabla ulaznog kodiranja "
"postavljena na , recimo <userinput>latin1</userinput> ovaj string je "
"zamijenjen sa  <userinput>\\input[latin1]{inputenc}</userinput>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:827
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create a Template from the Wizard"
msgstr "Kreiranje šablona iz čarobnjaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:829
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The easiest way to create a new template is to start the wizard, and then "
"add commands in the editor. Once you have your document set up the way you "
"like:"
msgstr ""
"Najlakši način za kreiranje novog šablona je pokretanje Čarobnjaka, a zatim "
"dodavanje komandi u editor. Jednom kada ste postavili dokument onako kako "
"Vam se sviđa:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:834
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save your file;"
msgstr "Snimite datoteku;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid "Go to <guimenu>File</guimenu>;"
msgstr "Idite na <guimenu>File</guimenu>;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:836
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose <guimenuitem>Create Template from Document</guimenuitem>;"
msgstr "Izaberite <guimenuitem>kreiraj šablon iz dolumenta</guimenuitem>;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:837
#, no-c-format
msgid "Make any corrections necessary to the template;"
msgstr "Napravite sve potrebne korekcije šablona;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:838
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a name for your new template;"
msgstr "Dajte ime Vašem novom šablonu;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:839
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to add your template to the menu."
msgstr "Pritisnite <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da dodate Vaš šablon na meni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:842
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next time you start up a new document, you will be able to choose your "
"customized template instead of the default ones."
msgstr ""
"Slijedeći put kad pokrenete novi dokument, moći ćete izabrati svoj "
"prilagođeni šablon umjesto već zadanih."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:849
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a Template from any File"
msgstr "Kreiranje šablona iz bilo koje datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:851
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A template can be created from any &latex; file. If you are looking for an "
"easy way to configure a template, go find one you like on the Internet and "
"follow the same steps as listed in <xref linkend=\"templ_wiz\" role="
"\"select: title pageabbrv\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Šablon može biti kreiran iz bilo koje &latex; datoteke. Ako tražite lakši "
"način da konfigurišete šablon, nađite na internetu onaj koji Vam se sviđa i "
"slijedite korake koji su pobrojani u <xref linkend=\"templ_wiz\" role="
"\"select: title pageabbrv\"/>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:855
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For instance, you may want to create a full-fledged A0 poster. These posters "
"are usually seen at scientific conferences, and &latex; will help you making "
"an attractive, catchy poster. You can get a template for A0 posters at "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.stats.ox.ac.uk/~marchini/a0poster.html\">Jonathan "
"Marchini's home page</ulink>, but many more are available. Remember that you "
"will need the <filename>a0poster</filename> package, which is normally not "
"in standard tex distributions included. Download it from <ulink url=\"http://"
"www.ctan.org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/a0poster/\">here</ulink> and "
"place it in the same folder as your &latex; file."
msgstr ""
"Naprimjer, možda želite da kreirate full-fledged A0 poster. Ovi posteri se "
"obično viđaju na naučnim konferencijama i &latex; će Vam pomoći da napravite "
"atraktivan, upadljiv poster. Šablone za A0 postere možete naći na <ulink url="
"\"http://www.stats.ox.ac.uk/~marchini/a0poster.html\">početna strana "
"Jonathan Marchinija</ulink>, ali još mnogo drugih je dostupno. Zapamtite da "
"trebate  <filename>a0poster</filename> paket, koji obično nije uključen u "
"standardnu  &tex; distribuciju. Skinite ga sa <ulink url=\"http://www.ctan."
"org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/a0poster/\">here</ulink> i stavite ih u "
"isti folder kao i &latex; datoteku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:865
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing a Template"
msgstr "Uklanjanje šablona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:867
#, no-c-format
msgid "To remove a template from &kile;, do as follows:"
msgstr "Da biste uklonili šablon sa &kile;-a uradite slijedeće:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:870
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Remove Template...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>;"
msgstr ""
"Idite na  <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ukloni "
"šablon...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:872
#, no-c-format
msgid "A dialog box will appear with all templates listed: select a template;"
msgstr "Pojavit će se prozor sa listom svih šablona:označite šablon;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:873
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click <guilabel>OK</guilabel>, and your template will be removed."
msgstr "Pritisnite <guilabel>OK</guilabel>, i Vaš  šablon će biti uklonjen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:876
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Templates marked with an asterisk (*) cannot be removed without the proper "
"permission."
msgstr ""
"Šabloni označeni sa zvjezdicom (*) ne mogu biti uklonjeni bez propisne "
"dozvole."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:885
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing &latex; Documents"
msgstr "Izmjena &latex; dokumenata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:887
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The internal editor that &kile; uses is &kate;. &kate; is a text editor "
"created for programmers, which incorporates the ability to read and "
"highlight many different types of text files, among which are &latex; and "
"&bibtex;; you can access many options for &kate; directly from &kile;'s "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Interni editor koji &kile; koristi je &kate;. &kate; je tekst editor kreiran "
"za programere, koji inkorporira mogućnost čitanja i označavanja mnogo "
"različitih tipova teksta, među kojima su &latex; i &bibtex;; možete "
"pristupiti mnogim opcijama za &kate; direktno iz &kile; menija "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:892
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To learn more about &kate; and its capabilities, see the <ulink url=\"help:"
"kate\">&kate; Handbook</ulink>. &kile; users can start reading from the "
"chapter <quote>Working with the &kate; Editor</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste naučili više o  &kate; i njegovim mogućnostima, pogledajte<ulink "
"url=\"help:kate\">&kate; Priručnik</ulink>. &kile; korisnici mogu početi "
"čitati od poglavlja <quote>Rad sa &kate; editorom</quote>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:897
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &latex; Reference"
msgstr "&latex; reference"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:899
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; features a very practical &latex; tag reference, which you can access "
"by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX Reference</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. It contains a thorough description of almost all "
"the commands that you may use in &latex; and their syntax."
msgstr ""
"&kile; ističe veoma praktične &latex; reference oznaka, kojima možete "
"pristupiti odabiranjem <menuchoice><guimenu>Pomoć</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX Reference</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Tu je "
"sadržan detaljan opis skoro svih komandi koje možete koristiti u  &latex;-u "
"i njihove sintakse."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:908
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cursor Movements"
msgstr "Pokreti kursora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:910
#, no-c-format
msgid "To select text, you have the following options:"
msgstr "Za selektovanje teksta imate slijedeće opcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:913
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hold left mouse button, and drag mouse to highlight text."
msgstr "Držite lijevo dugme miša, i povlačite miš da označite tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:914
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click once on a word to move the cursor to a new area."
msgstr "Pristisnite jedanput na riječ da pomjerite kursor na novo područje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:915
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click twice on a word to select the whole word."
msgstr "Pritisnite dvaput na riječ da označite čitavu riječ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:916
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click twice on a word and pressing <keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo> to select the "
"whole tex word. This means clicking in this way on <userinput>\\par</"
"userinput> from <userinput>\\par\\bigskip</userinput> only select \\par."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite dvaput na riječ i pritiskanjem <keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo> "
"selektujte čitavu &tex; riječ. Ovo znači da pritiskanjem <userinput>\\par</"
"userinput> iz<userinput>\\par\\bigskip</userinput>  samo označavate \\par."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:918
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click three times to select the whole sentence."
msgstr "Pritisnite tri puta da označite čitavu rečenicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:921
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Holding the left mouse button, and dragging the text you want to select, "
"automatically copies the selected text to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Držanje lijevog dugmeta miša, i povlačenje teksta koji želite označiti, "
"automatski kopira označeni tekst na clipboard."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:924
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Holding &Shift; and using the arrow keys allows you to select portions of "
"the source code in the editor window."
msgstr ""
"Držanje  &Shift; dugmeta i korištenje strelica dopušta Vam da označite "
"dijelove izvornog koda u prozoru editora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:931
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brackets"
msgstr "Zagrade"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:933
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bracket completion is a visual tool that the editor view uses to indicate "
"you which bracket matches which. If you open any <literal role=\"extension"
"\">.tex</literal> file, and select any bracket, whether it be a parenthesis "
"(), square brackets [] or braces {}, the editor will highlight the bracket "
"and its match in yellow (this default color can be changed). So, for "
"example, if you position the cursor on the braces in <userinput>"
"\\section{Introduction}</userinput>, you would see <userinput>"
"\\section{Introduction}</userinput> in the default yellow highlight, showing "
"you the location of the beginning and ending brackets."
msgstr ""
"Završetak zagrada je vizuelni alat koji editor koristi da indicira koje "
"zagrade se slažu sa kojim. Ako otvorite bilo koju<literal role=\"extension"
"\">.tex</literal> datoteku, i označite bilo koje zagrade, bilo da se radi o "
"običnim (), uglatim [] ili vitičastim  {}, editor označiti zagradu i njen "
"par žutom bojom (ovo je postavljena boja,ali može biti promijenjena).Tako,"
"naprimjer, ako pozicionirate kursor na zagradu u <userinput>"
"\\section{Introduction}</userinput>, vidjet ćete  <userinput>"
"\\section{Introduction}</userinput> u postavljenoj žutoj boji, koja pokazuje "
"lokaciju početka i kraja zagrada."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:946
#, no-c-format
msgid "Highlighting"
msgstr "Isticanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:948
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; has the ability to look for and highlight different types of code. "
"For example, &latex; commands are distinguished from normal text, and math "
"formulas are highlighted also in a different color."
msgstr ""
"&kile; ima sposobnost da traži i ističe različite tipove koda. Naprimjer, "
"&latex; komande se ralikuju od normalnog teksta, a matematske formule su "
"također istaknute drugom bojom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:955
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Bullets</title>"
msgstr "<title>Grafičke oznake</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:957
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many wizards can insert optional bullets, a special kind of bookmarks within "
"the text. The menu entries <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Bullets</guisubmenu></menuchoice> or the corresponding "
"keyboards shortcuts will allow you to jump to the next or last bullet. This "
"will also highlight this bullet so that it will be deleted automatically, "
"when you enter your first letter."
msgstr ""
"Većina čarobnjaka može umetati opcionalne grafičke oznake, specijalnu vrstu "
"oznaka unutar teksta. Unosi s menija menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Grafičke oznake</guisubmenu></menuchoice> ili "
"odgovarajuće kratice sa tastature dozvoljavaju da skočite na slijedeću ili "
"posljednju grafičku oznaku."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:964 index.docbook:3812 index.docbook:3836 index.docbook:3852
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Bullets</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Grafičke oznake</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:970 index.docbook:3818 index.docbook:3842 index.docbook:3858
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Bullets</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Grafičke oznake</phrase>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:977
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>Right</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Next Bullet</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>Desno</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Naredna grafička oznaka</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:980
#, no-c-format
msgid "Jump to the next bullet in the text if there is one."
msgstr "Skoči do slijedeće grafičke oznake ukoliko postoji."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:983
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>Left</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Last Bullet</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>Lijevo</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Posljednja grafička oznaka</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:986
#, no-c-format
msgid "Jump to the previous bullet in the text if there is one."
msgstr "Skoči na prethodnu grafičku oznaku ukoliko postoji."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:995
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select"
msgstr "Odaberi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:997
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Editing is of course one of the main aspects when you use a program like "
"&kile;. Although &kate; already has great capabilities, &kile; adds some "
"important features, which are especially needed to write &latex; source. "
"&latex; always needs a lot of environments and groups, so &kile; supports "
"very special commands to select them. Under <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Select</guisubmenu></menuchoice> you will find the "
"following commands to select text."
msgstr ""
"Izmjena je, naravno, jedan od glavnih apekata kada koristite programe kao "
"&kile;. Iako &kate; već ima odlične mogućnosti, &kile; dodaje neka bitna "
"svojstva, koja su naročito potrebna za pisanje u  &latex; koda.  &latex;  "
"zahtijeva uvijek mnogo okruženja i grupa, pa &kile; podržava specijalne "
"komande za njihov odabir. U <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmijeni</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Odaberi</guisubmenu></menuchoice>  naći ćete slijedeće "
"komande za odabir teksta."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1005
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Edit->Select items</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Izmijeni->Select items</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1011
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Edit->Select items</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izmjeni->Odaberi stavke</phrase>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1017
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Environment (inside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> "
"<guimenuitem>Okruženje(unutrašnjost)</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1021
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select an environment without the surrounding tags. If this command is "
"called, when an environment is already selected, &kile; will expand the "
"selection to the next surrounding environment."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite okruženje bez okolnih oznaka. Ako je komanda pozvana, kad je "
"okruženje već odabrano, &kile; će proširiti odabir na slijedeće okruženje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1027
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,F</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Environment (outside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,F</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Okruženje (vani)</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1031
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select an environment including the surrounding tags. This selection can "
"also be expanded with a second call of this command."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite okruženje sa okolnim oznakama. Ovaj odabir može biti proširen sa "
"drugim pozivom iste komande."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1036
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,T</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX Group (inside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,T</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX Grupa (unutra)</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1040
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select a TeX group inside the surrounding braces."
msgstr "Odaberite TeX grupu unutar zatvorenih zagrada."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1044
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,U</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX Group (outside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,U</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX grupa (outside)</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1048
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select a TeX group including the surrounding braces."
msgstr "Odaberite TeX  grupu uključujući zatvorene zagrade."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1052
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Math Group</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Matematska grupa</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1056
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the current math group including the math commands."
msgstr "Odaberite trenutnu matematsku grupu uključujući matematske komande."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1059
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Paragraph</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Paragraf</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1063
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a whole paragraph, &ie; a group of text lines separated on both sides "
"by empty lines. A paragraph does not mean just continuous lines of text, as "
"it is in other text editors. This extended meaning also includes tables, "
"&latex; commands and all other lines of source. The only important thing for "
"&kile; is that kind of paragraph is separated by two empty lines."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite cijeli paragraf, &ie; grupu linija teksta razdvojenih sa praznim "
"redovima na obje strane. PAragraf ne znači samo kontinualan niz teksta, kao "
"u drugim editorima. Ovo prošireno značenje također uključuje i tabele, "
"&latex; komande i sve ostale linije koda. Jedina bitna stvar za &kile; je da "
"je ova vrsta paragrafa razdvojena sa dva prazna reda."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1071
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,L</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Line</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,L</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Red</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1075
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the text line of the current cursor position."
msgstr "Odaberite red teksta trenutne pozicije kursora."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1079
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,W</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX Word</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,W</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX riječ</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1083
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the word under the current cursor position. This selection has also "
"en extended meaning, because this command can also select &latex; commands, "
"which begin with a backslash and may also have an optional star at the end."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite riječ unutar trenutne pozicije kursora. Ovaj odabir,također, ima "
"prošireno značenje, jer komanda može odabrati i &latex; komandu,koja počinje "
"sa kosom crtom i može imati zvijezdicu na kraju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1094
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select &latex; commands"
msgstr "Odaberite &latex; komandu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1096
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; has an extended feature to select &latex; commands. If you for "
"example have typed"
msgstr ""
"&kile; ima proširena svojstva za odabir &latex; komandi. Ako ste,naprimjer,"
"napisali"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1099
#, no-c-format
msgid "text \\bfseries\\itshape more text"
msgstr "tekst\\bfseries\\itshape još teksta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"and double click on one of the &latex; commands, both will be selected. But "
"often you only want to select one of two or more commands. This can be done "
"using the <keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo> key. You only have to press the "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo> key and a double click will only select the "
"desired command."
msgstr ""
"i uradili dupli klik na jednu od &latex; komandi, obje će biti odabrane. "
"Često, želite odabrati jednu od dvije ili više komandi. Ovo možete postići "
"koristeći <keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo> tipka. treba samo da pritisnete "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo> tipkai duplim klik će selektovati samo željenu "
"komandu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Obriši"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete some parts of a document you can of course select them, and then "
"use the <keycombo><keycap>Delete</keycap></keycombo> key. &kate; also offers "
"the command <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>K</keycap></keycombo> which deletes the "
"whole line. But &kile; offers a faster way with its own delete commands. "
"Under <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guisubmenu>Delete</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice> you will find following commands to delete text."
msgstr ""
"Za brisanje pojedninih dijelova dokumenta, možete ih jednostavno označiti i "
"koristiti <keycombo><keycap>Obriši</keycap></keycombo> tipku. &kate; također "
"nudi komandu<keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>K</keycap></keycombo> koja briše "
"kompletan red. Ali &kile; nudi brži način sa svojim vlastitim komandama za "
"brisanje. Unutar menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</guimenu><guisubmenu>Obriši</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>  pronaći čete slijedeće komande za brisanje teksta."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1122
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Edit->Delete items</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Izmjeni->Obriši stavke</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1128
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Edit->Delete items</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izmjeni->Obriši stavke</phrase>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Environment (inside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Okruženje (unutra)</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete an environment without the surrounding tags."
msgstr "Obriši okruženje bez okolnih oznaka."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,F</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Environment (outside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,F</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Okruženje (vani)</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete an environment including the surrounding tags."
msgstr "Obriši okruženje uključujući okolne oznake."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,T</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX Group (inside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,T</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX grupa "
"(unutrašnjost)</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete a TeX group inside the surrounding braces."
msgstr "Obriši &tex;  grupu unutar zatvorenih zagrada."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,U</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX Group (outside)</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,U</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX grupa (vani)</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1159
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete a TeX group including the surrounding braces."
msgstr "Obriši &tex;  grupu uključujući zatvorene zagrade."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Math Group</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Matematska grupa</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete the current math group including the math commands."
msgstr "Obriši trenutnu matematsku grupu uključujući matematematske komande."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Paragraph</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Paragraf</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Delete a whole paragraph. Look at the <menuchoice><guisubmenu>Select</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Paragraph</guimenuitem></menuchoice> command, how a "
"paragraph is defined in &kile;."
msgstr ""
"Obirši cijeli parafgraf. Pogledaj u  <menuchoice><guisubmenu>Odaberi</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Paragraf</guimenuitem></menuchoice> komandi, kako je "
"definiran paragraf u &kile;-u."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,I</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>To End of Line</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,I</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Do kraja reda</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Delete the text from the current cursor position to the end of the line."
msgstr "Obriši tekst od trenutne pozicije kursora do kraja reda."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,W</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX Word</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>T</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,W</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>TeX riječ</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete the word or &latex; command under the current cursor position."
msgstr "Obriši riječ ili  &latex; komandu ispod trenutne pozicije kursora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Okruženje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It was already mentioned that environments are a central point in &latex;. "
"So &kile; offers five other commands to make the work with &latex; as easy "
"as possible under submenus <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Environment</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Već je ranije spomenuto da su okruženja centralna tačka u &latex;u. Zato "
"&kile;  nudi pet drugih najednostavnijih mogućih  komandu za rad s  &latex;-"
"om, unutar podmenija <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Okruženje</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1209
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Edit->Environment items</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Izmjeni->Stavke okruženja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1215
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Edit->Environment items</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izmjeni->Stavke okruženja</phrase>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,B</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Go to Begin</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,B</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Idi na početak</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command will jump to the beginning of the current environment, wherever "
"your current position is. The cursor will be placed directly in front of the "
"opening environment tag."
msgstr ""
"Ova komanda otići na početak trenutnog oruženja,bez obzira koja je vaša "
"trenutna pozicija. Kursor će biti postavljen direktno ispred otvarajuće "
"oznake okruženja."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Go to End</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Idi na kraj</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command will jump to the end of the current environment, wherever your "
"current position is. The cursor will be placed directly behind the closing "
"environment tag."
msgstr ""
"Ova komanda otići na kraj trenutnog oruženja,bez obzira koja je vaša "
"trenutna pozicija. Kursor će biti postavljen direktno iza zatvarajuće oznake "
"okruženja."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Match</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Pogodak</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When your cursor is placed in front of or above the <userinput>"
"\\begin{environment}</userinput> tag, it will be moved to the opposite end "
"of the environment and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Kada je kursor postavljen ispred ili iznad  <userinput>\\begin{environment}</"
"userinput> oznake, bit će pomjeren na suprotan kraj okruženja i obrnuto."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,C</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,C</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Zatvori</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1253
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Typing a lot of nested environment tags, you may lose control of all those "
"environments. This command will close the last opened environment, so that "
"the nested structure of environments will not be broken."
msgstr ""
"Pisanjem mnogo ugnježdenih oznaka okruženja, možete izgubiti kontrolu nad "
"svim ovim okruženjima. Ova komanda će zatvoriti posljednje otvoreno "
"okruženje, tako da ugnježdena struktura okruženja neće biti narušena."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,A</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Close All</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,A</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Zatvori sve</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This closes all open environments, not only the last opened environment."
msgstr "OVo zatvara sva otvorena okruženja, osim posljednjeg otvorenog."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1272
#, no-c-format
msgid "&tex; Group"
msgstr "&tex; Grupa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; also offers some special commands for &latex; groups, which are "
"determined by braces <userinput>{...}</userinput>. In submenu "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guisubmenu>TeX Group</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice> you will find some important commands, which correspond to those "
"from <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guisubmenu>Environment</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"&kile; također nudi neke specijalne komande za &latex; grupe, koje su "
"određene zagradama <userinput>{...}</userinput>. U "
"podmeniju<menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</guimenu><guisubmenu>TeX Grupa</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> pronaćićete neke bitne komande koje odgovaraju onim "
"u <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</guimenu><guisubmenu>Okruženje</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1282
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Edit->TeX Group</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Izmjeni->TeX Grupa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1288
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Edit->TeX Group</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izmjeni->TeX Grupa</phrase>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,B</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Go to Begin</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,B</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Idi na početak</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command will jump to the beginning of the current group, wherever your "
"current position is. The cursor will be placed directly in front of the "
"opening brace."
msgstr ""
"Ova komanda će skočiti na početak trenutne grupe, bez obzira koja je vaša "
"trenutna pozicija. Kursor će biti postavljen direktno ispred otvorene "
"zagrade."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Go to End</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,E</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Idi na kraj</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command will jump to the end of the current group, wherever your "
"current position is. The cursor will be placed directly behind the closing "
"brace."
msgstr ""
"Ova komanda će skočiti na kraj trenutne grupe, bez obzira koja je vaša "
"trenutna pozicija. Kursor će biti postavljen direktno iza zatvorene zagrade."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Match</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,M</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Sparivanje</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When your cursor is placed in front of or behind an opening brace of a &tex; "
"group, he will be moved to the opposite end of the group and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Kad je kursor postavljen ispred ili iza otvorene zagrade &tex; grupe, bit će "
"pomjeren na suprotan kraj grupe i obrnuto."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,C</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>G</keycap></"
"keycombo> <keycap>,C</keycap></shortcut> <guimenuitem>Zatvori</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Typing a lot of nested group braces may be hard work. This command will "
"close the last opened group, so that the nested structure of &tex; groups "
"will not be broken."
msgstr ""
"Pisanje velikog broja ugnježdenih grupnih zagrada može biti teža posao. Ova "
"komanda će zatvoriti posljednju otvorenu grupu, tako da ugnježdena struktura "
"&tex; grupe neće biti narušena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1336
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Double Quotes</title>"
msgstr "<title>Dopli navodnici</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &latex;, two single quotes are used as double quotes. To help you insert "
"these efficiently, &kile; allows you to press <keycap>\"</keycap> to insert "
"two opening single quotes. Furthermore, if you want to close a quotation, "
"you also have to press <keycap>\"</keycap>. &kile; will be smart enough to "
"recognize this case and inserts two closing quotes for &latex;."
msgstr ""
"U &latex;-u dva pojedina navodnika se koriste kao dupli navodnici. Da biste "
"ih umetnuli efikasno,  &kile; dozvoljava pritiskanje <keycap>\"</keycap> za "
"umetanje dva otvorena pojedinačna navodnika. Dalje, ako želite da zatvorite "
"navode, također treba da pritisnete <keycap>\"</keycap>. &kile; će biti "
"dovoljno pametan da prepozna situaciju i umetne dva zavorena navodnika za "
"&latex;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get a literal double quote on the other side, press <keycap>\"</keycap> "
"twice."
msgstr ""
"Da doslovno dobijete duple navodnike, pritisnite <keycap>\"</keycap> dva "
"puta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enable or disable this auto insertion of opening and closing double "
"quotes in section <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Možete omogićiti ili onemogućiti automatsko umetanje otvorenih i zatvorenih "
"navoda u sekciji <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1355
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Double Quotes</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dupli navodnici</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1361
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Double Quotes</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dupli navodnici</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you also include language-specific options like <userinput>ngerman</"
"userinput> or <userinput>french</userinput>, you will also be able to use "
"German or French double quotes. Many more languages are available."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko, također, uključite opciju specifikacije jezika kao  "
"<userinput>ngerman</userinput> ili <userinput>french</userinput>, moći ćete "
"koristiti njemačke ili francuske duple navodnike. Mnogo drugih jezika je "
"dostupno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1375
#, no-c-format
msgid "Smart Newline"
msgstr "Pametni novi red"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you press <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>Return</keycap></keycombo>, &kile; "
"inserts an intelligent newline. If your current position is inside a list "
"environment, like <userinput>enumerate</userinput> or <userinput>itemize</"
"userinput>, &kile; will not only insert a newline, but also add a <userinput>"
"\\item</userinput> command."
msgstr ""
"Ako pritisnete <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>Vrati se</keycap></keycombo>, &kile; "
"umeće inteligentno novi red. Ako je vaša trenutna pozicija unutar liste "
"okruženja, kao<userinput>numeriši</userinput> ili <userinput>podesi stavke</"
"userinput>, &kile; ne samo da če dodati novi red, već će također dodati i "
"<userinput>\\stavka</userinput> komandu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1383
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are inside a tabular environment, &kile; will finish the current line "
"with <userinput>\\\\</userinput>, followed by the newline."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko se nalazite unutar tabelarnog okruženja, &kile; će završiti trenutni "
"red sa <userinput>\\\\</userinput>,praćeni novim redom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are inside a &latex; comment, &kile; will start the next line with a "
"<userinput>%</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko se nalazite unutar &latex; komentara, &kile; će početi slijedeći red "
"sa <userinput>%</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Even better, &kile; is smart enough to support predefined &latex; and user "
"defined environment, which can be added in section "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Još bolje, &kile;  je dovoljno pametan da podrži predefinisana &latex;  i "
"korisnički definisana okruženja, koja mogu biti dodana u sekciji "
"menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>konfiguriši Kile...</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Smart Tabulator"
msgstr "Pametni Tabulator"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some users like to arrange columns in tabular environments and put all "
"ampersand characters <keycap>&amp;</keycap> beneath each other. &kile; tries "
"to support this. If you press <keycombo>&Alt;&Shift;<keycap>&amp;</keycap></"
"keycombo>, &kile; will look for the next tab in the row above. Although this "
"tab may not the corresponding tab, &kile; will add some spaces to adjust the "
"column position with the current tab."
msgstr ""
"Neki korisnici vole da urede kolone u tabelarnom okruženju i stave sve "
"ampersand karaktere <keycap>&amp;</keycap> jedan unutar drugog. &kile;"
"nastoji da ovo podrži. Ako pritisnete <keycombo>&Alt;&Shift;<keycap>&amp;</"
"keycap></keycombo>, &kile; će potražiti slijedeći tab u redu iznad. Iako ova "
"j tab ožda nije odgovarajući,  &kile; će dodati nekoliko mjesta da podesi "
"poziciju kolone u odnosu na trenutni tab."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1413
#, no-c-format
msgid "Code Completion"
msgstr "Kompletiranje koda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Although &kate; already offers a good completion mode, &kile; extended code "
"completion to support some special methods especially for &latex;. Five "
"different modes are integrated. Three of them work on demand, the other two "
"are autocompletion modes. All modes can be configured to work very "
"differently at <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"Kile...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Iako &kate; već nudi dobar način za kompletiranje koda, &kile; prosširuje "
"kompletiranje koda da bi podržao neke speijalne metode,naročito za &latex;. "
"Pet različitih režima je integrisano. Tri od njih pet radi na zahtjev, dok "
"su druga dva režimi za automatsko završavanje. Svi režimi rada mogu biti "
"prilagođeni da rade drugačije u <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši Kile...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1423
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic Environment Completion"
msgstr "Automatsko kompletiranje okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1425
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you begin a new environment, typing <userinput>\\begin{environment}</"
"userinput>, &kile; will automatically add an <userinput>\\end{environment}</"
"userinput> command, with a line in between for your text."
msgstr ""
"Kada pokrenete novo okruženje, upisujući <userinput>\\početak{okruženje}</"
"userinput>, &kile; će automatski dodati <userinput>\\kraj{okruženje}</"
"userinput>  komandu, sa redom između za tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Autocompletion can be turned off in the &latex; section of "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>LaTeX</guimenuitem><guilabel>Environments</"
"guilabel></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Automatsko kompletiranje se može isključiti u &latex;  sekciji "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>LaTeX</guimenuitem><guilabel>Okruženje</guilabel></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1434 index.docbook:1648
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Completing an Equation Environment</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kompletiranje okruženja jednačine</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1440 index.docbook:1654
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Completing an Equation Environment</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kompletiranje okruženja jednačine</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1442
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Completing an Equation Environment</para>"
msgstr "<para>Kompletiranje okruženja jednačine</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1450 index.docbook:1634
#, no-c-format
msgid "&latex; Commands"
msgstr "&latex; komande"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you type some letters, you can activate this completion mode for "
"&latex; commands and normal words with <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Complete</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>(La)TeX Command</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or the keyboard shortcut <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift;"
"<keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo>. &kile; first reads the letters from the "
"current cursor position to the left and stops at the first non-letter "
"character or a backslash. If this pattern begins with a backslash, &kile; "
"will enter completion mode for &tex; or &latex; commands. Otherwise it "
"enters normal dictionary mode, where you will not find any &latex; commands. "
"Depending on the chosen mode, a completion box will be opened. You will see "
"all commands or words whose beginning matches the current pattern. You can "
"navigate with the cursor keys through this list and select one entry with "
"&Enter; or a double click with the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Kada otipkate neka slova, možete aktivirati režim kompletiranja za &latex; "
"komande i normalne riječi sa <menuchoice><guimenu>izmjeni</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Završi</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>(La)TeX komanda</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili kratica sa tastature <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift;"
"<keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo>. &kile; prvo čita slova sa trenutne "
"pozicije kursora nalijevo i staje na prvom karakteru koji nije slovo ili "
"kosa crta. Ako obrazac počinje sam kosom crtom,  &kile; će pokrenuti režim "
"za kompletiranje za &tex; ili &latex; komande. U suprotnom, ući će u "
"normalan režim rada rječnika, gdje nećete pronaći nijednu &latex; komandu- "
"Zavisno od odabranog režima, kompletiranje će biti otvoreno. Vidjet ćete sve "
"komande ili riječi čiji se početak slaže sa trenutnim obrascem- Možete "
"upravljati sa kursorom kroz listu i odabrati jedan ulaz sa   &Enter; ili "
"duplim klikom miša."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1465 index.docbook:1491 index.docbook:1552 index.docbook:1568
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Completing a LaTeX Command</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kompletiranje LaTeX komande</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1471 index.docbook:1497 index.docbook:1558 index.docbook:1574
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Completing a LaTeX Command</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kompletiranje LaTeX komande</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you push the &Backspace; key, the last letter of your pattern will be "
"deleted, and the completion list may grow. On the other hand, if you type "
"another letter will expand the pattern and the visible word list may shrink."
msgstr ""
"Kada pritisnete &Backspace; tipku,posljednje slovo šablona će biti obrisano, "
"i lista kompletiranja može porasti. S druge strane, ako unesete još jedno "
"slovo, obrazac će se proširiti i vidjliva lista riječi se može smanjiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1481
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you decide not to select any of the suggestions, you can leave this "
"dialog with &Esc;."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko odlučite da ne odaberete nijednu od ponuđenih opcija, možete "
"napustiti prozor sa &Esc;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1484
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will see that all commands are written with a short description of their "
"parameters. These descriptions are of course stripped when you select a "
"command. Optionally you can let &kile; insert bullets at these places, so "
"that you can easily jump to these positions with <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Bullets</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Next Bullet</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> and insert the parameter you want."
msgstr ""
"Primjetit ćete da su sve komande napisane sa kratkim opisom parametara. Ovi "
"opisi nestanu kada odaberete komandu. Opcionalno, možete dozvoliti &kile; -u "
"umetanje grafičkih oznaka na ova mjesta, tako da možete vrlo jednostavno "
"skočiti na ove pozicije sa <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Grafičke oznake</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Slijedeća "
"grafička oznaka</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1502
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Complete</guilabel></"
"menuchoice> to configure one or more of these lists. You can choose "
"different word lists for &tex; and &latex; commands and dictionary mode for "
"normal words."
msgstr ""
"Idite na  <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši "
"Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Završi</"
"guilabel></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1508
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose the option <guimenuitem>Show Latex commands</guimenuitem>, the "
"entries of all chosen cwl files for &latex; command completion are shown in "
"a separate view of &kile;'s sidebar. So you will have a good survey, which "
"commands are available and what parameters and options must or can be given "
"for a completion. You can also simply select one entry with a mouse click "
"and it will be inserted into the document, where all named parameters and "
"options are stripped."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko odaberete opciju  <guimenuitem>Prikaži Latex komande</guimenuitem>, "
"unosi svih odabranih datoteka  sabijenih lista riječi za &latex; "
"kompletiranje komandi će se prikazati u odvojenom prozoru od &kile; "
"sidebara. Primjetit ćete koje su komande dostupne i koji parametri i opcije "
"moraju ili mogu biti dostupne za kompletiranje. Također, možete odabrati "
"samo jedan unos sa klikom miša i bit će umetnut u dokument, sa imenovanim "
"svim parametrima i skinutim opcijama."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1517
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>LaTeX commands in the sidebar</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>LaTeX komande u  sidebaru</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1523
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>LaTeX commands in the sidebar</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>LaTeX komande u  sidebaru</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1528
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As each chosen wordlist will be shown in a separate view for its own, there "
"could be too much views, so that &kile;'s main window may be greater than "
"small screens. As this looks very ugly, &kile; works with a maximum number "
"of allowed views, which is set to 10. If this value is too big for your "
"screen, you should reduce this number."
msgstr ""
"S obzirom da će svaka odabrana lista riječi biti prikazana u odvojenom "
"prozoru, može se desiti da bude previše preglednika, pa da je  &kile;glavni "
"prozor veći nego što to mali ekran dozvoljava. Pošto ovo izgleda jako "
"ružno,  &kile; radi sa maksimalnim brojem dozvoljenih preglednika, koji je "
"postavljen po automatizmu na 10. Ako je ovo preveliko za vaš ekran, trebate "
"smanjiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1540
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>command mode</emphasis> is not useful to complete "
"environments. You always have to type some letters of <userinput>\\begin</"
"userinput>, and invoking the completion mode will result in a huge list of "
"environments tags. On the other hand, environments are so often used that "
"&kile; offers a special mode to complete environments. Forget the opening "
"tag and write, for example, <userinput>eq</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Komandni režim rada</emphasis>  nije koristan za kompletiranje "
"koda okruženja. Uvijek morate unositi neka slova <userinput>\\početak</"
"userinput>i zazvijaći režim kompletiranja će rezultovati ogromnom listom "
"oznaka okruženja. S druge strane, okruženja se toliko često koriste da "
"&kile;  nudi specijalan režim za kompletiranje koda okruženja. Zaboravite za "
"oznaku otvaranja i napišite naprimjer <userinput>al</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1546
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you call the completion mode with <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Complete</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Environment</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or keyboard shortcut <keycombo>&Alt;&Shift;"
"<keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo>, the opening tag is automatically added "
"and you will see <userinput>\\begin{eq}</userinput>. After this change, the "
"completion list is much less cluttered."
msgstr ""
"Kada pozovete režim kompletiranja sa menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Završi</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Okruženje</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ili kraticom sa tastature <keycombo>&Alt;&Shift;<keycap>Space</"
"keycap></keycombo>, oznaka otvaranja se automatski dodaje i vidjet ćete "
"<userinput>\\početak{al}</userinput>. Nakon ove promjene, lista "
"kompletiranja je mnogo manje natrpana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now select an environment, and you will see that it is also automatically "
"closed. Even more, if &kile; recognizes it as a list environment, it will "
"also insert a first <userinput>\\item</userinput> tag."
msgstr ""
"Sada odaberite okruženje, i primjetit ćete da se automatski zatvara. "
"Štaviše, ako &kile; prepozna listu kao okruženje, umetnut će prvu  "
"<userinput>\\stavka</userinput> oznaku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1579
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Complete</guilabel></"
"menuchoice> to configure one or more of these lists. This mode uses the same "
"word lists as the completion mode for &tex; and &latex; commands."
msgstr ""
"Idite na <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši "
"Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Kompletiraj</"
"guilabel></menuchoice> da konfigurišete jednu ili više od ovih listi. Ovaj "
"režim koristi istu listu riječi kao i režim kompletiranja za &tex; i &latex; "
"komande."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1589 index.docbook:1618
#, no-c-format
msgid "Abbreviations"
msgstr "Skraćenice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; supports user defined lists of abbreviations, which are replaced on "
"demand by longer text strings. Look at <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</"
"guimenuitem><guilabel>Complete</guilabel></menuchoice> to configure one or "
"more of theses lists. For the example given here, the abbreviation list in "
"<filename>example.cwl</filename> must be chosen. In this file you will find "
"for example the entry <userinput>L=\\LaTeX</userinput> for example."
msgstr ""
"&kile; podržava korisnički definisanu listu skraćenica, koje su zamijenjene "
"na zahtjev sa dužim stringovima teskta. Pogledajte "
"menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Završi</guilabel></"
"menuchoice> za konfiguraciju jedne ili više ovih listi. Za primjer dat "
"ovdje, lista skraćenica <filename>example.cwl</filename> mora biti odabrana. "
"U ovoj datoteci ćete naprimjer naći, unos <userinput>L=\\LaTeX</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1599
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, type only the letter <userinput>L</userinput>. Now invoke the "
"abbreviation mode of word completion with <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Complete</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Abbreviation</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or keyboard shortcut <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Alt;"
"<keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo>, and the letter <userinput>L</userinput> "
"is replaced by the string <userinput>\\LaTeX</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Naprimjer, unesite samo slovo <userinput>L</userinput>.  Sada pozovite "
"skraćeni način rada kompletiranja koda sa <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Završi</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Skraćenica</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili kratica sa tastature <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Alt;"
"<keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo>,  i slovo <userinput>L</userinput> je "
"zamijenjeno stringom <userinput>\\LaTeX</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1605
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Abbreviation completion also supports newline <userinput>%n</userinput> and "
"<userinput>%C</userinput> to place the cursor, if these characters are "
"present in the expansion text. So if you have the entry"
msgstr ""
"Kompletiranje skraćenica također podržava novi red <userinput>%n</userinput> "
"i <userinput>%C</userinput> da postavite kursor, ako su ovi karakteri "
"prisutni u proširenom tekstu. Ukoliko imate unos"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1609
#, no-c-format
msgid "en1=\\begin{enumerate}%n\\item %C%n\\end{enumerate}%n"
msgstr "en1=\\begin{enumerate}%n\\item %C%n\\end{enumerate}%n"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1611
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"in the completion file, and invoke the abbreviation completion, the "
"expansion looks like below, where <userinput>x</userinput> shows the final "
"cursor position."
msgstr ""
"u datoteci kompletiranja i pozovite kompletiranje skraćenica, proširenje "
"izgleda kao ispod, gdje  <userinput>x</userinput> prikazuje finalnu poziciju "
"kursora."

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1614
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{enumerate}\n"
"        \\item x\n"
"\\end{enumerate}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{enumerate}\n"
"        \\item x\n"
"\\end{enumerate}"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1620
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose <guimenuitem>Show abbreviations</guimenuitem>, all possible "
"abbreviations are shown in a view of the sidebar. So you will have a good "
"survey of all possible abbreviations."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete <guimenuitem>Prikaži skraćenice</guimenuitem>, sve moguće "
"skraćenice su prikazane u pregledniku na sidebaru. Tako da ćete imati dobar "
"pregled svih mogućih skraćenica."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1630
#, no-c-format
msgid "Autocompletion Modes"
msgstr "Režimi automatskog kompletiranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1636
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also enable an autocompletion mode for &latex; commands. When a "
"given threshold of letters (default: 3) is entered, a popup window opens "
"with a list of all matching &latex; commands. You can select one of these "
"commands, or ignore this window and type further letters. The entries of the "
"completion box will always change and match your currently typed word."
msgstr ""
"Također, možete omogućiti režim automatskog kompletiranja za &latex; "
"komande. Kada je dati prag slova(3) unesen, otvori se prozor sa listom svih "
"odgovarajućih  &latex; komandi. Možete odabrati jednu od ovih komandi ili "
"zanemariti prozor i nastaviti alje sa tipkanjem. Unesi unutar prozora za "
"kompletiranje će se uviejk mijenjati i slagati sa Vašom trenutnom napisanom "
"rječju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1642
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Complete</guilabel></"
"menuchoice> to enable or disable this mode or to change the threshold."
msgstr ""
"Idite na <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši "
"Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Završi</"
"guilabel></menuchoice> da omogućite ili onemogućite ovaj režim ili da "
"promjenite prag."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1663
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document Words"
msgstr "Riječi dokumenta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1665
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Large dictionaries are not useful in autocompletion mode. But, we have seen "
"that a lot of words in a document are typed more than once. So &kile; offers "
"a completion for all words from the document that the user has already typed "
"before. You can manually invoke this completion, if you press "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo>. Note that this mode is "
"different from completion mode of &latex; commands."
msgstr ""
"Ogromni rječnici nisu korisni u režimu automatskog kompletiranja. Ali, "
"vidjeli smo da je veliki broj riječi u dokumentu napisan više puta. Tako, "
"&kile; nudi kompletiranje za sve riječi iz dokumenta koje je korisnik već "
"napisao. Kompletiranje možee pozvati ručno, ako pritisnete <keycombo>&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo>. Primjetite da je ovaj režim drugačiji od "
"režima kompletiranja za &latex; komande."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1672
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to turn this mode on or off, go to "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Editor</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Editing</"
"guimenuitem><guilabel>Auto Completion</guilabel></menuchoice>. In this "
"configuration dialog you can configure, if completion mode for document "
"words should be enabled. There is also an additional autocompletion mode, "
"where a completion box pops up, when a certain threshold is reached."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da uključite ili isključite ovaj način rada, idite na "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Editor</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Editing</"
"guimenuitem><guilabel>Auto Completion</guilabel></menuchoice>. U ovom "
"prozoru možete konfigurisati ako režim kompletiranja riječi za dokument "
"treba biti omogućen. Također, postoji i dodatni režim automatskog "
"kompletiranja, gdje se pojavi iskačući prozor za kompletiranje, kada je "
"određen prag dostignut."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1685
#, no-c-format
msgid "Writing Own Completion Files"
msgstr "Pisanje vlastitih datoteka za kompletiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1687
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The latest specification of the completion file format can found in the "
"<ulink url=\"http://projects.kde.org/projects/extragear/office/kile/"
"repository/revisions/master/raw/README.cwl\"> CWL file format specification</"
"ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Najnovija specifikacija formata datoteke za kompletiranje dostupna je na "
"<ulink url=\"http://projects.kde.org/projects/extragear/office/kile/"
"repository/revisions/master/raw/README.cwl\"> CWL file format specification</"
"ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1692
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Completion files can be installed in a user's home folder under the "
"<filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kile/complete/&lt;mode&gt;/</filename> "
"subdirectory, where <parameter>&lt;mode&gt;</parameter> either stands for "
"<constant>abbreviation</constant>, <constant>dictionary</constant> or "
"<constant>tex</constant>."
msgstr ""
"Datoteke za kompletiranje mogu biti instalirane u kroisničkom home fascikli "
"u <filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kile/complete/&lt;mode&gt;/</filename> "
"poddirektoriju, gdje <parameter>&lt;mode&gt;</parameter> predstavlja "
"<constant>skraćenica </constant> , <constant>rječnik</constant> ili "
"<constant>tex</constant>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1702
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wizards and Dialogs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1708
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This wizard has already been described in the section <xref linkend="
"\"intro_docwizard\" role=\"select: title pageabbrv\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Čarobnjaci su ved objašnjeni u sekciji <xref linkend=\"intro_docwizard\" "
"role=\"select: title pageabbrv\"/>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1714
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include Graphics"
msgstr "Uključi grafiku"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1716
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Include Graphics</guilabel> dialog makes insertion of graphics "
"as easy as possible. You can reach it via the menubar with "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>LaTeX</guimenu><guimenuitem>Image Insertion</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Please take a look at <xref linkend="
"\"build_graphics\" role=\"select: title pageabbrv\"/> and <xref linkend="
"\"build_epsgraphics\" role=\"select: title pageabbrv\"/> to get an overview "
"of some basic facts concerning graphic formats."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uključi grafiku</guilabel>  prozor pojednostavljuje umetanje "
"grafike. To možete preko menibara <menuchoice><guimenu>LaTeX</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Umetanje slika</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Molimo "
"obratite pažnju na  <xref linkend=\"build_graphics\" role=\"select: title "
"pageabbrv\"/> and <xref linkend=\"build_epsgraphics\" role=\"select: title "
"pageabbrv\"/> da biste dobili uvid u neke osnovne činjenice vezane za "
"formete grafike."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1723
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Including a graphics element</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Uključivanje elemenata grafike</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1729
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Including a graphics element</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Uključivanje elemenata grafike</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1735
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose a graphics file. This can be a JPEG, PNG, PDF, EPS or even a zipped "
"or gzipped EPS file. If you have installed <ulink url=\"http://www."
"imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</ulink> and also configured &kile; to use "
"it (<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>LaTeX</guimenuitem><guilabel>Graphics</guilabel></"
"menuchoice>), the width and the height of the graphic is automatically "
"shown. If &imagemagick; can determine a resolution, the size of the graphics "
"is also shown in centimeters."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite grafičku datoteku. To može biti JPEG, PNG, PDF, EPS ili čak "
"zatvorena EPS datoteka. Ukoliko ste instalirali <ulink url=\"http://www."
"imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</ulink> i konfigurisali &kile; za "
"korištenje (<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>LaTeX</"
"guimenuitem><guilabel>Grafika</guilabel></menuchoice>),  visina i širina "
"grafike je automatski pokazana. Ako &imagemagick;  može odrediti rezoluciju, "
"veličina grafike je također prikazana u centimetrima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1745
#, no-c-format
msgid "Decide whether your image shall be centered on the page."
msgstr "Odlučite da li će slika biti centrirana na stranici."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1747
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose whether you want the <userinput>\\graphicspath</userinput> notation "
"for your graphics file."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite da li želite <userinput>\\grafička putanja</userinput> notaciju za "
"vašu grafičku datoteku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1750
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default graphics files have to be in the same folder as your master "
"document. However, it is possible to put them in other folders to make "
"things tidier. Without a <userinput>\\graphicspath</userinput> command, "
"&kile; would include the path for the graphics file. But if you use "
"<userinput>\\graphicspath</userinput> in your preamble like this:"
msgstr ""
"Grafičke datoteke moraju biti u istoj fascikli kao i glavni dokument po "
"automatizmu. Međutim, moguće ih je staviti u odvojene fascikle, da izgleda "
"urednije. Bez <userinput>\\grafička putanja</userinput> komande, &kile; bi "
"uključio putanju za grafičku datoteku. Ali,ukoliko koristite <userinput>"
"\\grafička putanja </userinput> u pregovoru na sliejdeći način:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1758
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\graphicspath{{/path/to/my/graphics}{other/path/to/more/graphics}}"
msgstr "\\graphicspath{{/path/to/my/graphics}{other/path/to/more/graphics}}"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1760
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"and check this option, &kile; will only use the base name of the graphics "
"file."
msgstr ""
"i provjerite ovu opciju, &kile; će koristiti samo bazno ime grafičke "
"datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1763
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another example: if you set <userinput>\\graphicspath</userinput> command "
"like:"
msgstr ""
"Još jedan primjer: ukoliko podesite <userinput>\\grafička putanja</"
"userinput>  komandu kao:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1766
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\graphicspath{{./}{camera/}{images/}}"
msgstr "\\grafička putanja{{./}{kamera/}{slike/}}"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1768
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&latex; will search in the current folder, then in <filename>camera</"
"filename> and finally in <filename>images</filename> to find your graphics "
"file."
msgstr ""
"&latex; će pretražiti trenutnu fasciklu, a zatim i <filename>kamera</"
"filename>  i konačno <filename>slike</filename> da pronađe vašu grafičku "
"datoteku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1772
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose either a width or a height, the whole graphics will be "
"proportionally scaled. If you set two values for width and height at the "
"same time, width and height may be scaled with different factors, and this "
"could not be what you want. See also the information near the top of dialog "
"to know the original size of the graphics."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko odaberete visinu ili širinu, kompletna grafika će biti skalirana "
"proporcionalno. Ukoliko postavite dvije vrijednosti za visinu i širinu "
"istovremeno, visina i širina bi mogle biti skalirane sa različitim faktorima "
"i to neće biti ono što želite. Pogledajte informacije u blizini vrha prozora "
"da saznate izvornu veličinu grafike."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1778
#, no-c-format
msgid "Insert an angle by which to rotate the graphics counterclockwise."
msgstr ""
"Umetnite ugao pod kojim ćete rotirati grafiku suprotno od kretanja kazaljke "
"na satu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1780
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The bounding-box information is set automatically when you choose a graphics "
"file. This information is only needed when you work with traditional &latex; "
"and bitmapped graphics. See the discussion of <link linkend="
"\"build_epsgraphics\">EPS graphics</link>."
msgstr ""
"Granični prozor sa informacijama se postavlja automatski pri izboru grafičke "
"datoteke. Ove informacije su potrebne samo kada radite sa tradicionalnim "
"&latex;-om i bitmapiranom grafikom. Pogledajte diskusiju na <link linkend="
"\"build_epsgraphics\">EPS graphics</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1786
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If &latex; needs a bounding box and you do not want to generate a bb file, "
"&kile; supports this option. On the other side, &pdflatex; will give a "
"warning, when you want to include a png or jpg graphics with this option. "
"This checkbox enables or disables the bounding box option."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko &latex; zahtijeva granični prozor a ne ćelite da generišete bb "
"datoteku, &kile; podržava ovi opciju. S druge strane, &pdflatex; će vas "
"upozoriti kada želite da uključite png ili jpg grafiku sa ovom opcijom. Oaj "
"checkbox omogućava ili onemogućava opciju graničnog prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1791
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scale the image by the desired scale factor. &eg;, 0.5 to reduce by half, or "
"2 to double. When you use this option, you do not have to set a width or "
"height for the image."
msgstr ""
"Skalirajte sliku sa željenim faktorom skaliranja. &eg;, 0,5 da prepolovite, "
"ili 2 da uduplate. Kada koristite ovu opciju, ne morate postavljati visinu i "
"širinu slike."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1795
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Trim Image</guilabel>-tab you can crop your image in all "
"four directions."
msgstr ""
"U <guilabel>Ukrasi sliku</guilabel> tabu možete odrezati sliku u sva četiri "
"pravca."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1799
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, you have to specify whether you want to embed this image into a "
"figure environment. When you want the text to wrap around the figure, use "
"the wrapfigure environment instead."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, morate specificirati da li želite da ugradite sliku u oblik "
"okruženja. Kada želite da tekstom omotate oblik, koristite okruženje za "
"omotavanje oblika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1803
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you choose the wrapfigure environment, you need to include the wrapfig "
"package in your preamble."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste izabrali da omotate oblik okruženja, treba da uključite paket za "
"omotavanje u vaš predgovor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1805
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In either case you can insert a caption and a label for your image. "
"Generally, it is a good idea to add a different prefix to each kind of "
"label. It is common to use the prefix <userinput>fig:</userinput> for images."
msgstr ""
"U svakom slučaju možete ubaciti naslov i oznaku za vašu sliku. Generalno, "
"dobra je ideja da dodate različite prefikse za svaku od oznaka. Uobičajeno "
"se koristi prefiks <userinput>fig:</userinput> za slike."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1811
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you pick the figure environment, you can choose where &latex; should "
"position the figure preferably."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko odaberete okruženje oblika, možete birati gdje bi &latex; trebao "
"pozicionirati oblik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1814
#, no-c-format
msgid "In the wrapfigure environment you can"
msgstr "U okruženju omotavanja oblika možete:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1816
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pick a placement rule for the figure and decide whether the figure should "
"float or not. In a two-sided document you can define whether the figure "
"should be on the inside of the page or on the outside."
msgstr ""
"Izabrati pravilo za smještanje oblika i odlučiti da li će se oblik kretati "
"ili ne. U dvostranom dokumentu možete definisati da li će oblik biti na "
"unutrašnjoj ili vanjskoj ivici stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1820
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Define how many lines the wrapping text should be broken. If you leave this "
"empty, &latex; will determine this itself as good as possible."
msgstr ""
"Definisati koliko je skraćenih linija teksta postavljeno uporedo sa oblikom. "
"Ukoliko ovo ostavite prazno &latex; će sam odlučiti koliko je najbolje "
"moguće."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1824
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Define an overhang to the chosen side. This is especially useful when you "
"have columns in your document and you want a figure span over more than just "
"one column or you want it being wrapped by two columns."
msgstr ""
"Definisati da li će visiti na odabranoj strani. Ovo je naročito korisno kada "
"imate kolone u dokumentu i želite da oblik obuhvati više od jedne kolone ili "
"želite skraćen tekst na obje strane oblika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1828
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose a width for the figure. This should be a bit bigger than your actual "
"image width, so there will be some empty space between the figure and the "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Izabrati širinu oblika. Trebala bi biti malo veća od stvarne širine slike, "
"da bi ostavili malo praznog prostora između oblika i teksta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1840
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arrays and tabulars"
msgstr "Nizovi i tabulari"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1842
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the most boring jobs one can do in &latex; is to write a matrix or a "
"tabular environment. One has to keep track of all the elements, ensure that "
"the environment is well formed, and that all things are where they are "
"supposed to be. Good indentation helps, but there is a simpler way: using "
"&kile;'s <menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</guimenu><guimenuitem>Array</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or <menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Tabular</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu entries. You "
"will then have a matrix-formed input form that you can easily fill in with "
"your entries. This dialog also offers some options to typeset the tabular "
"material."
msgstr ""
"Jedan od najdosadnijih poslova koji se može raditi u &latex;-u je pisanje "
"matrica ili tabelarnih okruženja. Moraju se pratiti svi elementi,te se mora "
"osigurati da je okruženje pravilno formirano i da su sve stvari na mjestima "
"gdje bi trebale da budu. Dobro uvlačeje pomaže, ali postoji lakši način: "
"korištenje &kile; <menuchoice><guimenu>Čarobnjak</guimenu><guimenuitem>Niz</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili <menuchoice><guimenu>Čarobnjak</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Tabular</guimenuitem></menuchoice> unosa menija. Tako "
"dobijate unos u stilu matrice i možete vrlo jednostavno da ga popunite. Ovaj "
"prozor  također nudi neke vrste opcija za typeset tabelarnih materijala."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1852
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Inserting a tabular environment</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Umetanje tabularnog okruženja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1858
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Inserting a tabular environment</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Umetanje tabularnog okruženja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1863
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the toolbar on top of the dialog you can set the <userinput>align</"
"userinput> of a cell, define a certain <userinput>font style</userinput>, "
"<userinput>join</userinput> and <userinput>split</userinput> cells, choose a "
"<userinput>border</userinput>, and specify background and font "
"<userinput>colors</userinput>. On the very right there is a <guilabel>Paste</"
"guilabel> button. With this button you can insert a table from the clipboard "
"into the dialog, which allows you to copy and paste tables from a "
"spreadsheet program, for example."
msgstr ""
"Korištenjem alatne trake na vrhu prozora možete postaviti  "
"<userinput>poravnanje</userinput> ćelije, definisati određene  "
"<userinput>stilove fonta</userinput>, <userinput>udružiti</userinput> i "
"<userinput>razdvojiti</userinput> ćelije, izabrati <userinput>ivičenje</"
"userinput>, i specificirati pozadinu i <userinput>boju</userinput> fonta. Na "
"desnoj strani nalazi se <guilabel>Zalijepi</guilabel> dugme. S ovim dugmetom "
"možete umetnuti tabelu iz klipborda u prozor, koji vam dozvoljava da "
"kopirate i zalijepite tabele it tabelarnog prikaza,naprimjer."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1871
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the bottom you can choose how many rows and columns you want, and you can "
"tweak some more things about your array:"
msgstr ""
"Ispod možete izabrati koliko redova i kolona želite, i možete vidjeti još "
"neke detalje o nizovima:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1876
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> option you can select which environment "
"should be used for your array or tabular material."
msgstr ""
"Sa <guilabel>Naziv</guilabel>  opcijom možete odabrati koje okruženje treba "
"koristiti za vaš nizovni ili tabelarni mateijal."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1879
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select the vertical cell alignment with the <guilabel>Parameter</"
"guilabel> option. This is only enabled for environments which support that "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati vertikalno poravnanje ćelija sa <guilabel>Parametar</"
"guilabel>opcijom. Ovo je jedino omogućeno za okruženja koja podržavaju tu "
"komponentu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1883
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If it exists for the selected environment, you can select <guilabel>use "
"starred version</guilabel>. When you select this option, you also have to "
"specify a <guilabel>table width</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati <guilabel>koristite  verziju sa zvijezdom</guilabel>,ukoliko "
"postoji za odabrano okruženje. Kada odaberete ovu opciju, morate "
"specificirati <guilabel>širinu tabele</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1887
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tables sometimes look nicer when you select the <guilabel>use booktabs "
"package</guilabel> option."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad tabele izgledaju ljepše kada odaberete <guilabel>koristi paket "
"tabova za knjigu</guilabel> opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1890
#, no-c-format
msgid "Of course, you can also <guilabel>Center</guilabel> your whole array."
msgstr "Naravno, možete također <guilabel>Centrirati</guilabel> kompletan niz."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1893
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Inserting bullets</guilabel> helps you when you want to fill in "
"your content in the editor. With this option checked, &kile; will insert "
"bullet placeholders for each element of your array."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Umetni grafičke oznake</guilabel> vam pomaže kada ćelite da "
"popunite sadržaj u editoru. Sa označenom ovom opcijom, &kile; će umetnuti "
"placeholder za grafičke oznake za svaki element niza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1899
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</guimenu><guimenuitem>Tabbing</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> option will display a simpler dialog to quickly set up a tabbing "
"environment. It allows you to easily specify the number of rows or columns "
"and the required spacing."
msgstr ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Čarobnjak</guimenu><guimenuitem>Tabovanje</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> opcija će prikazati jednostavniji prozor za brže "
"postavljanje tabuliranja okruženja. Dozvoljava vam da jednistavnije "
"specificirate broj redova i kolona i traženi razmak."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1905
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserting floating elements"
msgstr "Unos pokretnih elemenata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1907
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; helps you with inserting your floating elements. With the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</guimenu><guimenuitem>Floats</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> wizard it is very simple to create a new figure or table-"
"environment."
msgstr ""
"&kile; vam pomaže sa umetanjem pokretnih elemenata. Sa  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Čarobnjak</guimenu><guimenuitem>pokreti</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> čarobnjakom je veoma jednostavno kreirati novi oblik ili "
"tabelarno okruženje."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1913
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Inserting a floating element</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Umetanje pokretnog elementa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1919
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Inserting a floating element</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Umetanje pokretnog elementa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1924
#, no-c-format
msgid "To insert a new floating environment just follow these steps:"
msgstr "Za umetanje novog pokretnog okruženja pratite sljedeće korake:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1930
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose whether you want to insert a figure or a table."
msgstr "Izaberite da li želite da umetnete oblik ili tabelu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1935
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the desired positioning rules."
msgstr "Odaberite željeno pravilo pozicioniranja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1940
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a caption for your floating element."
msgstr "Unesite naslov za vaš pokretni oblik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1945
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type in a label for your new floating element. &kile; will automatically "
"suggest an appropriate prefix , &eg; \"fig:\" for figures and \"tab:\" for "
"tables."
msgstr ""
"Unesite oznaku za vaš novi pokretni element. &kile; će automatski predložiti "
"odgovarajuće prefikse,  &eg; \"fig:\" za oblike i \"tab:\" za tabele."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1954
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserting Math environments"
msgstr "Umetanje matematskih okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1956
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remembering how all the different math elements work can be really annoying. "
"Of course &kile; can do the magic for you here: <menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Math</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Umetanje različitih matematskih elemenata može biti zaisza dosadno. Naravno, "
"&kile; može za vas napraviti magiju: <menuchoice><guimenu>Čarobnjak</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Matematika</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1960
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Inserting a math element</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Umetanje matematskih oblika</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1966
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Inserting a math element</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Umetanje matematskih oblika</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1971
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "Opcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1975
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Name:</guilabel> Choose the type of math element you want to "
"create."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Naziv:</guilabel> Odaberite tip matematskog elementa koji želite "
"da kreirate."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1976
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Without numbering:</guilabel> This can switch numbering off for "
"numbered elements like equations or aligns."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bez numeracije:</guilabel>  Ovo može isklučiti numeraciju za "
"elemente kao što su jednačine ili poravnanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1978
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Space command to separate groups:</guilabel> In an environment "
"which supports several groups like alignat, you can define a space separator "
"when you have more than one group. You can enter any space command here, "
"which exists in mathmode, &eg; \\quad."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Razdvojite komande za odvojite grupe:</guilabel> U okruženju koje "
"podržava nekoliko grupa kao alignat, možete definirati separator razmaka "
"kada imate više od jedne grupe. Ovdje možete unijeti bilo koju space "
"komandu, koja postoji u matematskom režimu rada,&eg; \\quad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1981
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Standard tabulator:</guilabel> Select the tabulator which should "
"be used. &kile; should automatically pick the right one for you here."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Standardni tabulator:</guilabel>Odabetire tabulator koji trebate "
"koristiti. &kile; bi trebao automatski odabrati onaj pravi za vas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1983
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Displaymath mode:</guilabel> For environments like matrices or "
"arrays you can choose with which math environment your mathematical text "
"should be displayed with."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Prikaži matematski način rada:</guilabel>Za okruženja kao što su "
"matrice ili nizovi možete odabrati u kom matematskom okruženju vaš tekst "
"treba biti prikazan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1985
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Use bullets:</guilabel> With this option checked, &kile; will "
"insert bullet placeholders for each element of your mathematical text."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristi grafičke oznake:</guilabel>Sa odabranom ovom opcijom, "
"&kile; će umetnuti placeholder grafičke oznake za svaki element vašeg "
"matematskog teksta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1992
#, no-c-format
msgid "&PostScript; Utilities"
msgstr "&PostScript; Pogodnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1994
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"PS files are not so popular as PDF files, but are an excellent base for "
"manipulations and rearrangements of pages. If you need PDF output, you can "
"rearrange pages with some &PostScript; utilities and then convert it to PDF "
"with <command>ps2pdf</command>."
msgstr ""
"PS datoteke nisu tako popularne kao PDF datoteke, ali su odlična baza za "
"manipulaciju i preuređivanje stranica. Ukoliko vam treba PDF izlaz, možete "
"preurediti stranice sa nekim&PostScript; pogodnostima i onda ih prebaciti u "
"PDF:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1999
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>&PostScript; Wizard</emphasis> under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</guimenu><guimenuitem>Postscript Tools</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> will suggest the most popular rearrangement. The "
"conversion is done by the programs <command>pstops</command> and "
"<command>psselect</command>, which can be found in most distributions in the "
"package <userinput>psutils</userinput>. If one of these programs is not "
"available, the corresponding item will not be visible."
msgstr ""
"The <emphasis>&PostScript; Čarobnjak</emphasis> unutar "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Čarobnjak</guimenu><guimenuitem>Postscript Alati</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> će predložiti najpopularnije preuređivanje. "
"Konverzija se radi u programima <command>pstops</command> i "
"<command>psselect</command>,koje možete naći u većini distribucija u paketu "
"<userinput>psutils</userinput>. Ukoliko neki od ovih programa nije dostupan, "
"odgovarajuća stavka neće biti vidjliva."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2008
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Dialog PSTools</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dialog PS Alati</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:2014
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Dialog PSTools</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dialog PS Alati</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2019
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First choose your input file. If &kile; finds a PS file corresponding to "
"your current master document, it is already filled in as input file, but you "
"are also free to choose another file. Then choose an output file, and select "
"one of the tasks. Finally, you have to decide whether you want to do the "
"conversion only, or also invoke &okular; to view the result."
msgstr ""
"Prvo odbaerite ulaznu datoteku. Ako &kile; pronađe PS datoteku koja odgovara "
"vašem trenutnom originalnom dokumentu, unaprijed je popunjena kao ulazna "
"datoteka, ali vi idalje imate mogućnost da odaberete drugu datoteku. Zatim,"
"odabrite izlaznu datoteku, i odaberite jedan od zadataka. Konačno, morate "
"dlučiti da li želite samo da odraditepretvaranje ili želite pozvati i "
"&okular; da vidite rezultate."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:2028
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 A5 page + empty page --> A4"
msgstr "1 A5 stranica + prazna stranicae --> A4"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2029
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Combine one A5 page together with one empty page on one A4 page. Whenever "
"two A5 pages are combined together, they are rotated 90 degrees and will be "
"arranged on an A4 page in landscape mode."
msgstr ""
