msgid ""
"There are many options for &PostScript; utilities <command>pstops</command> "
"and <command>psselect</command>. If you need a very special one, you can "
"invoke <command>pstops</command> with an option of your choice. Please read "
"the manual for all possible options."
msgstr ""
"Postoji mnogo opcija za &PostScript; pogodnosti  <command>pstops</command> i "
"<command>psselect</command>. Ukoliko trebate neku specifičnu, možete pozvati "
"<command>pstops</command> sa opcijom po vašem izboru. Molimo pročitajte "
"priručnik za upoznavanje sa svim mgućim opcijama."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:2241
#, no-c-format
msgid "psselect: choose parameter"
msgstr "psselect: odaberi parametar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can invoke <command>psselect</command> with an option of your choice. "
"Please read the manual for all possible options."
msgstr ""
"Možete pozvati <command>psselect</command> sa opcijom po vašem izboru. "
"Molimo pročitajte priručnik za sve moguće opcije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2252
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document Statistics"
msgstr "Statistika dokumenta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The statistics dialog in <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Statistics</guimenuitem></menuchoice> gives you an "
"statistical overview for a selection, a document or an whole project. It "
"includes the number of words, &latex; commands/environments and also "
"includes the number of characters for each type."
msgstr ""
"Prozor za statisiku u <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Statistika</guimenuitem></menuchoice> vam nudi "
"statistički pregled za izbor,  dokument ili kompletan projekt. To uključuje "
"broj riječi, &latex; komande/okruženja i također uključuje broj karaktera za "
"svaki tip."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The statistics obtained can be copied as text or as a nicely formatted "
"&latex; table to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Dobijena statistika može biti kopirana na clipboard.kao tekst ili lijepo "
"formatirana &latex; tabela."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you select a text and open the statistics dialog, you get the "
"statistics for the currently selected text. If you open the dialog without "
"any text selected, the statistics for all opened files are shown. If you "
"want to get statistics for the whole project, you can use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Project</guimenu><guisubmenu>Open All Project Files</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> for an easy and quick way to open all source files "
"of your project."
msgstr ""
"Kada označite tekst i otvorite prozor za statistiku, dobit čete statistiku "
"za trenutno označeni tekst. Ukoliko otvorite prozor bez označenog teksta, "
"prikazat će se statistika za sve ovorene datoteke. ukoliko želite da "
"dobijete statitstiku za kompletan projekt, možete koristiti "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Projekt</guimenu><guisubmenu>Otvori sve datoteke u "
"projektu</guisubmenu></menuchoice> za .ednostavan i brz način otvaranja svik "
"izvornih datoteka vašeg projekta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A note of caution has to be sounded about the accuracy of the numbers. We "
"have included some logic to get a good estimate, &eg; K\\\"uhler gives one "
"word and one command, with six resp. two characters. But there are other "
"combinations in which parts of commands are counted as words and vice versa. "
"Please note that the algorithm was developed and tested for languages "
"similar to English or German. So don't take the numbers for granted. If you "
"write a report whose length has to be of a certain numbers of words or "
"characters, please make some tests first in order to check whether &kile;'s "
"accuracy satisfies your needs."
msgstr ""
"Upozorenje vezano za preciznost brojeva treba biti zvučno. Uključili smo "
"logiku da bi dobili dobru procjenu,  &eg; K\\\"uhler daje jednu riječ i "
"jednu komandu, sa šest i dva karaktera respektivno. Ali postoje i druge "
"kombinacije u kojima se dijelovi komandu broje kao riječi i obrnuto. Molimo "
"primjetite da je algoritam razvijen i testiran za jezike slične Engleskom i "
"Nejmačkom. Stoga ne uzimajte brojeve zdravo za gotovo. Ukoliko pišete "
"izvvještaj čija veličina treba da bude određen broj riječi ili karaktera, "
"molimo testirajte prvo, da biste provjerili da li preciznost &kile;-a "
"zadovoljava vaše potrebe."

