#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2317
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The tooltips of the icons show the &latex; commands and additionally needed "
"packages."
msgstr "Natuknice ikona prikazuju &latex; komande i dodatno potrebne pakete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing <keycombo>&Shift;</keycombo> and clicking a symbol will result in "
"<userinput>$\\symbolcmd$</userinput> being inserted. Similar pressing "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo> inserts it in curly brackets."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom<keycombo>&Shift;</keycombo> i klikom na simbol dobijamo "
"umetnut<userinput>$\\symbolcmd$</userinput>. Slično, pritiskom na "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;</keycombo>  umećemo vitičaste zagrade."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you insert a command which requires a package which is not included in "
"your &latex; document, you will see a warning message in the logview window."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko umetnete komandu koja zahtijeva paket koji nije uključen u vaš "
"&latex; dokument, vidjet ćete poruku upozorenja u preglednom prozoru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first list of symbols holds the <guilabel>Most Frequently Used</"
"guilabel> symbols. Inserted symbols will be added to this list, for quick "
"and easy reference. The ordering of the symbols will not be changed upon "
"addition of new symbols, instead a reference counter is incremented. If the "
"number of items would exceed 30 items, the item with the lowest count will "
"get removed."
msgstr ""
"Prva lista simbola sadrži <guilabel>Najčešće korištene</guilabel> simbole- "
"Umetnuti simboli će biti dodani na listu, za jednostavno i brzo "
"referenciranje. POredak simbola neće biti promijenjen dodavanjem novih "
"simbola, umjesto toga brojač referenciranja se povećava. Ukoliko broj stavki "
"prelazi 30, stavka sa nanižim brojem se uklanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>User Defined</guilabel> symbol list can hold your own symbols. "
"To create your own symbols you need the program gesymb and the file "
"definitions.tex from the kile source package. Additionaly you need a &latex; "
"compiler (what a surprise) and <ulink url=\"http://www.dvipng.sourceforge.net"
"\">&dvipng;</ulink> (version 1.7 or later). The procedure is so that you "
"create a &latex; file with <userinput>\\input{definitions}</userinput>, "
"which makes the commands listed below available, and let <userinput>gesymb "
"mysymbols.tex user</userinput> (which calls &latex; and &dvipng;) create the "
"icons. After copying them to <userinput>$HOME/.kde/share/apps/kile/"
"mathsymbols/user/</userinput> and restarting kile you can use your own "
"symbols."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Korisnički definisana</guilabel> lista simbola može da sadrži "
"vlastite simbole. Za kreiranje vlastitih simbola, trebate program gesymb i "
"datoteku <filename>definitions.tex</filename>  iz kile izvornog paketa. "
"Dodatno, trebat će vam &latex; kompajler (kakvo iznenađenje) i <ulink url="
"\"http://www.dvipng.sourceforge.net\">&dvipng;</ulink> (verzija 1.7 ili "
"novija).Procudera je da kreirate &latex; datoteku  sa userinput>"
"\\input{definitions}</userinput>, koji izlistava dostupne komande, i dopušta "
"userinput>gesymb mysymbols.tex user</userinput> (koji poziva &latex; i "
"&dvipng;) da kreira ikone. Nakon njihovog kopiranja na <userinput>$HOME/.kde/"
"share/apps/kile/mathsymbols/user/</userinput> i restartovanja kile-a možete "
"koristiti vlastitie simbole."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2336
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following commands are defined in definitions.tex:"
msgstr "U <filename>definicije.tex</filename>su definisane slijedeće komande:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\command[\\optarg]{\\symbol}</userinput>: Include the symbol "
"<userinput>\\symbol</userinput> in the symbol list, the optional argument "
"<userinput>\\optarg</userinput> specifies the command which kile should "
"insert. If it is not given the command in the mandatory argument is used."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\command[\\optarg]{\\symbol}</userinput>: Uključuje simbol "
"<userinput>\\symbol</userinput>  u listu simbola, opcionalni argument "
"<userinput>\\optarg</userinput> specificira komandu koju kile treba da "
"umetne. ukoliko nije data, koristi se komanda u obaveznom argumentu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\mathcommand[\\optarg]{\\symbol}</userinput>: Same as above, "
"except that the command in the mandatory argument is inserted in math mode."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\mathcommand[\\optarg]{\\symbol}</userinput>: Isto kao iznad, "
"osim što komanda u obaveznom argumentu je ubačena u matematičkom režimu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\pkgs[arg]{pkg}</userinput>: Declare that the command given in "
"this line needs the &latex; package <userinput>pkg</userinput> with the "
"optional argument <userinput>arg</userinput>. This command has to be in "
"front of the <userinput>\\command</userinput> command and overrides any "
"package specification by the neededpkgs enviroment."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\pkgs[arg]{pkg}</userinput>: Deklarišite da komanda data u ovoj "
"liniji zahtijeva &latex; paket  <userinput>pkg</userinput> sa opcionalnim "
"argumentom <userinput>arg</userinput>.  Ova komanda mora biti ispred  "
"<userinput>\\command</userinput> komande i preklapa bilo koju specifikaciju "
"paketa sa neededpkgs okruženjem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\begin{neededpkgs}[pkgs-args]{pkgs} ... \\end{neededpkgs}</"
"userinput>: Has the same effect as above, but for all enclosed commands."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\begin{neededpkgs}[pkgs-args]{pkgs} ... \\end{neededpkgs}</"
"userinput>: Ima isti efekat kao gore, ali za sve uokvirene komande."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2368
#, no-c-format
msgid "An example for completeness is given here:"
msgstr "Primjer potpunosti je dat ovdje:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\documentclass[a4paper,10pt]{article}\n"
"\\usepackage{amssymb}\n"
"\\input{definitions}\n"
"%\n"
"\\begin{document}\n"
"\\pagestyle{empty}\n"
"%\n"
"\\begin{neededpkgs}{amssymb}\n"
"\\mathcommand{\\surd}\n"
"\\pkgs{amsmath}\\mathcommand[\\ddddot{}]{\\ddddot{a}}\n"
"\\mathcommand{\\angle}\n"
"\\end{neededpkgs}\n"
"\\command{\\\"A}\n"
"\\mathcommand{\\exists}\n"
"\\mathcommand[\\stackrel{}{}]{\\stackrel{abc}{=}}\n"
"\n"
"%\\begin{neededpkgs}[russian,koi8-r,T2C,]{babel,inputenc,fontenc,mathtext}\n"
"%\n"
"%   \\end{neededpkgs}\n"
"% this would need to include the packages\n"
"% \\usepackage{mathtext}\n"
"% \\usepackage[T2C]{fontenc}\n"
"% \\usepackage[russian]{babel}\n"
"% \\usepackage[koi8-r]{inputenc}\n"
"%  just to explain the format\n"
"\\end{document}"
msgstr ""
"\\documentclass[a4paper,10pt]{article}\n"
"\\usepackage{amssymb}\n"
"\\input{definitions}\n"
"%\n"
"\\begin{document}\n"
"\\pagestyle{empty}\n"
"%\n"
"\\begin{neededpkgs}{amssymb}\n"
"\\mathcommand{\\surd}\n"
"\\pkgs{amsmath}\\mathcommand[\\ddddot{}]{\\ddddot{a}}\n"
"\\mathcommand{\\angle}\n"
"\\end{neededpkgs}\n"
"\\command{\\\"A}\n"
"\\mathcommand{\\exists}\n"
"\\mathcommand[\\stackrel{}{}]{\\stackrel{abc}{=}}\n"
"\n"
"%\\begin{neededpkgs}[russian,koi8-r,T2C,]{babel,inputenc,fontenc,mathtext}\n"
"%\n"
"%   \\end{neededpkgs}\n"
"% this would need to include the packages\n"
"% \\usepackage{mathtext}\n"
"% \\usepackage[T2C]{fontenc}\n"
"% \\usepackage[russian]{babel}\n"
"% \\usepackage[koi8-r]{inputenc}\n"
"%  samo da se objasni format\n"
"\\end{document}"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2376
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Bibitems"
msgstr "Korištenje bibliografskih stavki"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\\bibitem</userinput> is a command used to enter a reference in a "
"<userinput>thebibliography</userinput> environment in your document. The "
"syntax for using <userinput>\\bibitem</userinput> is <userinput>"
"\\bibitem[label]{key}</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\\bibitem</userinput>je komanda koja se koristi za unos referenci "
"u <userinput>bibliografija</userinput> okruženje u vašem dokumentu.Sintaksa "
"za korištenje <userinput>\\bibligrafske stavke</userinput> je <userinput>"
"\\bibliografskastavka[oznaka]{ključ}</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The optional <userinput>[label]</userinput> is for you to add your own "
"labeling system for the bibliography entry. If no label is set, the entries "
"will be set in numerical order: [1], [2], [3], &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Opcionalno je <userinput>[oznaka]</userinput> da dodate u vlastiti sistem "
"označavanja za unos bibliografije. Ukoliko nije postavljenja oznaka, unosi "
"će biti postavljeni u numeričkom redu [1], [2], [3], &etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The argument <userinput>{key}</userinput> is used to reference and link the "
"commands <userinput>\\bibitem</userinput> and <userinput>\\cite</userinput> "
"to each other and the information they contain. The command <userinput>"
"\\cite</userinput> contains the label associated with the intended "
"<userinput>\\bibitem</userinput>, which is located inside a "
"<userinput>thebibliography</userinput> environment, and contains the "
"reference data. Both corresponding <userinput>\\bibitem</userinput> and "
"<userinput>\\cite</userinput> must have the same <userinput>{key}</"
"userinput>; the easiest way to organize keys is by the author's last name. "
"The secondary braces in the <userinput>thebibliography</userinput> "
"environment denote the longest bibliography label you expect to have. So, "
"inserting <userinput>{<replaceable>foo</replaceable>}</userinput> means you "
"can have any label shorter or as large as the expression "
"<userinput><replaceable>foo</replaceable></userinput>. Failure to set this "
"parameter correctly may result in a not so attractive indentation of your "
"bibliography."
msgstr ""
"Argument<userinput>{key}}</userinput> se koristi za referenciranje i "
"poezivanje komandi  <userinput>\\bibitem</userinput> i <userinput>\\cite</"
"userinput> jedne s drugom i informacija koje sadrže. Komanda <userinput>"
"\\cite</userinput> sadrži oznaku povezanu sa  namjenjenom<userinput>"
"\\bibitem</userinput>,koja se nalazi unutar <userinput>bibliografija</"
"userinput>okruženja, i sadrži referencirane podatke. Oba odgovarajuća "
"<userinput>\\bibitem</userinput> i <userinput>\\cite</userinput>moraju imati "
"isti <userinput>{ključ}</userinput>; najlakši način organizacije ključeva je "
"po prezimenu autora. Sporedne zagrade u <userinput>bibliografija</"
"userinput>okruženju obilježavaju nadužu bibliografsku oznaku koju očekujute "
"da imate. Stoga, umetanje <userinput>{<replaceable>foo</replaceable>}</"
"userinput>  znači da možete skratiti oznaku ili je postaviti na dužinu "
"izraza<userinput><replaceable>foo</replaceable></userinput>.  Neuspjeh "
"postavljanja ovog parametra ispravno može rezultovati ne tako atraktivim "
"uvlačenjem vaše bibliografije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The bibliography is a section apart from your main document, and an example "
"of code for the bibliography would look like the following:"
msgstr ""
"Bibliografije je sekcija nezavisna od vašeg glavnog dokumenta, i primjer "
"koda za bibliografiju bi izgledao ovako:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{thebibliography}{50}\n"
"        \\bibitem{Simpson} Homer J. Simpson. \\textsl{Mmmmm...donuts}. "
"Evergreen Terrace Printing Co.,\n"
"                          Springfield, SomewhereUSA, 1998\n"
"\\end{thebibliography}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{thebibliography}{50}\n"
"        \\bibitem{Simpson} Homer J. Simpson. \\textsl{Mmmmm...donuts}. "
"Evergreen Terrace Printing Co.,\n"
"                          Springfield, SomewhereUSA, 1998\n"
"\\end{thebibliography}"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then, your main source code would contain the location of the information "
"relating to the <userinput>\\bibitem</userinput> using <userinput>\\cite</"
"userinput>. That source code would look similar to this:"
msgstr ""
"Zatim,vaš glavni izvorni kod bi sadržao lokaciju informacija vezanih za "
"<userinput>\\bibliografskastavka</userinput> koristeći<userinput>\\citat</"
"userinput>.  Izvorni kod bi izgledo slično ovome:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"My thesis, about the philosophy of The Simpsons\\copyright comes from my "
"favorite book \\cite{Simpson}."
msgstr ""
"Moja teza, o filozofiji Simpsona \\copyright iz moje omiljene knjige"
"\\cite{Simpson}."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2410
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As it is often difficult to remember the exact citation key once you have "
"many references, &kile; provides an easy way to insert a citation. Using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>LaTeX </guimenu><guimenuitem>References</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Cite</guimenuitem></menuchoice> a list with all the "
"citation keys pops up. Select the correct reference and a citation will be "
"inserted into your document. To update the list of keys, either save the "
"file, or <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Refresh Structure</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or press <keycap>F12</keycap>. With code "
"completion enabled, &kile; will show you a list of all the "
"<userinput>bibitem</userinput>-labels as soon as you open up a <userinput>"
"\\cite</userinput> command."
msgstr ""
"S obzirom da je često teško zapamtiti tačan ključ citiranja kada imate mnogo "
"referenci, &kile; obezbjeđuje jednostavan način za umetanje citata. "
"Korisštenjem <menuchoice><guimenu>LaTeX </guimenu><guimenuitem>Reference</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Citat</guimenuitem></menuchoice>pojavit će se lista "
"sa svim ključevima citata. Odaberite ispravnu referencu i citat će biti "
"umetnut u vaš dokument- Da biste ažurirali listu ključeva, spasite datoteku "
"ili <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjenu</guimenu><guimenuitem>Osvježi Strukturu</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, ili pritisnite<keycap>F12</keycap>.  Sa "
"omogućenim kompletiranjem koda, &kile; će prikazati listu svih "
"<userinput>bibliografskestavke</userinput>oznaka čim otvorite <userinput>"
"\\citat</userinput>komandu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The final result in your document's bibliography would then look like this:"
msgstr "Finalni rezultat u bibliografiji dokumenta bi izgledao ovako:"

#. Tag: computeroutput
#: index.docbook:2422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"[1] Homer J. Simpson. Mmmmm...donuts. Evergreen Terrace Printing Co., "
"Springfield, SomewhereUSA, 1998."
msgstr ""
"[1] Homer J. Simpson. Mmmmm...krofne. Evergreen Terrace Printing Co., "
"Springfield, NegdjeuUSA, 1998."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2425
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; can also work together with &bibtex; editors, such as &kbibtex; to "
"make it easier to enter citations. When a &bibtex; file is added to the "
"project, &kile; will help you complete citation commands, just as described "
"above"
msgstr ""
"&kile; može raditi skupa sam &bibtex; editorima kao što su &kbibtex; da "
"pojednostavi unos citata. Kada je  &bibtex; datoteka dodana u projekt, "
"&kile; će vam pomoći da kompletirate komande citiranja,baš kao što je "
"opisano iznad."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2433
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "User-Defined Tags"
msgstr "Korisnički definisano"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; gives you the ability to make your own tags. A tag is similar to a "
"shortcut that launches some command or writes frequently-used text. For "
"example, Joe Sixpack uses often the sentences <userinput>I prefer \\LaTeX\\ "
"to \\TeX\\</userinput> and <userinput>What would I do without &Linux;?</"
"userinput>. To create user-defined tags to write these sentences, he would "
"access <menuchoice><guimenu>LaTeX</guimenu><guisubmenu>User Tags</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Edit User Tags...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>; this "
"will present him a dialog where he can create his own user-defined tags."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2444
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Edit User Tags Dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pregled loga</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:2450
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Edit User Tags Dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pregled loga</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2452
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Edit User Tags Dialog</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pregled loga</para>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2457
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invoking a User-Defined Tag"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:2463
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Invoking a User Defined Tag</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Umetanje tabularnog okruženja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2465
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Invoking a User Defined Tag</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2469
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"He would probably give each tag a name that can clearly identify it. The "
"name you give your tag is entered in the section marked <guilabel>Menu item</"
"guilabel>, and the text of frequently-used command should be entered into "
"the section labeled <guilabel>Value</guilabel>. Once the commands are "
"entered, he can use them quickly using the shortcut <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift;"
"<keycap>1</keycap></keycombo> for the first tag to enter <userinput>I prefer "
"\\LaTeX\\ to \\TeX\\</userinput> and <keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift; <keycap>2</"
"keycap></keycombo> to enter <userinput>What would I do without &Linux;?</"
"userinput>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2478
#, no-c-format
msgid "Placeholders in User-Defined Tags"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2480
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are some placeholders you can use in user-defined tags: they are "
"<userinput>%B</userinput>, <userinput>%C</userinput>, <userinput>%M</"
"userinput> and <userinput>%S</userinput>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2485
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>%B</userinput>: will be replaced by a bullet."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$$AUTHOR$$</userinput>: Ovaj string će biti zamijenjen sa "
"varijablom autora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2486
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>%C</userinput>: this is where the cursor will be placed after the "
"insertion of a user-defined tag."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$$AUTHOR$$</userinput>: Ovaj string će biti zamijenjen sa "
"varijablom autora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2488
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>%M</userinput>: this stands for marked text; the selected text is "
"inserted in its place when inserting user-defined tags."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2490
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>%S</userinput>: will be replaced by the source file's name "
"without file extension."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$$AUTHOR$$</userinput>: Ovaj string će biti zamijenjen sa "
"varijablom autora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2493
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let's consider the example you can see in the screenshots. First, we select "
"a number in our text, let's say <userinput>2</userinput>. Now we press "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>1</keycap></keycombo> or choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>LaTeX</guimenu><guisubmenu>User Tags</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem> Frac</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, and we obtain "
"<userinput>\\frac{2}{}</userinput> with the cursor begin located within the "
"second pair of brackets."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2506
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Build Tools"
msgstr "Alati Građenja"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2510
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compiling, converting and viewing"
msgstr "Kompajliranje,pretvaranje i pregled"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2512
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To view the result of your work, you first need to compile the source. All "
"the build tools are grouped closely together in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guisubmenu>Compile</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>, <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guisubmenu>Convert</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>, and <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>View</guisubmenu></menuchoice> menus."
msgstr ""
"ZA pregled rezultata vašeg rada, prvo treba da pretvorite izvor. Svi alati "
"građenja su grupisani zajedno u <menuchoice><guimenu>Gradi</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Kompajlira</guisubmenu></menuchoice>, "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Gradi</guimenu><guisubmenu>Pretvori</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>, i <menuchoice><guimenu>Gradi</guimenu><guisubmenu>Pregledaj</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> menijima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2519
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To compile your source code for screen viewers like &okular; or further "
"conversion, you can use the shortcut <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>2</keycap></"
"keycombo>. Then you can view the &DVI; file using your default viewer with "
"<keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>3</keycap></keycombo>, convert the &DVI; to a PS file "
"with <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>4</keycap></keycombo>, and view the PS file with "
"<keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>5</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Za kompajliranje izvornog koda za preglednike kao &okular; ili daljnja "
"pretvaranja, možete koristiti kraticu <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>2</keycap></"
"keycombo>. Onda možete pregledati &DVI; datoteke koristeći dati preglednik "
"sa <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>3</keycap></keycombo>,pretvaranje &DVI; u PS "
"datoteke sa <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>4</keycap></keycombo>, i pregled PS "
"datoteka sa <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>5</keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2528
#, no-c-format
msgid "&bibtex;"
msgstr "&bibtex;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2530
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are using <ulink url=\"http://www.ecst.csuchico.edu/~jacobsd/bib/"
"formats/bibtex.html\">&bibtex;</ulink> for your bibliography entries, you "
"usually have to follow a special compiling scheme. This means calling "
"&latex; and then &bibtex; and then &latex; twice again. Fortunately &kile; "
"is clever enough to detect automatically if it is necessary to call "
"additional tools like &bibtex;, &makeidx; and &asymptote;. This logic is "
"turned on by default and can be changed in <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Tools</"
"guisubmenu><guilabel>Build</guilabel></menuchoice> in the <guilabel>General</"
"guilabel> tab in the &latex; and &pdflatex; tools."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko koristite <ulink url=\"http://www.ecst.csuchico.edu/~jacobsd/bib/"
"formats/bibtex.html\">&bibtex;</ulink> za bibliografski unos, obično morate "
"pratiti specijalne šeme kompajliranja. Ovo znači pozivanje &latex;-a a zatim "
"i &bibtex;-a i onda &latex;-a još dva puta . Srećom, &kile; je dovoljno "
"pametan da automatski detektuje da li je nepohodno pozivanje dodatnih alata "
"kao &bibtex;, &makeidx; i &asymptote;. Logika se uključuje automatski i može "
"se promijeniti u <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Alati</"
"guisubmenu><guilabel>Grado</guilabel></menuchoice> u <guilabel>Generalno</"
"guilabel> tabu u &latex; i &pdflatex; alatima."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2553
#, no-c-format
msgid "MetaPost and &asymptote;"
msgstr "MetaPost i &asymptote;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2555
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to compile your document with <application>MetaPost</"
"application> or <application>&asymptote;</application>, picture drawing "
"programs, you can do it with <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Compile</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Metapost</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, or <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guisubmenu>Compile</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>&asymptote;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite kompajlirati dokument sa <application>MetaPost</application> "
"ili <application>&asymptote;</application>, programima za crtanje slika, "
"možete to uraditi sa <menuchoice><guimenu>Gradi</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Kompajliraj</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Metapost</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, ili <menuchoice><guimenu>Gradi</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Kompajliraj</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>&asymptote;</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2563
#, no-c-format
msgid "&pdflatex;"
msgstr "&pdflatex;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2565
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is also another way to compile your document, if you want a PDF: you "
"can run &pdflatex;, that will compile the source directly into a PDF file, "
"with <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>6</keycap></keycombo>: you can then view the "
"compiled file pressing <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>7</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Postoji i drugi način za kompajliranje dokumenta,, ukoliko želite PDF, "
"možete pokrenuti &pdflatex; koji će kompajlirati izvorni kod direktno u PDF "
"datoteku, sa <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>6</keycap></keycombo>: zatim možete "
"pregledati kompajliranu datoteku pritiskom na <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>7</"
"keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2570
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can convert a PS into a PDF with <keycombo>&Alt;"
"<keycap>8</keycap></keycombo>, or directly a &DVI; into a PDF with "
"<keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>9</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, možete pretvoriti PS u PDF sa <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>8</"
"keycap></keycombo>, ili &DVI; direktno u PDF sa <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>9</"
"keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2574
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using &pdflatex; instead of &latex; may be just a matter of simplicity or "
"habit, but sometimes the behavior of the two program can differ."
msgstr ""
"Korištenje &pdflatex;-a umjesto &latex;-a je pitanje jednostavnosti ili "
"navike,ali ponekad se ponašanje ovih dvaju programa može razlikovati."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2581
#, no-c-format
msgid "&latex; to Web"
msgstr "&latex; na Web"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, you may want to publish your work on the web and not just on paper. "
"You may then use the <application>latex2html</application> program, that can "
"be called from &kile;'s menu <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Convert</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX to Web</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The result will be placed in a subfolder of the "
"work folder, and you will be able to see the result of the conversion "
"choosing the menu item <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guisubmenu>View</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>View &HTML;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, vjerovatno ćete željeti objaviti vaš rad na internet,ne samo na "
"papiru- Onda ćete koristiti <application>latex2html</application> program,"
"koji može biti pozvan iz &kile; menija <menuchoice><guimenu>Izgradi</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Pretvori</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>LaTeX na Web</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>.  Rezultat će biti stavljen u podfasciklu fascikle "
"za rad, i moći ćete vidjeti rezultat pretvaranja biranjem stavke iz menija "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Izgradi</guimenu><guisubmenu>Pregledaj</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Pregledaj &HTML;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2595
#, no-c-format
msgid "Passing Command-Line Parameters"
msgstr "Preskakanje Parametara Komandne Linije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2597
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to pass some specific command-line parameters to the compile, "
"convert or view tools, you can configure their call in "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Tools</guisubmenu><guilabel>Build</guilabel></"
"menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite proslijediti neke specifične parametre komandne linije do "
"kompajliranja,pretvaranja ili alata za pregled, možete konfigurisati njihov "
"poziv u menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Konfiguriši "
"Kile...</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Alati</guisubmenu><guilabel>izgradi</"
"guilabel></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2606
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Quick Preview</title>"
msgstr "<title>Brzi Pregled</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2608
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will always need some time to view the result, when working with "
"&latex;. &latex; has to compile the source and the viewer has to be called. "
"This can be annoying if you only changed some letters in an equation "
"difficult to typeset. &kile; offers a <emphasis>Quick Preview</emphasis> "
"mode, where you can compile only a part of a document and save a lot of "
"time. It supports four different modes, which can be combined with seven "
"configurations."
msgstr ""
"Kada radite sa &latex;-om uvijek ćete trebati neko vrijeme za pregled "
"rezultata. &latex;mora kompajlirati izvor i preglednik mora biti pozvan.Ovo "
"može biti frustrirajuće ukoliko ste promijenili samo nekoliko slova u "
"jednačini koja je kompleksna za typsetovanje. &kile; nudi "
"<emphasis>BrziPregled</emphasis>način rada, gdje možete kompajlirati samo "
"dio dokumenta i uštediti dosta vremena. Podržava četiri različita načina "
"rada, koji mogu biti kombinovani sa sedam konfiguracija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2616
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Quick Preview</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Brzi Pregled</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:2622
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Quick Preview</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Brzi Pregled</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All settings must be done in <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Tools</"
"guimenuitem><guilabel>Preview</guilabel></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Sva podešavanja moraju biti odrađena u <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Alati</"
"guimenuitem><guilabel>Pregled</guilabel></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2632
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Quick Preview Configuration</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Konfiguracija Brzog Pregleda</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:2638
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Quick Preview Configuration</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Konfiguracija Brzog Pregleda</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2645
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selection Mode"
msgstr "Mod za odabir"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2647
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The user has to select a part of the document. Menu entry "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guisubmenu>QuickPreview</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or the keyboard "
"shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>,"
"<keycap>S</keycap> will start the selected programs. &kile; takes the "
"preamble of the original text, so that all packages and user defined "
"commands are included. The user can choose one of eight predefined "
"configurations:"
msgstr ""
"Korisnik mora odabrati dio dokumenta. Unos menija "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>izgradi</guimenu><guisubmenu>BrziPRegled</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Odabir</guimenuitem></menuchoice> kratica sa "
"tastature <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></"
"keycombo>,<keycap>S</keycap> če pokrenuti odabrane programe. &kile; uzima "
"predgovor orginalnog teska,tako dasu uključeni svi paketi i korisnički "
"definisane komande."

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2654
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX+&DVI; (embedded viewer)"
msgstr "LaTeX+&DVI; (ugrađeni preglednik)"

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2655
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX+&DVI; (&okular;)"
msgstr "LaTeX+&DVI; (&okular;)"

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2656
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX+PS (embedded viewer)"
msgstr "LaTeX+PS (ugrađeni preglednik)"

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2657
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX+PS (&okular;)"
msgstr "LaTeX+PS (&okular;)"

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2658
#, no-c-format
msgid "PDFLaTeX+PDF (embedded viewer)"
msgstr "PDFLaTeX+PDF (ugrađeni preglednik)"

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2659
#, no-c-format
msgid "PDFLaTeX+PDF (&okular;)"
msgstr "PDFLaTeX+PDF (&okular;)"

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2660
#, no-c-format
msgid "XeLaTeX+PS (embedded viewer)"
msgstr "XeLaTeX+PS (ugrađeni preglednik)"

#. Tag: application
#: index.docbook:2661
#, no-c-format
msgid "XeLaTeX+PDF (&okular;)"
msgstr "XeLaTeX+PDF (&okular;)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2664
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This should be sufficient for all situations for which a quick preview is "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Ovo bi trebalo biti dovoljno za sve situacije kada je potreban brz pregled."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2670
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environment Mode"
msgstr "Mod Okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2672
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Very often you want to preview the current environment, and especially "
"mathematic environments, which sometimes may be difficult to write. &kile; "
"offers a very fast way to do this. No selection is needed, only choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guisubmenu>QuickPreview</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Environment</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or the "
"keyboard shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></"
"keycombo>,<keycap>E</keycap> and the current environment will be compiled "
"and shown."
msgstr ""
"Često ćete željeti da pregledate trenutno okruženje, naročito matematska "
"okruženja, koje ponekad može biti teško za pisanje. &kile; nudi veoma brz "
"način da se ovo odradi. Nije potreban nikakv odabir, samo "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Izgradi</guimenu><guisubmenu>BrziPregled</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Okruženje</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili kratica sa "
"tastature keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>,"
"<keycap>E</keycap> i trenutno okruženje će biti kompajlirano i prikazano."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2683
#, no-c-format
msgid "Subdocument Mode"
msgstr "Poddokument Mod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2685
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a large project with a lot of documents, compiling the whole "
"project is not a great idea, if you have made changes only in one single "
"document. &kile; is able to compile and show a preview of the current "
"subdocument. It takes the preamble from the master document and only "
"compiles the current part when you choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>QuickPreview</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Subdocument</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or the keyboard shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>,<keycap>D</keycap>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko radite na velikom projektu sa mnogo dokumenata kompajliranje "
"kompletnog projekta nije dobra ideja, ukoliko ste pravili promjene samo u "
"jednom dokumentu. &kile; je sposban da kompajlira i prikaže trenutni "
"poddokument. On uzima uvod iz glavnog dokumenta i kompajlira samo trenutni "
"dio kada izaberete <menuchoice><guimenu>Izgradi</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>BrziPregled</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Poddokument</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili kratica sa tastature<keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>,<keycap>D</keycap>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2696
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mathgroup Mode"
msgstr "Režim matematskih grupa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2698
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mathgroup preview mode allows you to preview the mathgroup you are "
"currently editing. &kile; takes the preamble from the master document and "
"only compiles the mathgroup the cursor is currently in when you choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guisubmenu>QuickPreview</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Mathgroup</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or the keyboard "
"shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>,"
"<keycap>M</keycap>."
msgstr ""
"Način rada za pregled matematske grupe dozvoljava vam da pregledate "
"matematsku grupu koju trenutno mijenjate. &kile; uzima uvod z glavnog "
"dokumenta i kompajlira samo matematsku grupu u kojoj se kursor trenutno "
"nalazi kada izaberete <menuchoice><guimenu>Izgradi</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>BrziPregled</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Matematskagrupa</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili kratica na tastaturi <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>,<keycap>M</keycap>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2707
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quick Preview in Bottom Bar"
msgstr "Brzi Pregled U Bottom Baru"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2709
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instead of showing the preview in a new document &kile; can also be "
"configured to use the bottom bar for preview compilations. You can activate "
"this feature in the quick preview configuration panel."
msgstr ""
"Umjesto prikazivanja pregleda u novom dokumentu, &kile; može biti "
"konfigurisan da koristi botom bar za pregled kompilacija.  Ovo svojstvo "
"možete aktivirati u panelu za konfiguraciju brzog pregleda."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2718
#, no-c-format
msgid "Graphic File Formats"
msgstr "Format Grafičkih Datoteka"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2722
#, no-c-format
msgid "&latex; and &pdflatex;"
msgstr "&latex; i &pdflatex;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2724
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&pdflatex;, when used with <userinput>graphics</userinput> or "
"<userinput>graphicx</userinput> packages, can compile correctly PNG and JPG "
"files into &DVI; or PDF, but is not able to handle EPS files. Conversely, "
"the process of compiling with &latex; to &DVI; and converting to PS and "
"eventually PDF does support EPS, but does not support PNG and JPG."
msgstr ""
"Kada se &pdflatex; koristi sa <userinput>grafika</userinput> ili "
"<userinput>grafikax</userinput>  paktima, može ispravno kompajlirati PSF i "
"JPG datoteke u &DVI; ili PDF, ali ne može raditi sa ESP datotekama. Proces "
"kompajliranja &latex;-a u &DVI; i pretvaranje u PS i naknadno u PDF podržava "
"EPS,ali ne podržava PNG i JPG."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2730
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A lot of users want to create PDF documents, but also want to use of the "
"excellent <application>Pstricks</application> package to create &PostScript; "
"graphics, or they want to use the &PostScript; output of mathematical and "
"scientific software like <application>Mathematica</application>, "
"<application>Maple</application> or <application>MuPAD</application>. These "
"&latex; users have to compile first in &PostScript;, even if they want to "
"create PDF documents, because these programs produce &PostScript; code which "
"cannot be managed by &pdflatex;. However, it is not so hard as it may sound, "
"because &kile; will help."
msgstr ""
"Večina korisnika želi da kreira PDF dokumente,ali također želi da koristi "
"izvrsne <application>Pstricks</application> pakete za kreiranje "
"&PostScript;  grafike, ili žele da koriste &PostScript; izlaz iz matematskih "
"i naučnih softvera kao što su application>Mathematica</application>, "
"<application>Maple</application> ili <application>MuPAD</application>. Ovi "
"&latex; korisnici moraju prvo kompajlirati u &PostScript;-u čak iako žele da "
"kreiraju PDF dokuemnte, jer ovi programi proizvode &PostScript;  kod koji ne "
"može biti upravljan sa &pdflatex;-om. Međutim, to nije tako teško kao što "
"zvuči, jer će &kile; pomoći."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2742
#, no-c-format
msgid "Graphics Conversion"
msgstr "Pretvaranje Grafike"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2744
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To overcome this frustrating loop, in case you want to include both "
"&PostScript; code and PNG or JPG files, you have a number of workarounds:"
msgstr ""
"Da bis se prevazišla ova frustrirajuća petlja, kada želite da uključite "
"i&PostScript; kod i PNG ili JPG datoteku, postoji nekoliko zaobilaznica:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2748
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you need a file in PS format, but have JPG or PNG graphics, you can also "
"simply use &pdflatex; with &DVI; output first, and then run "
"<application>dvips</application> to create the PS file. You see that "
"&pdflatex; is a very good choice, if your source contains no &PostScript; "
"code at all."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko trebate datoteku u PS formatu, ali imate JPG ili PNG grafiku, možete "
"jodnostavno koristiti &pdflatex; sa &DVI; izlazom, a zatim pokrenuti  "
"<application>dvips</application> za kreiranje PS datoteke. Primjetit ćete da "
"je &pdflatex; veoma dobar izbor,ukoliko izvor uopšte ne sadrži  &PostScript; "
"kod."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2753
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can convert EPS files to PNG or other formats with utilities as the "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.gimp.org/\"><application>Gimp</application></ulink> "
"or <ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</ulink> and use "
"&pdflatex;."
msgstr ""
"Možete pretvoriti EPS datoteke u PNG ili druge formate sa pogodnostima kao "
"što su  <ulink url=\"http://www.gimp.org/\"><application>Gimp</application></"
"ulink> ili <ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</ulink> "
"and use &pdflatex;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2758
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A preferred way is to convert EPS graphics to PDF graphics with "
"<command>epstopdf</command>, which comes with every &tex; distribution "
"distribution and then use &pdflatex;. It produces high quality graphics, and "
"you can even control the result with some of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"Poželjan način za pretvaranje EPS grafike u PDF grafiku je sa "
"<command>epstopdf</command>, koje dolazi sa svakom &tex; distribucijom i "
"onda koristiti &pdflatex;. To daje visokokvalitetnu grafiku, i možete čak i "
"kontrolisati rezulat sa nekom od sljedećih opcija:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2764
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"-dAutoFilterColorImages=false\n"
"        -dAutoFilterGrayImages=false\n"
"        -sColorImageFilter=FlateEncode\n"
"        -sGrayImageFilter=FlateEncode\n"
"        -dPDFSETTINGS=/prepress\n"
"        -dUseFlateCompression=true"
msgstr ""
"-dAutoFilterColorImages=false\n"
"                             -dAutoFilterGrayImages=false\n"
"                             -sColorImageFilter=FlateEncode\n"
"                             -sGrayImageFilter=FlateEncode\n"
"                             -dPDFSETTINGS=/prepress\n"
"                             -dUseFlateCompression=true"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2767
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Even better: if your system allows <userinput>shell-escape</userinput>, "
"conversion can be done on the fly. All you have to do is to include the "
"<application>epstopdf</application> package, which is part of all &tex; "
"distributions, with command <userinput>\\usepackage{epstopdf}</userinput>. "
"Assuming that your code is <programlisting>\n"
"        \\includegraphics[width=5cm]{test.eps}\n"
"</programlisting> When you call &pdflatex; with option <option>--shell-"
"escape</option>, graphics <filename>test.eps</filename> is automatically "
"converted into <filename>test.pdf</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Još bolje: ukoliko vam sistem dozvoljava <userinput>shell-escape</"
"userinput>, pretvaranje može biti obavljeno \"u letu\". Sve što treba je da "
"uključite <application>epstopdf</application> paket,koji je dio svih &tex; "
"distribucija, sa komandom <userinput>\\usepackage{epstopdf}</userinput>. "
"Pretpostavljajući da je vaš kod:\n"
"<programlisting>\n"
"               \\includegraphics[width=5cm]{test.eps}\n"
"</programlisting> \n"
"Kada pozovete &pdflatex; sa opcijom <option>--shell-escape</option>, grafika "
"<filename>test.eps</filename> se automatski pretvori u  <filename>test.pdf</"
"filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2777
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This conversion will take place each time you run &pdflatex;. If your "
"graphics command is given implicitly: <programlisting>\n"
"        \\includegraphics[width=5cm]{test}\n"
"</programlisting> <application>epstopdf</application> checks whether "
"<filename>test.pdf</filename> is already available, so that conversion step "
"can be skipped."
msgstr ""
"Ovo pretvaranje će se desiti svaki put kada pokrenete &pdflatex;. Ukoliko su "
"vaše komande grafike zadane implicitno: programlisting>\n"
"        \\includegraphics[width=5cm]{test}\n"
"</programlisting> \n"
"<application>epstopdf</application> provjerava da li je <filename>test.pdf</"
"filename> već dostupno, tako da taj korak pretvaranja može biti preskočen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2785
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can convert the other way around, and use &latex; and PS-PDF conversion. "
"This is not always a good idea, since EPS encapsulation of JPG or PNG can "
"yield larger files, that in turn yield unnecessarily large documents. This "
"is however <emphasis>highly</emphasis> dependent on the graphic utility that "
"you use, since EPS can encapsulate other graphics, but not all applications "
"support this perfectly. Some might actually try to build your JPG image with "
"vectors and various scripting, which will result in gigantic files. "
"Conversion of all graphics formats to EPS can be done by <ulink url=\"http://"
"www.imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</ulink>. Another simple program that "
"does this process correctly is <ulink url=\"http://www.tex.uniyar.ac.ru/"
"win32/tools/jpg2ps/\"><application>jpg2ps</application></ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Možete konvertovati i obrnutim redoslijedom, i koristiti &latex; i PS-PDF "
"pretvaranje. Ovo nije uvijek dobra ideja, s obzirom da  EPS enkapsulacija "
"JPG ili PNG formata  može dati veće datoteke, koje zauzvrat daju nepotrebno "
"velike dokuemnte. Ovo  međutim, <emphasis>izrazito</emphasis> zavisi od "
"grafičkih pogodnosti koje koristitie, s obzirom da EPS može enkapsulirati "
"ostalu grafiku, ali sve apliakcije ne podržavaju ovo savršeno. Neke bi mogle "
"pokzšati da izgrade JPG sliku sa vektorima i različitim skriptingom, koje bi "
"rezultovali ogromnim datotekama. Pretvaranje svih grafičkih formata u EPS "
"može se postići sa <ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</"
"ulink>.  Još jedan jednostavan program koji ovo radi ispravno je<ulink url="
"\"http://www.tex.uniyar.ac.ru/win32/tools/jpg2ps/\"><application>jpg2ps</"
"application></ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2797
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also use an automatic conversion. All graphic files are converted on "
"the fly to EPS, and inserted into the PS document. This is a comfortable "
"way, but you have to set up your system properly. This is discussed in the "
"section <link linkend=\"build_epsgraphics\">EPS Graphics</link>."
msgstr ""
"Također, možete koristiti i automatsko pretvaranje. Sve garfičke datoteke se "
"pretvaraju u EPS, i umeću u PS dokument. Ovo je ugodan način, ali morate "
"postaviti sistem ispravno. Ovo je diskutovano u sekciji <link linkend="
"\"build_epsgraphics\">EPS Graphics</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2808
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the right File for the right Graphic"
msgstr "Korištenje odgovarajuće datoteke za odgovarajuću grafiku"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2811
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"EPS is sort of a graphic vector scripting language, describing all the lines "
"and dots the graph is made of; it looks good even when magnified beyond its "
"default size, and suits best diagrams and vectorial graphic natively "
"produced in EPS, which look very clear and sharp while maintaining a very "
"small byte size."
msgstr ""
"EPS je neka vrsta vektorskog skriptnog jezika, koja opisuje sve linije i "
"tačke od kojih se sastoji grafika; izgleda još bolje kada je uvećana u "
"odnosu na svoju zadat veličinu, i odgovara najboljim dijagramima i "
"vektorskoj grafici koja se prozvodi u EPS-u, koji izgleda veoma jasno i "
"oštro dok održava veličine reda malih bajta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2815
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"PNG (or the deprecated &GIF;) is a <emphasis>non-lossy</emphasis> file "
"format, with good compression and quality. It is very good for diagrams, "
"scans of drawings, or anything whose sharpness you do want to retain. It is "
"sometimes overkill when used for photos."
msgstr ""
"PNG (ili zastarjeli &GIF;) je  format datoteke<emphasis>bez gubitaka</"
"emphasis>, sa dobrom kompresijom i kvalitetom. Veoma je dobar za dijagrame, "
"skeniranje i crtanje ili bilo šta čiju oštrinu želite da sašuvate."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2819
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"JPG is a <emphasis>lossy</emphasis> format, that compresses files better "
"than PNG at the price of some loss in the picture detail. This is usually "
"irrelevant for photos, but may cause bad quality for diagrams, drawings, and "
"may make some thin lines disappear outright; in those cases use EPS or PNG."
msgstr ""
"JPG je format <emphasis>sa gubicima</emphasis>, koji kompresuje datoteke "
"bolje od PNG-a sa mogućnošću gubitaka u nekim dijelovima solike. Ovo je "
"uglavnom irelevantno  za fotografije, ali može izazvati loš kvalitet za "
"dijagrame, crteže i može proizvesti nestajanje nekih tankih linija; u tom "
"slučaju koristitie EPS ili PNG."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2825
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"But always remember: garbage in, garbage out! No conversion will make a bad "
"picture good."
msgstr ""
"Ali zapamtite: smeće vani,smeće unutra! Nijedna konverzija neće napraviti "
"lošu sliku dobrom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2833
#, no-c-format
msgid "EPS Graphics"
msgstr "EPS Grafila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2835
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"EPS graphics files are the traditional way to insert graphics files into "
"&latex; documents. As mailing lists are full with questions concerning EPS "
"graphics, we will discuss some important aspects and demonstrate how &kile; "
"supports them."
msgstr ""
"EPS grafičke datoteke su tradicionalni način umetanja grafičkig datoteka u "
"&latex; dokuemente. Kako su mailing liste uvijek pune pitanja koja se tiču "
"EPS grafike, prodiskutovat ćemo neke bitne aspkete i pokazati kako ih &kile; "
"podržava."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2842
#, no-c-format
msgid "&latex; and EPS Graphics"
msgstr "&latex; i EPS Grafika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2844
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you decided to use the traditional &latex; to produce PS or PDF output, "
"you will probably run into some problems with graphics. You have to use EPS "
"graphics (Encapsulated &PostScript;), no JPEG or PNG files. This should be "
"no problem, as there are a lot of <link linkend=\"build_graphics_conversion"
"\">converters</link> like <command>convert</command> from the excellent "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</ulink> package. "
"But, it needs some time of course."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste se odlučili za tradicionalni &latex; za proizvodnju PS ili PDF "
"izlaza,vjerovatno ćete naići na neke probleme sa grafikom. Morate koristiti "
"EPS grafiku  (Encapsulated &PostScript;); bez JPEG i PNG datoteka. ovo ne bi "
"trebao biti problem s obzirom da postoju mnogo <link linkend="
"\"build_graphics_conversion\">converters</link> kao <command>convert</"
"command> iz nevjerovatnog<ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/"
"\">&imagemagick;</ulink>  paketa. Ali, ovo zahtijeva određeno vrijeme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2853
#, no-c-format
msgid "The EPS files are used by both &latex; and the &DVI;-PS converter:"
msgstr "EPS datoteke su korištene i od &latex;-a i od &DVI;-PS pretvarača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2856
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&latex; scans the EPS file for the bounding box line, which tells &latex; "
"how much space to reserve for the graphics."
msgstr ""
"&latex; skenira EPS datoteke za ograničavajuću liniju, koja govori &latex;-u "
"koliko mjesta da rezerviše za grafiku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2860
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &DVI;-PS converter then reads the EPS file and inserts the graphics in "
"the PS file."
msgstr ""
"&DVI;-PS pretvarač onda čita EPS datoteke i umeće grafiku u PS datoteku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2864
#, no-c-format
msgid "This has some implications:"
msgstr "Ovo ima neke implikacije:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2867
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&latex; never reads the EPS file if the bounding-box parameters are "
"specified in the graphics-insertion command."
msgstr ""
"&latex; nikad ne čita EPS datoteku ukoliko su parametri ograničavajuće "
"linije specificirani u komandi grafičkog umetanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2870
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since &latex; cannot read non-ASCII files, it cannot read the bounding-box "
"information from compressed or non-EPS graphics files."
msgstr ""
"Pošto &latex; ne može čitati datoteke koje nisu u ASCII kodu, ne može čitati "
"ni informacije izkompresovanih ili grafičkih datoteka koje nisu EPS formata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2874
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The EPS graphics are not included in the &DVI; file. Since the EPS files "
"must be present when the &DVI; file is converted to PS, the EPS files must "
"accompany &DVI; files whenever they are moved."
msgstr ""
"EPS grafika nije uključena u &DVI; datoteke. Pošto EPS datoteke moraju biti "
"prisutne kada je &DVI; datoteka pretvara u PS, EPS datoteke moraju pratiti "
"&DVI; datoteke kad god ih premještamo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2880
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you can call &latex;, and a &DVI;-PS converter like <application>dvips</"
"application> to create your &PostScript; document. If your goal is a PDF "
"document, you should run <command>dvips</command> with option <option>-Ppdf</"
"option> and then call <command>ps2pdf</command>. You will find a lot of "
"documents describing this solution."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete pozvati &latex; i &DVI;-PS pretvrač kao <application>dvips</"
"application> da biste kreirali vaš &PostScript;  dokument. Ukoliko je vaš "
"cilj PDF dokument, trebate pokrenuti <command>dvips</command> sa opcijom "
"<option>-Ppdf</option> a zatim pozvati <command>ps2pdf</command>.  pronaći "
"čete veliki broj dokumenata koji opisuju ovo rješenje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2889
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &PostScript; Way of &kile;"
msgstr "&PostScript; Način &kile; -a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2891
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; helps you to get the bounding-box information. If you have installed "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</ulink> package, "
"&kile; will extract this information from the EPS file and insert it as an "
"option. This is done automatically when you select the graphics file. There "
"are two advantages to proceed like this:"
msgstr ""
"&kile; vam pomaže da dobijete bounding-box informacije. Ukoliko ste "
"instalirali <ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">&imagemagick;</"
"ulink>  &kile; će izvući ove informacije sa ESP datoteke i ubaciti ih kao "
"opciju. Ovo se obavlja automatski kada označite grafičku datototeku. Postoje "
"dvije prednosti ovakvog postupka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2898
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The information is already scanned in the dialog, and need not to be done by "
"&latex; later on."
msgstr ""
"Informacije su već skenirane u prozoru i nema potrebe da &latex; kasnije "
"radi na njima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2900
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Even more important is that the width and height of the picture can be "
"calculated, when the its resolution is known. This information will be shown "
"near the top of the dialog, and may serve as a clue when you want to scale "
"the graphics."
msgstr ""
"Još bitnije je da širina i visina slike može biti izračunata, kada je "
"poznata rezolucija. Ova informacija će btii prikazana blizu vrha prozora, i "
"može poslužiti kao indicija kada ćelite da skalirate grafiku,."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2904
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; can also support zipped or gzipped EPS files, which are much smaller "
"than uncompressed EPS files. But, this feature can only be used with a "
"special system setup and a change of your local graphics configuration, like "
"it is described in the <link linkend=\"build_graphics_bitmap\">Bitmap "
"Graphics</link> section."
msgstr ""
"&kile; također podržava zipovane i grafički zipovane EPS datoteke,koje su "
"mnogo manje od nekompresovanih EPS datoteka. Ali,ovo svojstvo se koristiti "
"samo sa s pecijalnim postavkama sistemai promjenom vaše lokalne "
"konfirguracije grafike, kao što je opsiano u <link linkend="
"\"build_graphics_bitmap\">Bitmap Graphics</link> sekciji."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2919
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &PostScript; Way and Bitmap Graphics"
msgstr "The &PostScript; Način i  Bitmap Grafika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2921
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your system allows <userinput>shell-escape</userinput>, &kile; also "
"supports an easy way to include bitmap graphics, if you set up your &tex; "
"system properly. There is no need to convert JPEG or PNG graphics, this can "
"be done automatically when the &DVI; file is converted to PS."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko vam sistem dozvoljava <userinput>shell-escape</userinput>, &kile; će "
"također podržati lakši način uključivanja bitmap grafike, ukoliko postavite "
"vaš &tex; sistem ispravno. nema potrebe za pretvaranjem JPEG ili PNG "
"grafike, ovo može biti urađeno automatski kada se &DVI; datoteka pretvara u "
"PS."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2926
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&latex; needs some information about the file suffixes. The package "
"<userinput>graphicx</userinput> looks for a file <filename>graphics.cfg</"
"filename>, which must be somewhere in your search path for &latex; "
"documents. Search for entries like:"
msgstr ""
"&latex; treba neke informacije o sufiksima datoteka. Paket "
"<userinput>graphicx</userinput> zahtijeva datoteku <filename>graphics.cfg</"
"filename>, koja mora biti negdje u vašoj pretragi za 6latex; dolumente. "
"Pretraga za unose kao što su:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2931
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\DeclareGraphicsRule{.pz}{eps}{.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.Z}{eps}{.eps.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.Z}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.gz}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.gz}{eps}{.eps.bb}{}%"
msgstr ""
"\\DeclareGraphicsRule{.pz}{eps}{.bb}{}%\n"
"      \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.Z}{eps}{.eps.bb}{}%\n"
"      \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.Z}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"      \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.gz}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"      \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.gz}{eps}{.eps.bb}{}%"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2933
#, no-c-format
msgid "and replace these lines with:"
msgstr "i zamijeni ove linije sa:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2935
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\DeclareGraphicsRule{.pz}{eps}{.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.Z}{eps}{.eps.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.Z}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.gz}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"   % changed or new graphic rules\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.zip}{eps}{.eps.bb}{`unzip -p #1}%   zipped "
"EPS \n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.gz}{eps}{.eps.bb}{`gunzip -c #1}%   gzipped "
"EPS\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.jpg}{eps}{}{`convert #1 eps:-}%         JPEG\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.gif}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      GIF\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.png}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      PNG\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.tif}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      TIFF\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.pdf}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      PDF-"
"graphics"
msgstr ""
"\\DeclareGraphicsRule{.pz}{eps}{.bb}{}%\n"
"    \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.Z}{eps}{.eps.bb}{}%\n"
"    \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.Z}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.ps.gz}{eps}{.ps.bb}{}%\n"
"   % changed or new graphic rules\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.zip}{eps}{.eps.bb}{`unzip -p #1}%   zipped "
"EPS\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.eps.gz}{eps}{.eps.bb}{`gunzip -c #1}%   gzipped "
"EPS\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.jpg}{eps}{}{`convert #1 eps:-}%         JPEG\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.gif}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      GIF\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.png}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      PNG\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.tif}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      TIFF\n"
"   \\DeclareGraphicsRule{.pdf}{eps}{.bb}{`convert #1 eps:-}%      PDF-"
"graphics"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2937
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will find this file, for example in Debian, at <filename>/etc/texmf/"
"latex/graphics.cfg</filename>. The best way to proceed is to copy this file "
"to your local texpath and then change this file. See the yours &tex; "
"distribution manual to learn how to get a list of your &tex; folders."
msgstr ""
"Ovu datoteku ćete naprimjer naći u Debian-u, u <filename>/etc/texmf/latex/"
"graphics.cfg</filename>.  NAjbolji način za procesiranje je kopiranje ove "
"datoteke u vašu lolaklnu tekstualnu putanjz i onda mijenjanje te kopije. "
"Pogledate vaš &tex; priručnik za distribuciju da naučite kako  ćete "
"izlistati &tex; foldere."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2942
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this configuration file you are able to insert bitmap graphics and "
"zipped or gzipped EPS files in &latex;. The command for conversion is given "
"by <command>dvips</command>. When you look at the conversion command you "
"will see that no extra file is created. The result of the conversion process "
"is directly piped into the PS file. The only thing &latex; must know is the "
"size of the graphics, and therefore we need the bounding box, which is "
"provided by &kile;."
msgstr ""
"S ovakvom kofniguracijskom datotekom možete umetnuti bitmap grafiku  i "
"zipovane i grafički zipovane EPS datoteke u &latex;. Komanda za "
"pretvaranjeje data <command>dvips</command>.Kada pogledate komandu za "
"pretvaranje vidjet ćete da nije kreirana dodatna datoteka. Rezultat "
"pretvaranje je direktno prodlijeđen u PS datotelu. Jedina stvar kojku "
"&latex; mora znati je veličina grafike, i zbog toga nam treba bounding box, "
"koji je obezbjeđe od &kile;-a."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2950
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some say that this way is insecure; you have to decide on how to work. In "
"any case, you need no bounding box, as &kile; will extract this information "
"from all types of graphics."
msgstr ""
"Neki kažu da je ovaj način nesiguran; morate odlučiti kao ćete raditi. U "
"svakom slučaju ne treba vam bounding box, jer &kile; će izvući ove "
"informacije iz svih tipova grafike."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2958
#, no-c-format
msgid "&pdflatex; and EPS Graphics"
msgstr "&pdflatex; i EPS Grafika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2960
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As already stated, &pdflatex; is not able to handle EPS graphic files, but "
"converters like <link linkend=\"build_graphics_epstopdf\">epstopdf</link> "
"will help. The best way is to include package <filename>epstopdf</filename>, "
"which must follow the <userinput>graphicx</userinput> package."
msgstr ""
"Kao što je već započeto, &pdflatex; nije u stanju da se nosi sa EPS "
"grafičkim datotekama,ali pretvarači kao što je <link linkend="
"\"build_graphics_epstopdf\">epstopdf</link>  će pomoći. Najbolji način je da "
"uključite paket <filename>epstopdf</filename>,  koji mora pratiti "
"<userinput>graphicx</userinput>  paket."

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2965
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\usepackage[pdftex]{graphicx}\n"
"   \\usepackage{epstopdf}"
msgstr ""
"\\usepackage[pdftex]{graphicx}\n"
"      \\usepackage{epstopdf}"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2967
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you can already include EPS graphics, if you run <command>pdflatex</"
"command> with option <option>--shell-escape</option>, but we can make it "
"even better and also handle zipped or gzipped EPS files. Again we have to "
"change the graphics configuration file <filename>graphics.cfg</filename> "
"like above. This time we search for:"
msgstr ""
"Sada već mpžete uključiti EPS grafiku,ukoliko porkenete <command>pdflatex</"
"command> sa opcijom <option>--shell-escape</option>, ,ali možemo to čak  i "
"poboljšati i također koristiti se zipovanim i grafički zipovanim EPS "
"datotekama. Ponovo moramo promijeniti grafičku konfiguraciju datoteke "
"<filename>graphics.cfg</filename> kao iznad. Ovaj put tražimo:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2973
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"% pdfTeX is running in pdf mode\n"
"   \\ExecuteOptions{pdftex}%"
msgstr ""
"% pdfTeX is running in pdf mode\n"
"       \\ExecuteOptions{pdftex}%"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2975
#, no-c-format
msgid "and simply add some lines."
msgstr "i jednostavno dodamo neke linije:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:2977
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"% pdfTeX is running in pdf mode\n"
"   \\ExecuteOptions{pdftex}%\n"
"   \\AtEndOfPackage{%\n"
"      \\g@addto@macro\\Gin@extensions{.eps.gz,.eps.zip}%\n"
"      \\@namedef{Gin@rule@.eps.gz}#1{{pdf}{.pdf}{`gunzip -c #1 | epstopdf -f "
">\\Gin@base.pdf}}%\n"
"      \\@namedef{Gin@rule@.eps.zip}#1{{pdf}{.pdf}{`unzip -p #1 | epstopdf -f "
">\\Gin@base.pdf}}%\n"
"   }%"
msgstr ""
"% pdfTeX radi u  pdf modu\n"
"   \\ExecuteOptions{pdftex}%\n"
"   \\AtEndOfPackage{%\n"
"      \\g@addto@macro\\Gin@extensions{.eps.gz,.eps.zip}%\n"
"      \\@namedef{Gin@rule@.eps.gz}#1{{pdf}{.pdf}{`gunzip -c #1 | epstopdf -f "
">\\Gin@base.pdf}}%\n"
"      \\@namedef{Gin@rule@.eps.zip}#1{{pdf}{.pdf}{`unzip -p #1 | epstopdf -f "
">\\Gin@base.pdf}}%\n"
"   }%"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2979
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With these lines, &pdflatex; is able to handle EPS files, and hopefully "
"there should be no more issues concerning graphics."
msgstr ""
"S ovim linijama &pdflatex; može baratati sa EPS datotekama, i nadajmo se da "
"ne bi trebalo biti više problema vezanih za grafiku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2988
#, no-c-format
msgid "Master Document"
msgstr "Glavni dokument"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2990
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Defining your document as a master allows you to work with separated files, "
"which gives you a parent document (or Master document), and child documents "
"that make up a complete work. After having defined your Master document, "
"with the corresponding command in the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu, all "
"the commands of the <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu will apply only to this "
"document, even when you are working on the child documents. You can even "
"close the Master document."
msgstr ""
"Definisanje vašeg dokumenta kao glavnog dozvoljava vam da radite sa "
"odvojenim datotekama,koji vam daju \"roditelj\" dokument (ili glavni "
"dokument) i \"dijete\" dokument koji nadoknađuje kompletan rad. Nakon što "
"ste definisali glavni dokument, sa odgovarajućim komandama u "
"<guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu> meniju, sve komande <guimenu>Alati</guimenu> "
"menija će se primjeniti na taj dokuemnt,čak iako radite na \"dijete\" "
"dokuementima. Možete čak i zatvoriti glavni dokument."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3001
#, no-c-format
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr "Rukovanje greškama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3003
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you have compiled something, &kile; takes a look at the error messages "
"that were generated. If there are any errors or warnings, they will be "
"briefly reported in the <guilabel>Log and Messages</guilabel> window. One "
"can take a closer look at the messages by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guimenuitem>View Log File</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or by using the keyboard shortcut <keycombo>&Alt;"
"<keycap>0</keycap></keycombo>. The generated log is then displayed in the "
"<guilabel>Log and Messages</guilabel> view; errors and warnings are "
"highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste kompajlirali nešto, &kile; pregleda greške koje su generisane. "
"Ukoliko postoji greška ili upozorenje, bit će odmah prijavljeno u "
"<guilabel>Log and Messages</guilabel> pozoru. Poruke se mogu detaljnije "
"iščitati odabirom <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guimenuitem>View Log "
"File</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, ili korištenjem kratice sa tastature "
"<keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>0</keycap></keycombo>.  generisani log se onda "
"prikazuje u  <guilabel>Log and Messages</guilabel> pregledniku; greške i "
"upozornenja su istaknuta."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3011
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Viewing the log</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pregled loga</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3017
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Viewing the log</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pregled loga</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3019
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Viewing the log</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pregled loga</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3023
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can easily jump from one message in the log file to another by using the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guimenuitem>Next / Previous LaTeX "
"Error / Warning</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu items, or by using the "
"corresponding toolbar buttons."
msgstr ""
"Možete vrlo jednostavno preskakati sa jedne poruke u log datoteci na drugu "
"koristeći <menuchoice><guimenu>Build</guimenu><guimenuitem>Next / Previous "
"LaTeX Error / Warning</guimenuitem></menuchoice> stavke menija ili "
"korištenjem odgovarajućih dugmadi alatne trake."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3028
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To jump to the line in the &latex; source where the error or warning "
"occurred, click on the error or warning in the <guilabel>Log and Messages</"
"guilabel> view. &kile; will take you automatically to the offending line."
msgstr ""
"Da biste skočili na liniju u 6latex; kodu gdje se pojavila greška ili "
"upozorenje, kliknite na grešku ili upozorenje u <guilabel>Log and Messages</"
"guilabel> pregledniku. &kile; će vas automatski odvesti na traženu liniju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3036
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Watch File Mode"
msgstr "Mod za Pregled Datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3038
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you launch the <guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton> command, a viewer of "
"some sort will normally be called after the compilation. If you are not "
"using an embedded viewer, a new window will be opened every time."
msgstr ""
"Kada pokrenete <guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton> komandu, preglednik neke "
"vrste će uobičajeno btii pozvan nakon kompilacije. ukoliko ne krosititie "
"ugrađeni preglednik, novi prozor će se otvoriti svaki put."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3042
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are adjusting the look of your document, you might launch "
"<guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton> very often, and have many viewer windows "
"open on your desktop; to avoid this confusion, you can activate the "
"<guibutton>Watch file</guibutton> mode, that will prevent "
"<guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton> from launching a viewer."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko podešavate izgled vašeg dokuemnta, možda ćete pokretatii "
"<guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton>veoma često, i iamti mnogo preglednika "
"tovorenih na desktopu;da izbjegnemo konfuziju, možete aktivirati "
"<guibutton>Watch file</guibutton> način rada, koji će spriječiti "
"<guibutton>Quickbuild</guibutton> pokretanje preglednika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3047
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This mode is of course useless with the embedded viewers, as you have to "
"close them anyway to get back to editing the document and recompiling."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj način rada je beskoristan sa ugrađenim preglednicima,jer ih u svakom "
"slučaju morate zatvoriti da biste se vratili ediotvanju i ponovnom "
"kompajliranju dokumenta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3056
#, no-c-format
msgid "Navigating the &latex; Source"
msgstr "Upravljanje  &latex; Izvorom"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3060
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Using the Structure View</title>"
msgstr "<title>Korištenje Struktuiranog Preglednika</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3062
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Structure</guilabel> view shows the hierarchy of the document "
"being created in &kile;, and allows you to quickly navigate it, showing its "
"segmentation. To navigate around your document, all you need to do is to "
"left click on any label, chapter, section, subsection, etc., and you will be "
"taken to the beginning of the corresponding area."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Structure</guilabel> pregled prikazuje hiejrarhiju dokuemnta "
"kreiranog u &kile;-u i dozvoljava vam brzo upravljanje njime, prikazujući "
"pri tome segmentacije. Da biste upravljali dokumentom,sve što treba da "
"uradite je da kliknete lijevim klikom na bilo koju oznaku, poglavlje, "
"sekcijju,podsekciju, itd., i bit ćete na početku odgovarajućeg područja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3068
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you included a separate &latex; file in your source using the <userinput>"
"\\input</userinput> or <userinput>\\include</userinput> tags, these files "
"will be referred to in the <guilabel>Structure</guilabel> view; double-"
"clicking on their names in it will make &kile; bring up the included file in "
"the editor window."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste uključili odvojene &latex; datoteke u vaš izvor, koristeći  "
"<userinput>\\input</userinput> ili<userinput>\\include</userinput> tagove, "
"ovie datoteke će biti vezane za <guilabel>Structure</guilabel> pregled: "
"dupli klik na njihovo ime će rezltovati pojavljivanjem uključene datoteke u "
"prozor editora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3073
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hierarchy tree has also a separate branch for labels used in the text."
msgstr ""
"Hijerarhijsko stablo također ima odvojene grane za oznake korištene u tekstu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3090
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Context Menu"
msgstr "Korištenje Kontekstnog Menija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3092
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most of the entries in the structure view have a lot of entries in the "
"context menu, which you can open with a right mouse click. So look at the "
"structure view in the following picture."
msgstr ""
"Većina unosa u strukturnom pregledniku ima mnogo unosa u kontekstni meni, "
"koji možete otvoriti desnim klikom miša. Pogledajte strukturni preglednik na "
"slijdećoj slici."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3097
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Using the Structure View</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Korištenje Strukturnog Preglednika</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3103
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Using the Structure View</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Korištenje Strukturnog Preglednika</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will find some labels, some sectioning entries, two figure environments "
"and three pictures. If you right click on one of the sectioning entries, a "
"menu with some useful commands will popup. All commands like "
"<guibutton>Select</guibutton>, <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>Comment</guibutton> will work with all lines, which belong to "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"Pronaći ćete neke oznake, neke unose sekcija, dva oblika okruženja i tri "
"slike. Ukoliko pritisnete desni klik na neki od unosa sekcija, meni sa veoma "
"kroisnim komandama će se pojaviti. Sve komande kao što su "
"<guibutton>Selektuj</guibutton>, <guibutton>Obriši</guibutton> ili "
"<guibutton>Komentariši</guibutton> će raditi sa svim linijama, koje "
"pripadaju ovoj sekciji."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3114
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Context menu for sectioning entries</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kontekstni meni za odvajanje unosa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3120
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Context menu for sectioning entries</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kontekstni meni za odvajanje unosa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on a figure or table entry will offer some actions with respect to "
"references and a right click on a graphics entry will offer some programs to "
"open the graphics."
msgstr ""
"Klik na oblik ili tabelarni unos će ponuditi neke radnje s naglaskom na "
"reference, a desni klik na grafički unos će ponuditi neke programe za "
"pokretanje grafike."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Context menu for figure/tables and graphics entries</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>Kontekstni meni za oblike/tabele i grafičke unose </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3135
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Context menu for figure/tables and graphics entries</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kontekstni meni za oblike/tabele i grafičke unose </phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3144
#, no-c-format
msgid "Updating the Structure View"
msgstr "Ažuriranje Strukturnog Preglednika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To update your structure view you can either go to "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Refresh Structure</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, hit <keycombo><keycap>F12</keycap></keycombo>, or "
"you can save your document, which will make &kile; update its "
"<guilabel>Structure</guilabel> view."
msgstr ""
"Da biste ažurirali strukturni preglednik možete ići na "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjenu</guimenu><guimenuitem>Osvježi strukturu</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, pritisnuti <keycombo><keycap>F12</keycap></"
"keycombo> ili možete spasiti dokument, što će navesti &kile; da ga ažurira "
"sa svojim <guilabel>Strukturnim</guilabel> preglednikom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Oznake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bookmarks are your reference to a segment of text or a line inside the "
"&kile; environment. To use a bookmark, select a specific line of your "
"document you would like to return to, then press <keycombo>&Ctrl; <keycap>B</"
"keycap></keycombo>, and &kile; will add a bookmark to this line. "
"Alternatively, you can also set a bookmark by highlighting a line and "
"choosing the menu labeled <menuchoice><guimenu>Bookmarks</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Set Bookmark</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Oznake su vaša referenca na segment teksta ili liniju unutar &kile; "
"okruženja. Za korištenje oznaka, odaberite specifičnu liniju u vašem "
"dokuemntu na koju želite da se vratite a zatim pritisnite <keycombo>&Ctrl; "
"<keycap>B</keycap></keycombo>,  i &kile; će dodati oznaku na liniju, "
"Alternatinvno, možete podesiti oznaku obilježavanjem linije i biranjem "
"označenog <menuchoice><guimenu>oznake</guimenu><guimenuitem>postavi oznaku</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove all your bookmarks, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Bookmarks</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Clear All Bookmarks</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uklonili oznake, oaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>oznake</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ukloni sve oznake</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Projects"
msgstr "Projekti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3180
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with Projects"
msgstr "Rad s Projektima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kile; you can create and work with <emphasis>projects</emphasis>. A "
"project is a group of &latex;, graphic, &bibtex;, or other files that "
"contain all the information that is used to build your complete document. A "
"typical project would be a document consisting of several chapters, written "
"in different <literal role=\"extension\">.tex</literal> files; all of them "
"could be included in a project, to make the whole document easier to manage. "
"The specifications of the project are stored in a special file, with "
"extension <literal role=\"extension\">.kilepr</literal>."
msgstr ""
"U &kile;-u možete kreirati i raditi sa <emphasis>projektima</emphasis>. "
"Projekt je grupa &latex; grafike, &bibtex; i drugih datoteka koje sadrže sve "
"informacije koje su korištene u izgradnji vašeg dokumenta. Tipičan prijekt "
"je dokuemnt sastavljen od nekoliko poglavlja,napisanih u različitim <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.tex</literal> datotekama, one sve mogu biti uključene u "
"prejekat, da bi kompletan dokument bio lakši za korištenje. Specifikacije "
"prjekta se čuvaju us pecijalnoj datoteci, sa ekstenzijom<literal role="
"\"extension\">.kilepr</literal>. Tag: para."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3189
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Project adds the following functionalities:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3192
#, no-c-format
msgid "You need not set a master document, &kile; does this automatically."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Project files can easily be archived together by going to "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Project</guimenu><guimenuitem>Archive</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Files and Projects</guilabel> view shows which files are "
"included in the project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After opening a project, any file that was previously opened will be "
"restored with the original encoding and highlightning."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3198
#, no-c-format
msgid "Code completion works across all project files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3199
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reference completion works across all project files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Citation completion works across all project files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Search in all project files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify custom quickbuild and &makeidx; command."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can find all project related commands in the <guilabel>Project</"
"guilabel>-menu. From there you can open, close and manage your projects."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3211
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a Project"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a project, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Project</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>New Project...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You will be asked to "
"give the following information to create your project:"
msgstr ""
"Označite <menuchoice><guimenu>Wizard</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quick Start</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, zatim odaberite format i postavite preferencije u "
"wizardu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3217
#, no-c-format
msgid "Title of your project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Name of the project file with <literal role=\"extension\">.kilepr</literal> "
"extension."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filename."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type of file creating: Empty Document, Article, Book, Letter, Report, ...."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you fill out the <guilabel>filename</guilabel> box, you have to include "
"a relative path from where the <literal role=\"extension\">.kilepr</literal> "
"project file is stored to the file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3230
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The Files and Projects View</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Files and Projects</guilabel> view is a button of the sidebar "
"menu. From this view, you can see the structure of your project, its files, "
"and the name of the <literal role=\"extension\">.kilepr</literal> file that "
"stores the project information. Adding, removing, or changing options in "
"your project is done via the <guilabel>Files and Projects</guilabel> view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3239
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Files and Projects View</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3245
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Files and Projects View</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3247
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Files and Projects View</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3255
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding and Removing Files"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a file to your project, open any &tex; file, right click on its name "
"in the <guilabel>Files and Projects</guilabel> view, and select "
"<guilabel>Add to Project</guilabel>. If you have opened multiple projects, a "
"dialog box will pop up in which you can specify to which project the file "
"should be added."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also right-click on the project's name in the <guilabel>Files and "
"Projects</guilabel> view, and select <guilabel>Add Files...</guilabel> to "
"bring up a file selection dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3271
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Adding a file to a project</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3277
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Adding a file to a project</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3279
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Adding a file to a project</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a file from a project, right-click on it and select "
"<guilabel>Remove File</guilabel>. This does <emphasis>not</emphasis> delete "
"your file (and also does not close it), but only removes it from the list of "
"files contained in the <literal role=\"extension\">.kilepr</literal> "
"extension."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Archiving your Project"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3291
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; allows you to easily backup your project by storing all its files "
"into a single archive (often known as <emphasis>tarball</emphasis>). To "
"archive your project, right-click on its name in the <guilabel>Files and "
"Projects</guilabel> view, or select <menuchoice><guimenu>Project</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Archive</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, all files in a project are added to the archive. If you do not "
"want to include a certain file in the archive, right-click on it in the "
"<guilabel>Files and Projects</guilabel> view, and uncheck the "
"<guilabel>Include in Archive</guilabel> option."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The archive operation is currently realized by executing the <command>tar</"
"command> from the project folder (where the <literal role=\"extension\">."
"kilepr</literal> file is located)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3309
#, no-c-format
msgid "Project Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; has a few options related to your project that can be set. To change "
"them, right-click on the title of your project and select <guilabel>Project "
"Options</guilabel>, and you will have the option of changing:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3316
#, no-c-format
msgid "The title of your project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3317
#, no-c-format
msgid "Default file extensions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3318
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Master document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3319
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Quickbuild command."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3320
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &makeidx; options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3339
#, no-c-format
msgid "Closing a Project"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To close a project, select the <guilabel>Files and Projects</guilabel> view "
"from the vertical toolbar, right click on your project title, and then "
"select <guimenuitem> Close</guimenuitem>. This will close your project, all "
"the files associated with your project, and will also add the name of the "
"project you just closed to <guisubmenu>Open Recent Project...</guisubmenu> "
"in the <guimenu>Project</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3353
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document Encoding"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kile; editor allows you to read, convert and save text in the character "
"encoding your document needs. With this it is possible, for example, to use "
"accented characters such as they are commonly used in Italian or French "
"directly in &latex; documents. Selecting the encoding for your document can "
"be done in two ways:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One way to set the document encoding is by using the submenu "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Editor</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, where you can set "
"the default character encoding for all files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3366
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Set the default character encoding</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3372
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Set the default character encoding</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A second way to set the encoding for a document is to choose the desired "
"encoding within the wizard to create a new document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&latex; itself only understands ASCII, which represents a very limited set "
"of characters. Hence, it is not possible to use accented characters "
"directly. To use them nevertheless, a special syntax was invented: such as "
"for example <userinput>\\\"e</userinput> for <computeroutput>ë</"
"computeroutput>. The <application>inputenc</application> package is "
"available to help you with this. It is included in the preamble using "
"<userinput>\\usepackage[latin1]{inputenc}</userinput>, where the optional "
"argument specifies the encoding you would like to use (nowadays in most "
"cases <userinput>utf8</userinput>). This tells &latex; to translate all of "
"the <userinput>ë</userinput>'s you wrote to <userinput>\\\"e</userinput>'s "
"before compiling. Please refer to the <application>inputenc</application> "
"documentation directly for more information. Last but not least: remember to "
"make sure that your file is <emphasis>actually</emphasis> saved in the same "
"encoding you specified for the <application>inputenc</application> package!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3392
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This multitude of different character coding tables has created numerous "
"problems: for example, you cannot write a course of Turkish in French "
"without losing one language's special characters. There is general agreement "
"that, sooner or later, everybody will switch to <ulink url=\"http://www."
"unicode.org\">Unicode</ulink>. There are many implementations of Unicode, "
"and <abbrev>UTF-8</abbrev> is the most successful in &Linux;; &Windows;&reg; "
"relies instead on the more cumbersome and less flexible <abbrev>UCS-2</"
"abbrev>. Most distributions have already begun setting their default "
"encoding to <abbrev>UTF-8</abbrev>, and therefore you may be very interested "
"in using of the <userinput>utf8</userinput> argument to the "
"<userinput>inputenc</userinput> package."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3405
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &ucs; Package"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you don't have the &ucs; package installed, you can proceed as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Get the &ucs; package from <ulink url=\"http://www.ctan.org/tex-archive/"
"macros/latex/contrib/unicode/\">CTAN</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To install it, unpack the downloaded file and place it in a folder listed in "
"your $<envar>TEXINPUTS</envar> environment variable. This can also be set "
"inside kile."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:3417
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\\usepackage{ucs}\n"
"\\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3423
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>XeLaTeX</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3425
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are using <userinput>XeLaTeX</userinput>, you can simply load the "
"<userinput>xltxtra</userinput> package. It will additionally load all the "
"required packages."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:3427
#, no-c-format
msgid "\\usepackage{xltxtra}"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3433
#, no-c-format
msgid "&cjk; Support"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adding support for ideographic languages is quite tricky. However, once you "
"are done with it, it will work quite well. Other than installing packages, "
"there is some extra configuration work to do."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3439
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your &Linux; distribution might already have a &cjk; (Chinese, Japanese, "
"Korean) package ready for you, so you might be saved the hassle of manually "
"installing everything. Do check before going forward!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3443
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is the possibility of using the &ucs; package in order to write short "
"snippets of &cjk; text, but that option is seriously limited as it does not "
"handle, among other things, newlines. Instead, we will install the complete "
"&cjk;-&latex; package and make it work for both &latex; and &pdflatex;. A "
"lot of this material has been inspired by <ulink url=\"http://www.ece.uci."
"edu/~chou/\">Pai H. Chou</ulink>'s <ulink url=\"http://www.ece.uci.edu/~chou/"
"unicode-tex.html\">page about how to setup &pdflatex;</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Download the <ulink url=\"http://www.ctan.org/tex-archive/help/Catalogue/"
"entries/cjk.html\">&cjk;</ulink> package. Copy its unpacked files to an "
"appropriate subfolder of $<envar>TEXMF</envar>, just like you did with the "
"&ucs; package before (see <xref linkend=\"ucs\" role=\"select: title "
"pageabbrv\"/>). The files will be unpacked in a <filename>CJK/X_Y.Z</"
"filename> folder; it is not important that you take them out, though it will "
"probably be tidier and easier for you to maintain."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you have to download a font that supports all the &cjk; characters you "
"need. You can choose any <literal role=\"extension\">*.ttf</literal> file "
"that covers them, but in this walkthrough we will use <ulink url=\"ftp://ftp."
"wu-wien.ac.at/pub/www/Netscape/communicator/extras/fonts/windows/Cyberbit.ZIP"
"\">Cyberbit</ulink>. Unzip the file and rename <filename>Cyberbit.ttf</"
"filename> to <filename>cyberbit.ttf</filename>, since uppercase might "
"confuse your system."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3468
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Place <filename>cyberbit.ttf</filename> in a folder together with <ulink url="
"\"http://delloye.free.fr/Unicode.sfd\"><filename>Unicode.sfd</filename></"
"ulink>, and generate the <literal role=\"extension\">*.tfm</literal> and "
"<literal role=\"extension\">*.enc</literal> files with the command "
"<userinput><command>$ ttf2tfm cyberbit.ttf -w cyberbit@Unicode@</command></"
"userinput>. For some reasons, sometimes this does not produce the hundreds "
"of files it should. Should that be your case, you can download both <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.ece.uci.edu/~chou/unicode/cyberbit-tfm.tgz\"><literal role="
"\"extension\">*.tfm</literal></ulink> and <ulink url=\"http://www.ece.uci."
"edu/~chou/unicode/cyberbit-enc.tgz\"><literal role=\"extension\">*.enc</"
"literal></ulink> files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3479
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Place the <literal role=\"extension\">*.tfm</literal> files in an "
"appropriate folder, say <filename>$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/fonts/tfm/bitstream/"
"cyberbit/</filename>; the <literal role=\"extension\">*.enc</literal> files "
"may be installed in <filename>$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/pdftex/enc/cyberbit/</"
"filename>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3484
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now we need a map file to connect the <literal role=\"extension\">*.enc</"
"literal> files to the font. Download <ulink url=\"http://delloye.free.fr/"
"cyberbit.map\"><filename>cyberbit.map</filename></ulink> and install it in "
"<filename>$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/pdftex/config/</filename>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3489
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Download another file, <ulink url=\"http://delloye.free.fr/c70cyberbit.fd"
"\"><filename>c70cyberbit.fd</filename></ulink>, and place it in an "
"appropriate folder. You may choose, for example, <filename>$<envar>TEXMF</"
"envar>/tex/misc/</filename>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3494
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The last file we have to generate is a &PostScript; Type 1 font, necessary "
"to read &DVI; files generated with &latex;. Run the command "
"<userinput><command>$ ttf2pfb cyberbit.ttf -o cyberbit.pfb</command></"
"userinput>, and copy the resulting <filename>cyberbit.pfb</filename> in a "
"folder like <filename>$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/fonts/type1/cyberbit/</filename>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3500
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let's now place <filename>cyberbit.ttf</filename> among the fonts where "
"&latex; can find it. You could place it in a folder named <filename>"
"$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/fonts/truetype/</filename>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3504
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check the configuration file you find at <filename>$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/"
"web2c/texmf.cnf</filename>, and make sure that the line mentioning "
"<envar>TTFONTS</envar> is uncommented and points to the folder where you "
"saved <filename>cyberbit.ttf</filename>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3509
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To make it possible for &pdflatex; to use your &cjk; fonts, it is necessary "
"that you add a line in configuration file <filename>$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/"
"pdftex/config/pdftex.cfg</filename>. Add <userinput>map +cyberbit.map</"
"userinput> in the file to complete the configuration for &pdflatex;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3515
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To configure &latex; so that you can produce &DVI; files with &cjk; "
"characters, you have to add a line in file <filename>ttfonts.map</filename>. "
"The file might be in a folder named <filename>$<envar>TEXMF</envar>/ttf2pk/</"
"filename>, but you will probably have to look for it. Append the line "
"<userinput>cyberbit@Unicode@ cyberbit.ttf</userinput> to it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3522
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now, you only have to run <userinput><command>texhash</command></userinput> "
"and the system should be ready."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3527
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To test whether your configuration is correct, you can try to compile <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.math.nus.edu.sg/aslaksen/cs/sample-utf8.tex\">this test "
"file</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3532
#, no-c-format
msgid "&cjk; Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3534
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are many things that can go wrong when setting &cjk; support manually. "
"If something seems not to work, the following checklist might help you."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3540
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Obviously, since you run &latex; as a user and not as root, you must "
"<emphasis>allow</emphasis> ordinary users to access the new files. Make sure "
"all folders and files are accessible using the <command>chmod</command> "
"command."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If &latex; writes a &DVI; without problems, but you cannot view it, it is "
"almost certainly because of some problems in the automatic generation of "
"<literal role=\"extension\">*.pk</literal> fonts. They are supposed to be "
"generated on the fly when viewing a &DVI; file, but this might fail for a "
"number of reasons: double-check <filename>ttfonts.map</filename> for your "
"custom line first. However, it might happen that your <command>ttf2pk</"
"command> command, which is usually invoked by the &DVI; viewer, has been "
"compiled <emphasis>without</emphasis> support for the <application>kpathsea</"
"application> libraries. If this is the case, <userinput><command>ttf2pk</"
"command> <option>--version</option></userinput> will make no mention of "
"<application>kpathsea</application>. As support for these libraries is "
"necessary, you might have to find a new package, or recompile "
"<application>FreeType 1</application> by yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3567
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I input &cjk; in Unicode?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3569
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are a number of different input engines, and the choice can depend "
"also on personal preference. The author uses <ulink url=\"http://www.scim-im."
"org/projects/skim\"><application>Skim</application></ulink>, a port to &kde; "
"of the <ulink url=\"http://www.scim-im.org\"><application>Scim</"
"application></ulink> engine. Refer to your distribution's documentation to "
"learn how to install these programs. Configuration of such programs can be "
"tricky too, in the case of <application>Skim</application> you will have to "
"define an environment variable <userinput><envar>XMODIFIERS</envar>="
"\"@im=SCIM\"</userinput> <emphasis>before</emphasis> starting "
"<application>X</application>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3588
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3592
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting in &kile;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kile;-a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3594
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile;'s scripting feature allows for the execution of ECMAScript code. "
"Scripts can be managed through the scripting panel in the sidebar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3603
#, no-c-format
msgid "API Reference"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3605
#, no-c-format
msgid "In this section we describe &kile;'s scripting programming interface."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3608
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that the scripting API has not been finalized yet. The API "
"described below might change in future versions of &kile;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3614
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First of all, &kile;'s script execution environment provides a global object "
"called \"kile\", which owns the following methods:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3621
#, no-c-format
msgid "(kile).<function>currentTextDocument()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3623
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns a <classname>KileTextDocument</classname> object which reflects the "
"currently active text document. Returns <constant>null</constant> if no text "
"document is active."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3630
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(kile).<function>getInputValue(<parameter>caption</parameter>, "
"<parameter>label</parameter>)</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens a dialog with the given caption and label. Returns the value that user "
"has entered."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3639
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Objects of the type <classname>KileTextDocument</classname> represent text "
"documents in &kile;. They have the following properties:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3646
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>backspace()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3648
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Deletes the character that is located immediately before the current cursor "
"position and moves the cursor one position backward in the text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3655
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>cursorLeft()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3657
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moves the cursor one position backward in the text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3661
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>cursorRight()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3663
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moves the cursor one position forward in the text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3667
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(KileTextDocument).<function>insertText(<parameter>text</parameter>)</"
"function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3669
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Inserts the text contained in the variable <parameter>text</parameter> into "
"the document at the current cursor location."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3676
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>insertBullet()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3678
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserts a bullet into the document at the current cursor position."
msgstr "Odaberite red teksta trenutne pozicije kursora."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3682
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>nextBullet()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3684
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selects the first bullet located in the document immediately after the "
"current cursor location."
msgstr "Odaberite red teksta trenutne pozicije kursora."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3691
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>previousBullet()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3693
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selects the first bullet located in the document immediately before the "
"current cursor location."
msgstr "Odaberite red teksta trenutne pozicije kursora."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3700
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>up()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3702
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moves the cursor one line up in the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3706
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>down()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3708
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moves the cursor one line down in the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3712
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>cursorLine()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3714
#, no-c-format
msgid "Returns the line which the cursor is currently located at."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3718
#, no-c-format
msgid "(KileTextDocument).<function>cursorColumn()</function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3720
#, no-c-format
msgid "Returns the column which the cursor is currently located at."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3724
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(KileTextDocument).<function>setCursorLine(<parameter>line</parameter>)</"
"function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3726
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moves the cursor to the line denoted by <parameter>line</parameter>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:3730
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(KileTextDocument).<function>setCursorColumn(<parameter>column</parameter>)</"
"function>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3732
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moves the cursor to the column denoted by <parameter>line</parameter>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3743
#, no-c-format
msgid "Help"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3747
#, no-c-format
msgid "Help Documents"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3749
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&latex; is a rather sophisticated system, where basic features can be "
"expanded by a great variety of additional packages. &kile; provides numerous "
"different ways to aid the user."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:3756
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX Reference"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3757
#, no-c-format
msgid "An alphabetical index of the most common &latex; commands."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:3762
#, no-c-format
msgid "TeX Documentation"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3763
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&tetex;/&texlive; ships with a huge number of help documents. This includes "
"documentation for all the included packages and an additional &latex; "
"reference."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:3769
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>LaTeX</guimenu>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3770
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full reference for &tex; and friends. This is not only a description of "
"all programs, but some important packages are also mentioned. It also "
"includes a full reference manual of &latex; commands&mdash;ideal for looking "
"up a particular piece of formatting while writing a document. As this "
"document is really extensive, it is referenced in &kile; by three bookmarks."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:3779
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX Command"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3780
#, no-c-format
msgid "Another alphabetical index of the most common &latex; commands."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:3785
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX Subject"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3786
#, no-c-format
msgid "A description of important &latex; subjects."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:3791
#, no-c-format
msgid "LaTeX Env"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3792
#, no-c-format
msgid "An alphabetical index of the most common &latex; environments."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3802
#, no-c-format
msgid "Context Sensitive Help"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3804
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; also support a context sensitive help, which is called with <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>,<keycap>K</"
"keycap>. In <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure "
"Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Help</"
"guilabel></menuchoice> you can choose whether you want to use &kile;'s "
"&latex; reference or the help system of &tetex;/&texlive;, which is the "
"default setting."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3827
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searching for Keywords"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3829
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is not always easy to find the right document as &tetex;/&texlive; ships "
"with a huge number of help documents. In order to facilitate this process, "
"&tetex;/&texlive; provides a tiny program called <application>texdoctk</"
"application>. It provides a database of all the help documents, for which "
"&kile; offers a user-friendly interface."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3847
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the documents are grouped into categories. Additionally, one can search "
"for package names or keywords. &kile; will then show only the help documents "
"matching the search string."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3863
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A mouse double-click or the <keycap>Space</keycap> key will start a viewer "
"for the selected document. This can be an arbitrary document, not only a "
"&DVI;, PS, PDF or &HTML; document. &kile; takes the &kde; settings into "
"account in order to start an appropriate viewer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3873
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Defined Help"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3875
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Besides this static &tetex;/&texlive; documentation, &kile; also supports a "
"more flexible variable way for help documents. In the <guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu> menu &kile; has a special <guimenu>User help</guimenu> submenu, "
"where the user can add documents of his or her own choice. These can be the "
"most important documents of the &tetex;/&texlive; documentation, or even "
"self-written documents. It is also possible to enter URLs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3882
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure Kile...</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Help</guilabel></"
"menuchoice> and choose <guibutton>Configure</guibutton> button to configure "
"this <guimenu>User help</guimenu> menu. You can add, remove or move menu "
"entries around, and insert separators to optimize the structure of the menu."
msgstr ""
"Idite na <menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Konfiguriši "
"Kile...</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kile</guimenuitem><guilabel>Kompletiraj</"
"guilabel></menuchoice> da konfigurišete jednu ili više od ovih listi. Ovaj "
"režim koristi istu listu riječi kao i režim kompletiranja za &tex; i &latex; "
"komande."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3891
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Dialog: configure user defined help entries</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3897
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Dialog: configure user defined help entries</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3902
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button will open another dialog, "
"where you can edit the name of the menu entry, and choose the corresponding "
"file or &URL;. The second button right of text field launches &konqueror;, "
"which can be used to determine the correct &URL;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3908
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Dialog: add a new helpentry</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3914
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Dialog: add a new helpentry</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3919
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After finishing the configuration, all the entries will appear in the "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu of &kile; as a special menu entry <guimenu>User "
"help</guimenu>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3923
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Userhelp menu</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:3929
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Userhelp menu</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3940
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credits and License"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3942
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kile; is an open-source user-friendly &latex; / &tex; source code editor. "
"It runs on systems that have the &kde; Desktop Environment installed. &kde; "
"is available for several architectures including &Linux; and other Unix-like "
